Iza''aki nono Gaberahamo, Yakobo nono Giza''aki, Yuda nono Yakobo ba talifusönia andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 3, 'Feresi nono Yuda ba Sera, ononia khö Damara andrö. Eseromo nono Weresi. Aramo nono Geseromo.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 4, 'Aminadabi nono Garamo, Na''aso nono Gaminadabi, Salemo nono Na''aso.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 5, 'Boasi nono Zalemo, ononia khö Rakhaba andrö. Yobedi nono Mboasi, ononia khö Ruti andrö. Iza''i nono Yobedi.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 6, 'Dawido nono Giza''i, Dawido razo andrö. Selomo nono Dawido, ononia khö wo''omo Guria andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 7, 'Rehabeamo nono Zelomo. Abia nono Rehabeamo. Asa nono Gabia. Yozafati nono Asa.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 8, 'Yoramo nono Yozafati. Usia nono Yoramo.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 9, 'Yotamo nono Usia. Ahasi nono Yotamo.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 10, 'Hisikia nono Gahasi. Manase nono Hisikia. Amoni nono Manase.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 11, 'Yosia nono Gamoni. Yekhonia nono Yosia ba talifusönia andrö, me luo tefawu''a ira, me te''ohe ba Mbabilona.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 12, 'Ba me no aefa tefawu''a ira, me te''ohe ba Mbabilona, ba mo''ono Yekhonia, Selatieli nononia. Serubabeli nono Zelatieli. Abiudi nono Zerubabeli.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 13, 'Eliaki nono Gabiudi. Asori nono Geliaki. Sadoki nono Gasori.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 14, 'Akhimi nono Zadoki. Eliudi nono Gakhimi.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 15, 'Eleasari nono Geliudi. Matana nono Geleasari. Yakobo nono Matana.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 16, 'Yosefo nono Yakobo, Yosefo fo''omo Maria andrö, ina Yesu, nifotöi Keriso.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 17, 'Tobali fele öfa nga''ötö fefu, i''otarai Gaberahamo, irugi Dawido, ba fele öfa nga''ötö i''otarai Dawido, irugi tefawu''a ira, te''ohe ba Mbabilona; ba i''otarai tefawu''a ira, te''ohe ba Mbabilona, irugi Keriso, ba fele öfa nga''ötö zui.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 18, '

Ba si mane wa''atumbu Yesu Keriso andrö: Me no ifohu nina Yesu, Maria, Yosefo andrö, me lö sorudu ira na, ba terongo, manabina ia khö Geheha ni''amoni''ö.', '["Luk 1:26–38"]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 19, '

Ba iböhöi manö ia mena''ö Yosefo, soniha ya''ia, lö i''ombakha''ö, me niha satulö ia, lö edöna i''ailasi.', '["MozV 24:1 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 20, '

Ba me ifatou-tou tödönia da''ö, ba hiza, oroma khönia mala''ika Zo''aya ba wangifi, imane: He Yosefo, ma''uwu Dawido, böi ata''ufi wangai Maria andrö, nihamö; tabina andrö, si so ba dalunia ba no moroi ba Geheha ni''amoni''ö.', '["Rom 3:1"]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 21, '

Ba madono ia dania, ono matua, ba öbe''e töi nono andrö Yesu, me ya''ia zangefa''ö banuania ba horöra.', '["Luk 1:31; HalZin 4:12; 5:31"]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 22, 'Ena''ö itörö niŵa''ö Zo''aya, ni''ombakha''ö zama''ele''ö, andrö si manö da''ö fefu; imane sama''ele''ö andrö:', '["Luk 1:31; HalZin 4:12; 5:31"]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 23, '

Hiza, so dania nono alawe sanabina, ba madono ono matua, ba labe''e töi nono andrö "Emanu''eli", "awöda Lowalangi" geluahania, na la''ali [ba li niha].', '["Yes 7:14; TimI 3:16"]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 24, '

Ba me tokea Yosefo, ba i''o''ö niŵa''ö mala''ika Zo''aya andrö khönia, ihalö nihania.', '["Luk 2:7,21"]', NULL),
  (3394460, 'NT', 'Mataio', 1, 25, 'Ba lö orudu ira, irugi madono ia, ono matua, ba ibe''e töi nono Yesu.', '["Luk 2:7,21"]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 1, 'Ba me no tumbu Yesu ba Mbetilekhema, ba Yudaia, me luo razo Herode andrö, ba hiza gere, moroi ba danö ba gatumbukha, si möi ba Yeruzalema.', '["Luk 2:4 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 2, '

Lamane: Hezo razo Niha Yehuda andrö, sawena tumbu? No oroma khöma ndröfinia ba danö ba gatumbukha, ba möiga mangalulu khönia.', '["MozIV 24:17"]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 3, '

Ba me irongo da''ö razo andrö, Herode, ba tobali dödönia ba samba banua manö Yeruzalema, awönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 4, 'Ba ifalukha''ö gere sebua fefu, awö zangila amakhoita ba niha Yehuda, ba izofu-zofu khöra, hadia niŵa''ö, heza tumbu Keriso.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 5, '

Ba lamane khönia da''ö: Ba Mbetilekhema ba Yudaia, si mane sa ba zura zama''ele''ö:', '["Yoh 7:42","Mikh 5:1"]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 6, '"Ba ya''ugö, Betilekhema, ba danö mado Yuda, ma''ifu tenga fondrege zide-ide ndra''ugö ba zolohe mado Yuda andrö, me ba khöu i''otarai dania solohe andrö, sokubaloi banuagu andrö Iraono Gizeraeli."', '["Yoh 7:42","Mikh 5:1"]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 7, '

Awena ifakaoni''ö gere no mege Herode, ibini''ö wamakaoni''ö, ba izofu-zofu sibai khöra, ha mega oroma ndröfi andrö.', '["Yes 60:1"]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 8, 'Ba ifatenge ira ba Mbetilekhema, imane: Mi''ae''e, mi''alu-alui sibai, heza so nono andrö, ba na no misöndra, ba mi''ombakha''ö khögu, ena''ö möido göi mangalulu khönia.', '["Yes 60:1"]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 9, '

Ba me no larongo niŵa''ö razo andrö, ba möi ira, ba hiza ndröfi andrö, ni''ilara ba danö ba gatumbukha, mowaö-waö fönara, irugi tebato ia faudu zi so ono andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 10, 'Ba me la''ila ndröfi andrö ba omuso sibai dödöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 11, '

Ba möi ira yomo ba da''ö, ba hiza nono, awö ninania Maria, ba labalöduhini tou danö, mangalulu khönia ba labokai naha gana''ara, mamuala ira khönia, balaki ba kumöyö ba emuri.', '["Sin 72:10 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 12, '

Ba iŵa''ö khöra Lowalangi, ba wangifi, böi lafuli ira khö Herode; ba latörö lala bö''ö, wangawuli ba danöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 13, '

Ba me no mofanö ira, ba hiza mala''ika Zo''aya, sangoroma''ö ya''ia khö Yosefo, ba wangifi, imane: Faoso, ohe nono, awö ninania, ba oloi ba danö Miserayi ba ba da''ö iagö, irege muhededo khöu; i''alui sa dania nono Herode, ba wamakko ya''ia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 14, '

Ba maoso ia, i''ohe nono, awö ninania, ba zi bongi ba isaŵa danö Miserayi.', '["Hos 11:1"]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 15, 'Ba ba da''ö so ia irugi wa''amate Herode, ena''ö itörö niŵa''ö Zo''aya, ni''ombakha''ö zama''ele''ö andrö, me imane: "No ukaoni nonogu moroi ba danö Miserayi."', '["Hos 11:1"]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 16, '

Ba me i''ila Herode, no lalimo ia ere andrö ba mofönu sibai ia, ba ifatenge, ifabunu''ö fefu ndraono ba Mbetilekhema ba ba zi fasui fefu, i''otarai zi mendrua fakhe fa''ebua, no malö ba zide-ide moroi andrö, dali wa''ara andrö nizofu-zofunia ba gere andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 17, '

Ba da''ö itörö niŵa''ö Yeremia andrö, sama''ele''ö, me imane:', '["Yer 31:15"]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 18, '"No terongo wangarö-ngarö ba Rama, fege-ege, ba fange''esi sabölö-bölö; i''e''esi nononia Rakhela, ba lö edöna ia larara dödönia, me lö ya''ira sa''ae"', '["Yer 31:15"]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 19, '

Ba me no mate Herode, ba hiza mala''ika Zo''aya, sangoroma''ö ya''ia khö Yosefo, ba wangifi, ba danö Miserayi.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 20, 'Imane: Faoso, ohe nono, awö ninania ba fuli''ö ba danö Ndraono Gizeraeli, noa sa mate zamunu ono andrö ena''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 21, '

Ba maoso ia, i''ohe nono, awö ninania, ba isaŵa danö Ndraono Gizeraeli.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 22, 'Ba me irongo, no tobali razo Yudaia Gerikhela''o, fangali namania Herode, ba ata''u ia möi ba da''ö. Ba humede khönia Lowalangi, ba wangifi; ba isaŵa danö Galilaia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394461, 'NT', 'Mataio', 2, 23, '

Möi ia ba mbanua sotöi Nazareta, ena''ö itörö niŵa''ö zama''ele''ö, wa banua Nazareta dania döinia.', '["Luk 2:39; Yes 11:1; 53:2; Sakh 6:12"]', NULL),
  (3394462, 'NT', 'Mataio', 3, 1, 'Ba me luo da''ö, ba so Yohane andrö, samayagö idanö, mangombakha ia ba danö si mate, ba Yudaia, imane:', '["Ayati 1–12: Mar 1:1–8; Luk 3:1–20; Yoh 1:6–28","Faigi 4:17","Yes 40:3"]', NULL),
  (3394462, 'NT', 'Mataio', 3, 2, 'Mifalalini gera-erami, noa sa''ae ahatö mbanua zorugo andrö.', '["Ayati 1–12: Mar 1:1–8; Luk 3:1–20; Yoh 1:6–28","Faigi 4:17","Yes 40:3"]', NULL),
  (3394462, 'NT', 'Mataio', 3, 3, 'Da''ö sa niŵa''ö Yesaya, sama''ele''ö andrö, me imane: "So li zi''ao ba danö si mate, imane: Mihaogö lala Zo''aya, mifadaya lalania.', '["Ayati 1–12: Mar 1:1–8; Luk 3:1–20; Yoh 1:6–28","Faigi 4:17","Yes 40:3"]', NULL),
  (3394462, 'NT', 'Mataio', 3, 4, '

Ba baru Yohane andrö, ba bu gondra ba uli zaŵi mböbö talu, ba önia, ba tamo, awö ŵe ŵani ba gatua.', '["Luk 1:15; SalII 1:8"]', NULL),
  (3394462, 'NT', 'Mataio', 3, 5, '

Ba möi baero khönia mbanua Yeruzalema ba banua Yudaia andrö, fefu, awö mbanua si fatambai Yoridano, fefu.', '["HalZin 19:3,4"]', NULL),
  (3394462, 'NT', 'Mataio', 3, 6, 'Ba lafabayagö''ö idanö ira khönia ba Yoridano ba la''ombakha''ö horöra.', '["HalZin 19:3,4"]', NULL);


Ba me i''ila, ato zi möi khönia farizaio ba sadukaio, nibayagö idanö, ba imane khöra: He ya''ami, ono gulö! ha niha zangoroma''ö khömi lala wangefa ba wönu andrö dania?', '["Faigi 12:34; 23:33","Yoh 8:33 b.t.","Faigi 7:19; Yoh 15:6"]', NULL),
  (3394462, 'NT', 'Mataio', 3, 8, 'Mi''a''asogö sa''ae mbua-bua, si nangea bua-bua wamalalini era-era.', '["Faigi 12:34; 23:33","Yoh 8:33 b.t.","Faigi 7:19; Yoh 15:6"]', NULL),
  (3394462, 'NT', 'Mataio', 3, 9, 'Böi miwai, tola miŵa''ö tödömi: Furugöma Gaberahamo; uŵa''ö sa khömi, i''ila Lowalangi, ibali''ö ma''uwu Gaberahamo gara andre.', '["Faigi 12:34; 23:33","Yoh 8:33 b.t.","Faigi 7:19; Yoh 15:6"]', NULL),
  (3394462, 'NT', 'Mataio', 3, 10, 'Ba no mufaudugö wato ba ŵa''a geu, ba fefu döla geu sa''ae, si lö bua si sökhi, ba la''obö ba latibo''ö ba galitö.', '["Faigi 12:34; 23:33","Yoh 8:33 b.t.","Faigi 7:19; Yoh 15:6"]', NULL),
  (3394462, 'NT', 'Mataio', 3, 11, '

Ya''odo, ba idanö ubayagö khömi, ba wamalalini era-era, ba si so furigu dania, ba sabölö moroi khögu; ambö solohe badagahenia ndra''odo, ba Eheha ni''amoni''ö ba alitö ibayagö khömi da''ö.', '["HalZin 13:24,25; 2:3,4; Yes 4:4"]', NULL),
  (3394462, 'NT', 'Mataio', 3, 12, 'So ba dangania dörinia ba ihaogö golayama mbasitö khönia ba ulitö, ba ifa''anö ba halasa ba adaya andrö, ba itunu ba galitö si lö mate-mate.', '["HalZin 13:24,25; 2:3,4; Yes 4:4"]', NULL),
  (3394462, 'NT', 'Mataio', 3, 13, '

Me luo da''ö so Yesu, i''otarai Galilaia, isaŵa Yoridano, khö Yohane, ba wamabayagö''ö idanö ya''ia khönia.', '["Ayati 13–17: Mar 1:9–11; Luk 3:21,22; Yoh 1:31–34"]', NULL),
  (3394462, 'NT', 'Mataio', 3, 14, '

Ba itenaŵa ia Yohane, imane: Moguna sa khögu tebayagö idanö ndra''o khöu, ba möi ndra''ugö khögu?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394462, 'NT', 'Mataio', 3, 15, '

Ba itema linia Yesu, imane khönia: Lau manö ua; si manö sa zi nangea khöda, ba wolo''ö satulö andrö, hadia ia fefu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394462, 'NT', 'Mataio', 3, 16, '

Awena itehe khönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394462, 'NT', 'Mataio', 3, 17, '

Ba hiza li, si otarai zorugo, imane: Onogu da''ö, ono omasiö, wa''omasigu.', '["Yes 11:2; 42:1; Faigi 17:5; Luk 9:25; FetII 1:17"]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 1, 'Aefa da''ö, ba i''ohe ba danö si mate Yesu Eheha, ena''ö itandraigö ia Afökha.', '["Ayati 1–11: Mar 1:12,13; Luk 4:1–13","Heb 4:15; MozI 3"]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 2, 'Ba me lö si manga ia, öfa wulu wongi wa''ara, ba olofo ia, me aefa da''ö.', '["Ayati 1–11: Mar 1:12,13; Luk 4:1–13","Heb 4:15; MozI 3"]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 3, '

Ba möi khönia zanandraigö andrö, imane khönia: Na ono Lowalangi ndra''ugö, ba ŵa''ö, ena''ö tobali roti gara andre.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 4, '

Ba itema linia, imane: "Tenga ha ba gönia auri niha, ba ngawalö li fefu, si otarai mbawa Lowalangi, auri ia".', '["MozV 8:3"]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 5, '

Ba i''ohe ia ba mbanua ni''amoni''ö andrö Afökha, ba mbumbu gosali ifa''aso.', '["Sin 91:11 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 6, 'Ba imane khönia: Na ono Lowalangi ndra''ugö, ba tibo''ögö tou, noa sa so ba zura: "Iŵa''ö ba mala''ika andrö khönia dania, ba khömö andrö, ba lataya tangara ndra''ugö, fa lö manendre gaheu ba gara."', '["Sin 91:11 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 7, '

Imane khönia Yesu: So göi ba zura: "Böi tandraigö Zo''aya, Lowalangiu."', '["MozV 6:16"]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 8, '

Ba i''ohe zui ia Afökha, ifasao ba hili salaŵa sibai, i''oroma''ö khönia mbanua ba guli danö fefu, awö lakhöminia,', '[]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 9, 'ba imane khönia: Ahori ube''e khöu da''ö, na ötuhi danö, ba wangalulu khögu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 10, '

Ba imane khönia Yesu: Beta''ögö Satana! Noa sa so ba zura: "khö Zo''aya, Lowalangiu, mangalulu ndra''ugö ba ha ya''ia öfosumange".', '["MozV 6:13; Fam 22:8,9"]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 11, '

Awena iröi ia Afökha, ba hiza, ba la ondrasi ia mala''ika, möi ira ngoni-ngoninia.', '["Heb 1:14"]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 12, '

Ba me irongo Yesu, no tekuru Yohane, ba ifuli ia ba Galilaia.', '["Ayati 12–17: Mar 1:14,15; Luk 4:14,15","Faigi 14:3; Luk 4:14,15"]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 13, '

Ba iheta ia ba Nazareta, möi ia fatewu ba Gafanauma, ba zinga mbaŵa nidanö andrö, ba danö mado Nafetali, ba ngai mado Zebuloni.', '["Luk 4:16–31","Yes 9:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 14, 'Ena''ö itörö niŵa''ö Yesaya, sama''ele''ö andrö, me imane:', '["Luk 4:16–31","Yes 9:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 15, '"Tanö Ndraono Zebuloni ba tanö Ndraono Nafetali, tanö ba zinga mbaŵa, yefo Yoridano. Galilaia niha baero andrö, niha andrö,', '["Luk 4:16–31","Yes 9:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 16, 'sidadao ba zogömi-gömi, ba no la''ila haga sebua, ba no tumbu haga ba zidadao ba danö wa''amate ba ba lumö wa''amate."', '["Luk 4:16–31","Yes 9:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 17, '

I''otarai da''ö, ba ibörötaigö mangombakha Yesu, imane: Mifalalini gera-erami, noa sa''ae ahatö mbanua zorugo andrö!', '["Faigi 3:2"]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 18, '

Ba me mowaö-waö ia ba zinga mbaŵa Galilaia andrö, ba i''ila niha, si fatalifusö, Simoni, nifotöi Fetero ba Andrea talifusönia, lalau giri ba mbaŵa, me no tuka giri ira.', '["Ayati 18–22: Mar 1:16–20; Luk 5:1–11","Yoh 1:35 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 19, '

Ba imane khöra: Mi''o''ö ndra''o, ba ubali''ö sama''u''u niha ami.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 20, '

Ba i''anema''ö laröi giri, ba la''o''ö ia.', '["Faigi 19:27"]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 21, '

Ba me mofanö ia ba da''ö, ba i''ila danö bö''ö, darua zui, si fatalifusö göi, Yakobo, ono Zebedaio ba Yohane, talifusönia, no so ba dundraha, awö namara Sebedaio, mamönö kirira. Ba humede ia khöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 22, '

Ba la''anema''ö laröi dundraha, awö namara, ba la''o''ö ia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 23, '

Ba itöröi danö Galilaia ma''afefu, mamahaö ia ba zekola khöra ba manuriagö turia somuso dödö, turia mbanua Lowalangi andrö, ba ifadöhö ngawalö wökhö fefu, awö ngawalö wa''atebai, ba niha.', '["Faigi 9:35; HalZin 10:38"]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 24, '

Ba humöngö duriania ba danö Ziria ma''asagörö. Ba la''ohe khönia fefu zofökhö, hadia ia ngawalö wökhö, ma hadia ia zafökhö khöra, awö zobekhu, awö zaniri, awö zi no mate dambai, ba ifadöhö.', '["Mar 3:7 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394463, 'NT', 'Mataio', 4, 25, '

Ba ato zolo''ö ya''ia banua Galilaia, ba si fulu banua, ba banua Yeruzalema, ba banua Yudaia, ba banua yefo Yoridano andrö.', '["Luk 6:17 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 1, 'Ba me i''ila niha sato andrö, ba möi ia ba hili, ba me no mudadao ia, ba la''ondrasi ia nifahaönia.', '["Faza 5–7: faigi göi Luk 6:20–49"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 2, 'Ba ibörötaigö fahuhuo, ifahaö ira, imane:', '["Faza 5–7: faigi göi Luk 6:20–49"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 3, '

Ya''ahowu zi numana tödö, me khöra mbanua zorugo andrö.', '["Luk 6:20; Yes 57:15"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 4, '

Ya''ahowu zebolo tödö, me ya''ira zokhö uli danö dania.', '["Sin 126:5; KorII 7:10"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 5, '

Ya''ahowu zabu tödö, me ya''ira nirara tödö dania.', '["Sin 37:11"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 6, '

Ya''ahowu zolofo ba sowökhi tödö fa''atulö dödö andrö, me ya''ira ni''abusoi''ö dania.', '["Luk 6:21; Yoh 6:35"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 7, '

Ya''ahowu zahakhö tödö, me ya''ira nihakhösi tödö dania.', '["Faigi 25:35 b.t.; Luk 6:36; Yak 2:13"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 8, '

Ya''ahowu zohau-hau tödö, me ya''ira zangila Lowalangi dania.', '["Sin 24:3–5; YohI 3:2,3"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 9, '

Ya''ahowu zangatulö''ö niha, me ya''ira nofotöi ono Lowalangi dania.', '["Heb 12:14"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 10, '

Ya''ahowu nigohi ba wa''atulö dödö andrö, me khöra dania mbanua zorugo andrö.', '["FetI 3:14"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 11, '

Ya''ahowu ami, na la''o''aya ami niha, ba na lagohi ami, ba na siŵa mbalö laböbögö khömi si lö sökhi, na börö ndra''o.', '["Luk 6:22,23; FetI 4:14","Yak 5:10; HalZin 7:52"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 12, 'Mi''omusoi''ö dödömi ba mi''owua-wua''ö dödömi, me ebua luomi ba zorugo. No si manö göi ira, wolohi sama''ele''ö andrö, fönami.', '["Luk 6:22,23; FetI 4:14","Yak 5:10; HalZin 7:52"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 13, '

Ya''ami nasio ba guli danö. Ba na taya wa''asi-asi nasio, ba ha labe''e fangasi-ngasinia? Lö gunania sa''ae, hatö fanibo ya''ia, fa lahundra-hundra niha.', '["Mar 9:50; Luk 14:34–35"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 14, '

Ya''ami haga ba niha ba guli danö. Tebai tobini mbanua, si so ba hili yaŵa.', '["Fil 2:15","Mar 4:21; Luk 11:33","FetI 2:12"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 15, 'Lö''ö göi tatunu wandru ba tabalugö tumba yöu, tabe''e yaŵa ba naha wandru, ba ihagaini hadia ia, khöra fefu, si so yomo.', '["Fil 2:15","Mar 4:21; Luk 11:33","FetI 2:12"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 16, 'Yasimanö hagami andrö, yahumaga ba niha, ena''ö la''ila mbua-buami andrö, si sökhi, ba ena''ö lasuno Namami andrö, si so ba zorugo.', '["Fil 2:15","Mar 4:21; Luk 11:33","FetI 2:12"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 17, '

Böi miŵa''ö tödömi, ba wowu''ai oroisa, awö zura zama''ele''ö andrö, möi ndra''o; tenga ba wowu''ai, ba wolo''ö oroisa möi ndra''o.', '["Rom 3:31"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 18, '

Si ndruhu sa niŵa''ögu khömi, irugi adudu mbanua si yaŵa, awö danö, ba lö awu''a zambua dandra zura andrö, ba he si sambua niti, ba goroisa andrö, irege no ahori itörö.', '["Yes 40:8; Luk 16:17","Yak 2:10; Dan 12:3"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 19, 'Andrö, na so zowu''ai oroisa sambalö, fondrege zide-ide, ba na imanö wamahaö niha, da''ö nifotöi fondrege zide-ide ba mbanua zorugo andrö. Ba na so zolo''ö ya''ia, ba na samahaö niha ia, da''ö nifotöi sebua ba mbanua zorugo.', '["Yes 40:8; Luk 16:17","Yak 2:10; Dan 12:3"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 20, '

Uŵa ö sa khömi, na lö aröu tohude wa''atulö dödömi, moroi ba wa''atulö dödö zangila amakhoita andrö, ba moroi ba wa''atulö dödö Farizaio andrö, ba tebai möi ami ba mbanua zorugo andrö.', '["Faigi 23:2 b.t.; Luk 18:11–12"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 21, '

No mirongo, wa no muŵa''ö khö ndra tua: Böi ange''e; ba na so zange''e, ba göna ia huku.', '["MozII 20:13; 21:12","YohI 3:15"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 22, 'Ba ya''o, ba uŵa''ö khömi: Fefu, ha niha zofönu khö dalifusönia, ba si göna huku; ba sanguma''ö khö dalifusönia: "sowöhö mowa ndra''ugö", ba nihuku ba rafe sebua andrö, ba sanguma''ö "sowöhö ndra''ugö", ba si göna narako alitö.', '["MozII 20:13; 21:12","YohI 3:15"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 23, '

Andrö, na öbe''e game''elau ba naha wame''e sumange, ba na itörö tödöu ba da''ö so hadia ia zinegu dalifusöu khöu,', '["Mar 11:25","Faigi 6:14"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 24, 'ba röi ba da''ö game''elau föna naha wame''e sumange, ba ae ua, ba atulö''ö ndra''ugö khö dalifusöu, ba awena öfuli''ö, ba öbe''e game''elau andrö.', '["Mar 11:25","Faigi 6:14"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 25, '

Ta''i-ta''i folo''ö khö zi fa''udu khöu, fatua so ami ba lala, fa lö ibe''e ba danga zanguhuku andrö ndra''ugö si fa''udu khöu andrö, ba ibe''e ba danga wazuri ndra''ugö sanguhuku ba tebe''e ba gurunga ndra''ugö.', '["Faigi 18:34–35; Luk 12:58–59"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 26, 'Si ndruhu niŵa''ögu khöu, lö aefa''ö ba da''ö, na tosai zi sakefe ömöu, si lö mubu''a.', '["Faigi 18:34–35; Luk 12:58–59"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 27, '

No mirongo, wa no muŵa''ö: Böi ohorö!', '["MozII 20:14","Yob 31:1"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 28, 'Ba ya''o, ba uŵa''ö, khömi: Dozi, ha niha zamaigi ira alawe, wangisö ya''ia, ba no ihoröni tödönia.', '["MozII 20:14","Yob 31:1"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 29, '

Ba na i''alani ndra''ugö höröu kambölö, ba tema koe ia ba tibo''ö. Mohare''ö sa ba da''ö, na tekiko ndroto-ndrotou zambua, moroi tetibo ba narako mbotou ma''asambua.', '["Faigi 18:9; Mar 9:47; Gal 5:24"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 30, '

Ba na i''alani ndra''ugö tangau kambölö, ba tema eŵa ia ba tibo''ö. Mohare''ö sa ba da''ö, na tekiko ndroto-ndrotou zambua moroi tetibo ba narako mbotou ma''asambua.', '["Faigi 18:8; Mar 9:43"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 31, '

Ba no muŵa''ö: "Na so zangefa''ö ngambatönia ba yamube''e khönia zura wangefa''ö".', '["Mat 19:3–9; MozV 24","Luk 16:18; KorI 7:11"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 32, 'Ba ya''o, uŵa''ö khömi: Dozi, ha niha zangefa''ö ngambatönia, na tenga horö mbörö, ba samohorö ngambatönia da''ö, ba sangowalu ni''efa''ö, ba sohorö.', '["Mat 19:3–9; MozV 24","Luk 16:18; KorI 7:11"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 33, '

No mirongo göi, wa no muŵa''ö khö ndra tua: "Böi ae ba hölu, na si lö duhu, ba ötörö khö Zo''aya ba zi möi''ö ba hölu".', '["MozIII 19:12; MozIV 30:37","Yes 66:1; Faigi 23:16 b.t.","Sin 48:3"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 34, 'Ba ya''o, ba uŵa''ö khömi: Böi manö mi''ae ba hölu. Böi mibe''e hölu mbanua si yaŵa, me no dadaoma Lowalangi.', '["MozIII 19:12; MozIV 30:37","Yes 66:1; Faigi 23:16 b.t.","Sin 48:3"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 35, 'Ba böi göi tanö, me no dane-dane gahenia, ba böi göi Yeruzalema andrö, me no banua razo sebua.', '["MozIII 19:12; MozIV 30:37","Yes 66:1; Faigi 23:16 b.t.","Sin 48:3"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 36, 'Böi göi be''e hölu högöu, me sara mbu lö ö''ila ö''afusi''ö ba lö ö''ila ö''aitöni.', '["MozIII 19:12; MozIV 30:37","Yes 66:1; Faigi 23:16 b.t.","Sin 48:3"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 37, '

Da''ö wehedemi: ya''ia, na ya''ia! ba: lö''ö, na lö''ö! Ba moroi ba Gafökha zi töra da''ö.', '["Yak 5:12"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 38, '

No mirongo, wa no muŵa''ö: "Hörö fangali hörö ba ifö fangali nifö."', '["MozII 21:23–24","Luk 6:29; Amaed 24:29"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 39, 'Ba ya''o, ba uŵa''ö khömi: Böi milaŵa zi lö sökhi andrö. Ba na so zamalisi bo''ömö kambölö, ba oro''ö khönia zi tambai göi.', '["MozII 21:23–24","Luk 6:29; Amaed 24:29"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 40, '

Ba na so zangadugö ya''ugö, ba wangai barumö, ba lulu khönia lembe göi.', '["KorI 6:7"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 41, '

Ba na so zamorege khöu, ba wolohe ya''ugö awönia ba lala zi saza fa''aröu, ba ae awönia zi dua za.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 42, '

Be''e ba zangandrö khöu, ba böi erogö, na so zamalali khöu hadia ia.', '["MozV 15:7 b.t.; Luk 6:30,34"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 43, '

No mirongo, wa no muŵa''ö: "Omasi''ö zahatö khöu, ba yafatiu dödöu ba zi fatiu tödö khöu."', '["MozIII 19:18; 23:3 b.t.","Amaed 25:21–22; Luk 6:27 b.t.; Luk 23:34; HalZin 7:60; FetI 3:9; Rom 12:14–20","Luk 6:35; Efes 5:1"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 44, 'Ba ya''o, ba uŵa''ö khömi: Mi''omasi''ö zi fatiu tödö khömi ba mi''angandrö, salahi zolohi ya''ami;', '["MozIII 19:18; 23:3 b.t.","Amaed 25:21–22; Luk 6:27 b.t.; Luk 23:34; HalZin 7:60; FetI 3:9; Rom 12:14–20","Luk 6:35; Efes 5:1"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 45, 'ena''ö tobali ono Namami andrö, si so ba zorugo, ami, me ifatumbu''ö luonia andrö ba zi lö sökhi ba ba zi sökhi, ba teu andrö khönia, ba ibe''e ba zatulö ba ba zi lö atulö.', '["MozIII 19:18; 23:3 b.t.","Amaed 25:21–22; Luk 6:27 b.t.; Luk 23:34; HalZin 7:60; FetI 3:9; Rom 12:14–20","Luk 6:35; Efes 5:1"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 46, '

Na mi''omasi''ö sa zomasi ya''ami, ba hadia luomi? Tenga lamanö göi sanema beo andrö?', '["Luk 6:32"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 47, 'Ba na ha talifusömi mi''owai, ba hadia zi sökhi nilaumi? Tenga lamanö göi niha baero?', '["Luk 6:32"]', NULL),
  (3394464, 'NT', 'Mataio', 5, 48, '

Andrö yamo''ahonoa ami, si mane fa''amo''ahonoa Namami andrö ba zorugo.', '["Luk 6:36; Kol 3:15"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 1, 'Ba mifaigi wa''atulömi andrö, böi ha ba zanehe niha atulö ami, ena''ö la''ila ami; ba na si manö, ba lö luomi khö Namami andrö, si so ba zorugo.', '["Faigi 23:5"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 2, '

Andrö, na öbe''e game''ela ba zi numana, ba böi falau''ö dorofe fönau, si mane samini tödö andrö, ba zekola ba ba newali, ena''ö lasuno ira niha. Si ndruhu niŵa''ögu khömi, no latema luora.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 3, '

Ba na mame''e ame''e la ndra''ugö ba zi numana, ba böi ya''i''ila tangau kabera hadia nilau dangau kambölö,', '["Rom 12:8","Luk 14:14"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 4, 'ena''ö lö oroma game''elamö andrö; ba isulöni khöu Amau andrö, sangila si tobini.', '["Rom 12:8","Luk 14:14"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 5, '

Ba na mangandrö ami, ba böi simane samini tödö ami. Noa sa omasi ira ba zekola so''ira, ba ma ba newali, ba waerua lala misa, na mangandrö ira, afura oroma ira ba niha. Sindruhu niŵa''ögu khömi, no latema luora.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 6, '

Ba ya''ugö, na mangandrö''ö, ba ae si bakha ba mbate''e khöu ba kusi mbawandruhö khömö, ba angandrö khö Namau andrö, ba zi tobini, ba isulöni khöu Amau andrö, sangila si tobini.', '["SalII 4:33"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 7, '

Ba na mangandrö ami, ba böi mi''oya''ö li, si mane niha baero; lawai sa tefondro-ndrongo khöra, ba wa''oya lira.', '["SalI 18:26; Yes 1:15","Sin 38:10"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 8, 'Andrö böi mifaomagö ami khöra, noa sa i''ila Amami andrö, hadia zoguna khömi, he lö''ö na ni''andrömi khönia.', '["SalI 18:26; Yes 1:15","Sin 38:10"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 9, '

Andrö mimane wangandrö: He Ama khöma si so ba zorugo! Yate''amoni''ö döiu.', '["Luk 11:2–4; Sin 115:1"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 10, '

Yatobali banuau fefu niha. Ya''itörö zomasi ndra''ugö, hulö ba zorugo, yasimanö göi ba gulidanö.', '["Luk 17:20 b.t.; 22:42; Sin 103:21"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 11, '

Öma sirugi ma''ökhö be''e khöma ma''ökhö andre.', '["Amaed 30:8"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 12, '

Ba efa''ö khöma horöma, si mane fangefa''öma sala ba zi so sala khöma.', '["Faigi 18:21 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 13, '

Ba böi ohe ndra''aga ba wanandraigö, ba efa''öga ba Gafökha. Me khöu mbanua, awö wa''abölö, awö lakhömi, irugi zi lö aetu. Yaduhu.', '["Faigi 26:41; KorI 10:13; TimII 4:18"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 14, '

Na mi''efa''ö sa''ae zala niha ba i''efa''ö göi khömi Amami andrö, si so ba zorugo.', '["Mar 11:25,26; Kol 3:13"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 15, 'Ba na lö mi''efa''ö zala niha, ba lö''ö göi i''efa''ö khömi horömi Amami andrö.', '["Mar 11:25,26; Kol 3:13"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 16, '

Ba na mamoni ami, ba böi mifangerau mbawami, si mane samini tödö; me labalugö mbawara, afura oroma ira ba niha, ba wamonira andrö. Si ndruhu niŵa''ögu khömi no latema luora.', '["Yes 58:5"]', NULL);


Ba ya''ugö, na mamoni''ö, ba bayoini högöu ba sasai mbawau;', '[]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 18, 'ena''ö lö oroma ba niha, na mamoni''ö, ba ena''ö oroma khö Namau andrö, si so ba zi tobini, ba isulöni khöu Amau andrö, sangila si tobini.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 19, '

Böi mihöna khömi girö-girö ba guli danö, nifakiko hama ba ni''a howu, nikharu zanagö ba nitagö.', '["Faigi 19:21; Luk 16:9","Luk 12:33; TimI 6:17 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 20, 'Ba zorugo mihöna khömi girö-girö, ba zi lö ifakiko hama, ba zi lö i''a howu, ba zi lö lakharu sanagö, ba zi lö latago.', '["Faigi 19:21; Luk 16:9","Luk 12:33; TimI 6:17 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 21, '

Ba zi so girö-girö khöu sa, ba da''ö göi so dödöu dania.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 22, '

Haga mboto hörö; na si sökhi höröu, ba mohaga mbotou ma''asambua.', '["Luk 11:34 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 23, 'Ba na no mofökhö höröu, ba ogömi-gömi mbotou ma''asambua. Andrö, na no sogömi-gömi haga andrö, si so ba dödöu, ba ha wa''abölö wa''ogömi-gömi andrö.', '["Luk 11:34 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 24, '

Tebai enoni zi darua niha, ma fa''udu ia ba zi samösa ba i''omasi''ö zi samösa, ba ma zui molemba ia ba zi samösa, ba i''ositengagö zi samösa. Tebai enoni Lowalangi ami ba enoni gana''a göi.', '["Luk 16:13; KorII 6:14 b.t.; SalI 18:21"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 25, '

Andrö uŵa''ö khömi: Böi mi''abusi tödö nosomi, hadia mbalazomi, ba ma botomi, hadia nukhami. Tenga no ebua noso, moroi ba gö, ba tenga no ebua mboto, moroi ba nukha?', '["Ayati 25–33: Luk 12:22–31","Fil 4:6; FetI 5:7"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 26, '

Mifaigi wofo andrö, ba dalu mbanua, lö manaru ira ba lö mamasi, lö mangöhöna ba halasa ira, ba ibalazoi ira Amami andrö, si so ba zorugo. Tenga no aröu faehu ami wofo?', '["Faigi 10:29–31"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 27, 'Ba ha niha ba khömi zangila mondrou''ö fa''anau nosonia samba si''u, na i''abusi tödö?', '["Faigi 10:29–31"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 28, '

Ba ba nukha, ba hana wa mi''abusi tödö? Mitöngöni ladari mböhö andrö ba danö, he wisa wanöinia, lö mohalöŵö ia, lö managu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 29, 'Ba uŵa''ö khömi, lö si manö wa''asökhi nukha Zelomo, ba lakhöminia andrö fefu, si mane nukha zi sara da''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 30, 'Ba na imanö Lowalangi wamonukha du''u ba danö, si so ma''ökhö andre, nitibo''ö ba galitö mahemolu, ba tenga mendrua manö imanö khömi, ya''ami sambö famati?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 31, '

Andrö böi mibusi dödömi ba böi miŵa''ö: Ha ma''a? ma: ha mabadu? ma: ha ma''onukha?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 32, 'A''oi sa ni''alui niha baero da''ö fefu; no''a sa i''ila Amami andrö, ba zorugo, wa soguna khömi da''ö fefu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 33, '

Mi''ofönai''ö wangalui banua Lowalangi andrö, awö wa''atulö dödö andrö khönia, ba tebe''e nönö-nönö dania khömi da''ö fefu.', '["Luk 10:42; 12:31"]', NULL),
  (3394465, 'NT', 'Mataio', 6, 34, '

Andrö böi mi''abusi tödö zoguna mahemolu; mahemolu tesöndra lala zabu dödö mahemolu. Noa manö wamakao zi sara-sara ngaluo.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 1, 'Böi mihuku niha,[1] fa böi tehuku ami.[2]', '["Ayati 1–5: Luk 6:37–42","Rom 2:1 b.t.; 14:10","Mar 4:24"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 2, 'Hadia huku nifatörömi ba niha bö''ö, da''ö nifatörö khömi zui dania; ba su''a-su''a ni''anu''a''ömi, ba la''anu''a''ö zui dania ba wanu''a khömi.[3]', '["Ayati 1–5: Luk 6:37–42","Rom 2:1 b.t.; 14:10","Mar 4:24"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 3, 'Ba hana wa ö''ila golowingö, si so ba hörö dalifusöu, ba lö ba dödöu mboto geu andrö ba hörömö?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 4, 'Ba hadia wa öŵa''ö khö dalifusöu: Base''ö, da''uheta golowingö andrö ba höröu, ba hiza mboto geu ba hörö khöu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 5, 'Ofönai''ö ba höröu, wangeheta boto geu andrö, samini tödö, ba awena dania öfaigi wameta olowingö andrö ba hörö dalifusöu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 6, 'Böi mibe''e ö nasu ni''amoni''ö andrö, ba böi mitibo''ö ba mba''o mbawi mani-mani andrö khömi, fa böi lahundragö ahera bawi ba fa böi labali''ö ira furi, ba wanasawi ya''ami.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 7, 'Mi''angandrö ba tebe''e khömi; mi''angalui, ba misöndra, mibökö-bökö mbawandruhö, ba tebokai khömi.[4] [5]', '["Ayati 7–11: Luk 11:9–13","Faigi 21:22; Yoh 14:14"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 8, 'Dozi sangandrö manema, ba sangalui, ba isöndra, ba khö zamökö-mökö bawandruhö, ba tebokai.', '["Ayati 7–11: Luk 11:9–13","Faigi 21:22; Yoh 14:14"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 9, 'Ma ha niha ba khömi niha, same''e khö nononia kara, na i''andrö roti khönia?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 10, 'Ba ma same''e ulö, na i''andrö gi''a?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 11, 'Andrö, na mi''ila mibe''e ba ndraonomi game''ela si sökhi, ya''ami si lö sökhi, ba tenga mendrua manö ibe''e zi sökhi Amami andrö, si so ba zorugo, ba zangandrö khönia?[6]', '["Yak 1:5,6,17"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 12, 'Andrö, fefu hadia ia zomasi ami lalau khömi niha, da''ö göi milau khöra; da''ö sa goroisa andrö ba da''ö niŵa''ö zama''ele''ö andrö.[7]', '["Luk 6:31; Rom 13:8–10"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 13, 'Mitörö mbawa göli sise-ise andrö, me no ebua mbawa göli ba me no ebolo lala saekhu ba wa''atekiko andrö, ba me no ato zanörö ya''ia.[8]', '["Luk 13:24"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 14, 'Ba me no ide-ide mbawa göli ba me no ise-ise lala saekhu ba wa''auri andrö, ba me lö ato zanöndra ya''ia.', '["Luk 13:24"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 15, 'Mi''angelamaisi zama''ele''ö andrö, si falimo, si möi khömi, si so nukha mbiri-biri, ba bakha, ba asu gatua, si manga niha, ira.[9]', '["Faigi 24:4,5,24; HalZin 20:29","Luk 6:44; Yak 3:12"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 16, 'Ba mbua-buara aboto ba dödömi ira. Hadia, teteteu mbua nagu ba za''a-sa''a mao, ba ma bua marafala ba lato?[10]', '["Faigi 24:4,5,24; HalZin 20:29","Luk 6:44; Yak 3:12"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 17, 'Si manö wa i''owua mbua si sökhi fefu geu si sökhi, ba eu sobou, ba i''owua mbua si lö sökhi.[11]', '["Faigi 12:33 b.t.","Faigi 3:10"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 18, 'Tebai i''owua mbua si lö sökhi eu si sökhi ba tebai i''owua mbua si sökhi eu sobou.', '["Faigi 12:33 b.t.","Faigi 3:10"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 19, 'Fefu geu si lö mowua bua si sökhi, ba te''obö ba tetibo''ö ba galitö.[12]', '["Faigi 12:33 b.t.","Faigi 3:10"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 20, 'Andrö, ba mbua-buara aboto ba dödömi ira.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 21, 'Lö dozi molala dania ba mbanua zorugo andrö si faso''aya khögu, wanguma''ö: He So''aya! he So''aya! ha solo''ö somasi Namagu andrö, si so ba zorugo.[13]', '["Luk 6:46; Yak 1:22–25"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 22, 'Ato dania zanguma''ö khögu, na luo da''ö: He So''aya! he So''aya! Hadia, tenga töimö khöma, ba wama''ele''ö, ba hadia, tenga töimö khöma, wamofanö bekhu, ba hadia, tenga no oya nifazökhima tandra, soroi ba döimö andrö?[14]', '["Luk 13:25 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 23, 'Ba ha da''ö dania, ba lö ubini''ö khöra, umane: Lö urai fa''ila khömi, miheta ami khögu, ya''ami solau si lö atulö.[15]', '["Faigi 25:41"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 24, 'Andrö, fefu ha niha zamondrongo niŵa''ögu andre, ba solo''ö, ba ba niha satua-tua, sanaru''ö omonia ba zokara, fakhili-khili ia.[16]', '["Luk 6:47,48; Yoh 13:17"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 25, 'Ba ilau teu sabölö-bölö, so molö, ilau angi, itörö nomo andrö, ba lö aso''a ia, me no nitaru''ö ba dete gara.', '["Luk 6:47,48; Yoh 13:17"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 26, 'Ba fefu ha niha zamondrongo niŵa''ögu andre, si lö molo''ö, ba ba niha sambö tödö, sanaru''ö omonia ba gawu nasi, fakhili-khili ia.[17]', '["Luk 6:49","Hes 13:11 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 27, 'Ba ilau teu sabölö-bölö, so molö, ilau angi, itörö nomo andrö, ba aso''a, abölö-bölö wa''aso''ania.[18]', '["Luk 6:49","Hes 13:11 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 28, 'Ba tobali, me no i''o''ozui huhuonia andrö Yesu, ba tobali dödö zato ba wamahaönia.[19]', '["Mar 1:22; Luk 4:32"]', NULL),
  (3394466, 'NT', 'Mataio', 7, 29, 'Me no famahaö zabölö wamahaönia ya''ira, ba tenga si mane ba zangila amakhoita andrö khöra.', '["Mar 1:22; Luk 4:32"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 1, 'Ba ato zolo''ö ya''ia,[1] me möi ia mitou, moroi ba hili.', '["Ayati 1–4: Mar 1:40–45; Luk 5:12–15"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 2, 'Ba hiza zobou auri[2], si möi khönia, mangalulu khönia, imane: He Tua, ö''ila öfadöhö wökhögu, na edöna ndra''ugö.', '["Sobou auri no sambua wökhö nifobörö bakteri sotöi Mycobacterium leprae samofökhö uli ba uo nifotöi saraf. Ibunu raso bakteri andre, irege lö taraso afökhö guli heŵa''ae ibörögö obou irugi atoru manö ia. Ba ginötö Yesu ata''u sibai niha wökhö andre. Andrö latibo''ö baero mbanua niha si göna sobou auri."]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 3, 'Ba i''oro''ö dangania, ibabaya, imane: Edöna ndra''o, yadöhö! Ba i''anema''ö döhö mbou aurinia.', '["Luk 17:14; MozIII 14:2 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 4, 'Ba imane khönia Yesu: Faigi, fa böi ö''ombakha''ö ba niha, ba ae oroma''ö ndra''ugö khö gere ba be''e game''ela andrö, niŵa''ö Moze, ba wamaduhu''ö khöra.[3]', '["Luk 17:14; MozIII 14:2 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 5, 'Ba me möi ia miyomo ba Gafanauma[4] ba i''ondrasi ia kumandra, mangandrö khönia, imane:', '["Ayati 5–13: Luk 7:1–10"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 6, 'He Tua, so yomo zawuyugu, tou ba zalo manö, no mate dambai, a''oi so wa''afökhö.', '["Ayati 5–13: Luk 7:1–10"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 7, 'Imane khönia: Möido mufadöhö wökhönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 8, 'Ba itema linia kumandra andrö, imane: He Tua, ambö ndra''o möi''ö ba nomogu,[5] ba hede manö, ha sambua li, ba döhö wökhö zawuyugu.[6]', '["Ambö ndra''o: tenga da''a zi so ba teks asli ba li Yunani. Ba da''ö tesura οὐκ ἱκανὸς (ouk hikanos) eluahania tenga sinangea. Andrö famo''eluaha satulönia: He Tua, tenga sinangea ndra''o na möi''ö ba nomogu. Ba hiza hede manö sambua li, ba döhö wökhö zawuyugu.","Sin 107:20"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 9, 'Ya''odo sa göi, ba no niha si so barö mbawa zalaŵa, ba so barö mbawagu zaradadu, ba na uŵa''ö ba zi samösa: Ae''e, ba mofanö ia, ba ba zi samösa: Aine, ba so ia; ba na uŵa''ö khö zawuyugu: Halöŵöu da''ö, ba ihalö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 10, 'Ba me irongo da''ö Yesu, ba ahöli-höli dödönia, ba imane ba zolo''ö ya''ia: Si ndruhu niŵa''ögu khömi, ba Ndraono Gizeraeli na i, ba lö nisöndragu famati si manö.', '["Luk 13:29","Faigi 23:13; 25:30"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 11, 'Ba uŵa''ö khömi, ato dania zi otarai danö ba gatumbukha, awö zi otarai danö ba gaekhula ba manga ira, awö ndra Aberahamo, Iza''aki, Yakobo ba mbanua zorugo andrö,[7]', '["Luk 13:29","Faigi 23:13; 25:30"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 12, 'ba nitibo''ö baero nono mbanua andrö ba zogömi-gömi, baero sibai, ba fege-ege dania ba da''ö, ba fatangisa mboha.[8]', '["Luk 13:29","Faigi 23:13; 25:30"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 13, 'Ba imane Yesu khö gumandra andrö: Fuli''ö, ya''itörö zi faduhu dödöu. Ba ba da''ö sibai döhö wökhö zawuyu no mege.[9]', '["Faigi 9:22,29; 15:28"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 14, 'Ba me möi yomo Yesu ba nomo Wetero,[10] ba i''ila matuania ira alawe, tou ba zalo, akhömö.[11]', '["Ayati 14–17: Mar 1:29–34; Luk 4:38–40","KorI 9:5"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 15, 'Ba ira''u danga ba döhö wa''akhömö, maoso ia mangai gö Yesu.', '["Ayati 14–17: Mar 1:29–34; Luk 4:38–40","KorI 9:5"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 16, 'Ba me bongi, ba ato la''ohe khönia sobekhu; ba ifofanö mbekhu linia ba dozi sofökhö, ba ifadöhö wökhö.', '["Yes 53:4; FetI 2:24"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 17, 'Ena''ö itörö niŵa''ö Yesaya, sama''ele''ö andrö, me imane: No iheta wa''atebaida ba no yaia zolu''i fökhöda[12]', '["Yes 53:4; FetI 2:24"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 18, 'Ba me i''ila Yesu, ato niha, sowulo khönia, ba iŵa''ö la''ötö mbaŵa.[13]', '["Luk 8:22"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 19, 'Ba i''ondrasi ia sangila amakhoita, samösa, imane khönia: He samahaö, u''o''ö ndra''ugö, gofu heza möi''ö.[14]', '["Luk 9:57 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 20, 'Ba imane khönia Yesu: So dögi narö hili ba zigölu[15] ba so gazuni ba wofo ba dalu mbanua, ba khö Nono Niha, ba lö naha wemörö.[16]', '["Sigölu: tenga da''a zi so ba teks asli Yunani. Ba da''ö tesura ἀλώπεκες (alōpekes), aurifö ba gatua si hulö asu (li Indonesia rubah). Satulönia asu gatua tenga sigölu.","KorII 8:9"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 21, 'Ba imane khönia nifahaö bö''ö: He Tua, tehe khögu, ena''ö möido ua mogo''o amagu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 22, 'Ba imane khönia: O''ö ndra''o ba ndramuko''o zi mate khöra niha si mate.[17]', '["Efes 2:1 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 23, 'Ba me möi ia baowo,[18] ba la''o''ö ia nifahaönia.', '["Ayati 23–27: Mar 4:35–41; Luk 8:23–25"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 24, 'Ba hiza, ilabu bade sabe''e ba mbaŵa andrö, tobali tehawu dulu nowo, ba ya''ia, ba no mörö.', '["Ayati 23–27: Mar 4:35–41; Luk 8:23–25"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 25, 'Ba la''ondrasi ia, lasusugi, lamane: Tolo Tua, tekiko ita!', '[]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 26, 'Ba imane khöra: Ha lö ata''u ami, sambö famati![19] Awena maoso ia, itenaŵa nangi, awö ndrulu, ba tobali ahono sibai.[20]', '["Ha lö atau''u ami: ba teks asli Yunani tesura hana wa ata''u sibai ami","Faigi 14:31; Sin 107:29"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 27, 'Ba ahöli-höli dödö niha, lamane: Ha niha da''ö, me lafondro-ndrongo göi linia angi ba dulu?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 28, 'Ba me irugi si yefo,[21] danö mbanua Gadara, ba falukha ia niha sobekhu, darua, la''otarai lewatö, no owöhö sibai, tebai itörö lala andrö niha bö''ö labe''e.', '["Ayati 28–34: Mar 5:1–20; Luk 8:26–39"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 29, 'Ba hiza, mu''ao ira, lamane: Hadia niŵa''öu khöma, Ono Lowalangi? Hadia, ba wamakao ya''aga möi''ö ba da''e, ba tenga inötö na?[22]', '["Mar 1:24; Luk 4:41"]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 30, 'Ba so ba da''ö, saröu khöra, mbawi, sambawa sebua, nikubaloi.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 31, 'Ba la''andrö khönia bekhu andrö, lamane: Na öfofanö ndra''aga, ba fatengega ba mbawi si sambawa andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 32, 'Ba imane khöra: Mi''ae''e.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 33, 'Ba moloi gubalo, lasaŵa mbanua, ba la''ombakha''ö da''ö fefu, ba hadia ia ba zobekhu andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394467, 'NT', 'Mataio', 8, 34, 'Ba hiza, möi ira baero, samba banua manö, ba wamaondragö Yesu, ba me la''ila ia, ba la''andrö khönia, ena''ö iheta ia ba danöra andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 1, 'Ba möi ia baowo,[1] isaŵa si yefo, mbanuara.', '["Ayati 1–8: Mar 2:1–12; Luk 5:17–26"]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 2, 'Ba hiza, la''ohe khönia zi mate dambai, si mörö-mörö ba gaso.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 3, 'Ba hiza, lamane dödöra ösa, sangila amakhoita: Sangaoha-ngaoha da''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 4, 'Ba me i''ila gera-erara Yesu, ba imane: Hana wa lö sökhi gera-erami, ba dödömi bakha?[2]', '["Yoh 2:24,25"]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 5, 'He zaoha ira sa, fanguma''ö: No te''efa''ö khöu horöu, ba ma fanguma''ö: Faoso, ba owaö-waö?', '["Yoh 2:24,25"]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 6, 'Ba ena''ö mi''ila, tola i''efa''ö Ono Niha horö ba guli danö (ba awena imane ba zi mate dambai andrö): Faoso, fazaŵa gasomö ba fuli''ö khömi.[3]', '["Yoh 5:8"]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 7, 'Ba maoso ia, ifuli ia khöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 8, 'Ba me la''ila da''ö niha sato, ba ata''u ira ba lasuno Lowalangi, same''e fa''abölö si manö ba niha.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 9, 'Ba, me itörö Yesu,[4] me i''otarai da''ö, ba i''ila niha, sidadao ba naha wanema beo, Mataio döinia, ba imane khönia: O''ö ndra''o. Ba maoso ia, i''o''ö.', '["Ayati 9–13: Mar 2:13–17; Luk 5:27–32"]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 10, 'Ba me manga ia yomo, ba hiza, ato zi möi sanema beo, awö zebua horö, orudu manga ira khö Yesu ba khö nifahaönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 11, 'Ba me la''ila da''ö farizaio, ba lamane ba nifahaönia: Hana wa orudu manga zamahaö ya''ami ba zanema beo ba ba zebua horö?[5]', '["Luk 15:2"]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 12, 'Ba imane, me irongo da''ö: Ba zabölö, ba lö moguna zame''e dalu-dalu, ha ba zofökhö moguna.', '["Faigi 12:7; Hos 6:6; TimI 1:15"]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 13, 'Ba mi''ae mibe''e ba dödömi, hadia niŵa''ö andrö: "Fa''ahakhö dödö zomasido, ba tenga sumange." Tenga sa ba wogaoni satulö möi ndra''o, ha ba wogaoni si so horö.[6]', '["Faigi 12:7; Hos 6:6; TimI 1:15"]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 14, 'Ba da''ö möi khönia nifahaö Yohane andrö, lamane: Hana ndra''aga ba farizaio, wa mamoni ba gö ndra''aga, ba lö''ö sa mamoni nifahaömö?[7]', '["Luk 18:12"]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 15, 'Ba imane khöra Yesu: Hadia, tola abu dödö zi möi ba walöŵa, fatua awöra zangowalu? Ba irugi baŵa dania, ba aheta khöra zangowalu, ba awena dania mamoni ba gö ira.[8]', '["Yoh 3:29"]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 16, 'Ba lö sombalo baru satua balo-balo si bohou; asika zui sa mbaru, ba zinga mbalo-balo andrö, ba tobali ebua zasikania.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 17, 'Ba lö''ö göi lalau nagu si bohou ba nahia satua. Ba na lalau, ba asika nahia andrö ba aduwa nagu ba tekiko nahia. Ba nahia si bohou lalau nagu si bohou, ba faoma lö hadia ia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 18, 'Me iŵa''ö khöra da''ö,[9] ba hiza zalaŵa, si möi yomo, mangalulu khönia, imane: No mate mege nonogu alawe, ba ae tufa ia tangau, ba auri ia.', '["Ayati 18–26: Mar 5:22–43; Luk 8:41–56"]', NULL),
  (3394468, 'NT', 'Mataio', 9, 19, 'Ba maoso Yesu, i''o''ö, awö nifahaönia.', '[]', NULL);








Lahalö sa wandrura sambö tödö andrö, ba lö la''ohe wanikha.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 4, 'Ba satua-tua andrö, ba la''ohe wanikha ba nahia, fabaya fandrura.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 5, '

Ba me ara zangowalu, ba manuköu ira fefu ba mörö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 6, '

Ba me talu mbongi, ba so zi''ao: Hiza zangowalu, mi''ae mifaondragö ia!', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 7, '

Awena maoso nono alawe andrö fefu ba lahaogö wandrura.', '["Luk 12:36"]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 8, '

Ba lamane sambö tödö andrö ba zatua-tua: Mibe''e fanikhama wanikhami ma''ifu, mate sa wandruma andre.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 9, 'Ba latema lira satua-tua, lamane: Ma dania faoma ambö khöda; sökhi na möi ami ba zolafo, ba na mi''öli khömi.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 10, '

Ba me no möi ira mowöli, ba so zangowalu, ba si no mama''anö, ba möi yomo, awönia ba walöŵa, ba lakusi mbawandruhö.', '["Luk 13:25 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 11, '

Ba aefa da''ö, ba so göi nono alawe no mege, si tosai, lamane: He Tua! he Tua! bokai khöma!', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 12, '

Ba itema lira, imane: Si ndruhu niŵa''ögu khömi, lö u''ila, ha niha ami.', '["Faigi 7:22,23; Luk 13:27"]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 13, '

Andrö böi miförö, me lö mi''ila mbaŵa, awö ginötö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 14, '

Hulö niha sofanö: Humede ia ba zawuyunia, ibe''e ba dangara zi so khönia.', '["Ayati 14–30: Luk 19:11–28"]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 15, '

Ibe''e ba zi samösa, ba lima balaki, ba ba zi samösa, ba dua balaki, ba ba zi samösa, ba samba fondruyu, dali wa''abölö zamösana, ba mofanö ia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 16, '

Ba i''anema''ö möi nibe''e si lima balaki, ilau ba waniaga, ba fabali.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 17, '

Si manö göi nibe''e si dua balaki, fabali ibe''e.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 18, '

Ba nibe''e si samba fondruyu, ba möi mogo''oli tanö, ibini''ö bakha gana''a zokhö ya''ia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 19, '

Ba me no ara, ba so zokhö sawuyu andrö, ba mangerai ömö ia khöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 20, '

Ba i''ondrasi ia nibe''e si lima balaki, i''ohe göi zi lima balaki harenia, imane: Lima balaki nibe''eu ba dangagu, Tua, faigi, lima balaki tö, nisöndragu, harenia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 21, '

Imane khönia sokhö ya''ia: Lau, sawuyu si sökhi, si lö faröi; lö si faröi ndra''ugö ba zi lö oya-oya, ba ube''e barö mbawau zoya; tabu ba wa''omuso dödö andrö khö zokhö ya''ugö.', '["Faigi 24:45,47"]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 22, '

Ba i''ondrasi göi ia nibe''e si dua balaki, imane: Dua balaki nibe''eu ba dangagu, Tua, faigi dua balaki tö nisöndragu harenia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 23, '

Imane khönia sokhö ya''ia: Lau, sawuyu si sökhi, si lö faröi; lö si faröi ndra''ugö ba zi lö oya-oya, ba ube''e barö mbawau zoya; tabu ba wa''omuso dödö andrö khö zokhö ya''ugö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 24, '

Ba i''ondrasi ia göi nibe''e si samba fondruyu andrö, imane: He Tua, no u''ila ndra''ugö, wa niha sabe''e huku ndra''ugö; mamasi ndra''ugö ba zi lö nitarumö ba mangozara''ö ba zi lö nifazaeweu,', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 25, 'ba no ata''u ndra''o, ba no möido mubini''ö zi samba fondruyu andrö khöu barö danö; ba ya''ae khöu gana''au.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 26, '

Ba itema linia sokhö ya''ia, imane khönia: He sawuyu si lö sökhi, sareu! Na no ö''ila mamasi ndra''o, ba zi lö nitarugu ba mangozara ndra''o, ba zi lö nifazaewegu;', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 27, 'ba öbe''e mena''ö nifalali wirögu andrö, ba zamalali ana''a, ba na so ndra''o, ba utema ena''ö gana''agu, fabaya hare.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 28, '

Ba mihalö khönia zi samba fondruyu andrö, ba mibe''e ba zi so si fulu balaki.', '["Faigi 13:12"]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 29, 'Dozi sa, ba zi so ba tebe''e na ba tehöna khöra; ba ba zi lö ö, ba teheta göi zi so khönia.', '["Faigi 13:12"]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 30, '

Ba sawuyu andrö, si lö guna, ba mitibo''ö baero ba zogömi-gömi. Ba fege-ege dania ba da''ö ba fatangisa mboha.', '["Faigi 8:12"]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 31, '

Ba na so Nono Niha, na si so lakhömi ia, na fao khönia mala''ika andrö fefu, ba da''ö dania dumadao ia ba dadaoma lakhöminia andrö.', '["Faigi 16:27; Luk 21:27"]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 32, '

Ba te''owuloi dania fönania fefu soi, ba iföfö''ö ira, si mane na iföfö''ö ira mbiri-biri si alawe mbiri-biri si matua kubalo.', '["Rom 14:10; KorII 5:10"]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 33, '

Ba ifa''aso ba gambölönia mbiri-biri si alawe, ba ba gaberania mbiri-biri si matua.', '["Hes 34:17 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 34, '

Ba imane dania razo andrö ba zi so ba gambölönia: Mi aine, ya''ami, nifahowu''ö Namagu, mitema gondröita andrö, banua andrö, ni''asiwai khömi, i''otarai mbö öta danö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 35, '

Me olofo ndra''o, ba no mibe''e gögu; me owökhi dödögu, ba no nifabadugö khögu nidanö; me tome ndra''o, ba no mifa''amöido yomo;', '["Yes 58:7"]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 36, 'me lö nukhagu, ba no mifonukha ndra''o; me mofökhö ndra''o, ba no möi ami mufaigi ndra''o; ba me sodo ba gurunga, ba no möi ami khögu.', '["Yes 58:7"]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 37, '

Ba latema dania linia satulö andrö, lamane: He Tua, ha mega ma''ila solofo ndra''ugö, ba mabe''e göu! ba ma sowökhi tödö ndra''ugö, ba mafabadugö khöu nidanö?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 38, 'Ba ha mega ma''ila, tome ndra''ugö, ba mafa''amöi''ö yomo? ba ma si lö nukha ndra''ugö, ba mafonukha''ö?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 39, 'Ba ha mega ma''ila sotökhö ndra''ugö, ba ma si so ba gurunga, ba möiga khöu?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 40, '

Ba itema dania lira razo andrö, imane khöra: Si ndruhu niŵa''ögu khömi, ndrege nilaumi ba dalifusögu andrö, fondrege zi numana, ha niha ia, ba khögu no milao da''ö.', '["Faigi 10:40; Amaed 19:17; Mar 3:35"]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 41, '

Awena dania imane göi ba zi so ba gabera: Milabu ami, ya''ami, ni''elifi, mi''ae ba galitö andrö, si lö mate-mate, ni''ebua''ö khö Gafökha andrö ba ba mala''ikania.', '["Faigi 7:23; Yes 30:33; Fam 20:10,15; 21:8"]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 42, '

Olofo ndra''o, ba lö nibe''emi ögu; owökhi dödögu, ba lö nifabadugömi khögu;', '["Yak 4:17"]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 43, 'tome ndra''o, ba lö nifa''amöimi yomo ya''o; lö nukhagu, ba lö nifonukhami ya''odo; mofökhö ndra''o, ba ba gurunga sodo, ba lö si möi ami mamaigi ya''o.', '["Yak 4:17"]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 44, '

Ba latema dania linia, ya''ira göi, lamane: He Tua, ha mega ma''ila solofo ndra''ugö, ba ma sowökhi tödö, ba ma tome, ba ma si lö nukha, ba ma sofökhö, ba ma si so ba gurunga ndra''ugö, si lö si möiga ngoni-ngoniu?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 45, '

Ba itema dania lira, imane: Si ndruhu niŵa''ögu khömi, ndrege zi lö nilaumi khö wondrege zi numana andrö, ha niha ia, ba khögu göi lö nilaumi da''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394489, 'NT', 'Mataio', 25, 46, '

Ba möi da''ö ba wa''afökhö si lö aetu andrö, ba satulö andrö, ba möi ba wa''auri si lö aetu.', '["Dan 12:2; Yoh 5:29"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 1, 'Ba me no i''o''ozui Yesu huhuonia andrö fefu, ba imane khö ndra nifahaönia:', '["Ayati 1–5: Mar 14:1,2; Luk 22:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 2, '

Mi''ila, dua wongi tö wasa, ba tebe''e ba danga niha Nono Niha, ba wamoröfa ya''ia.', '["fasa: ba teks asli Yunani tesura πάσχα (pascha) (li Indonesia paskah). Fasa andre no sambua gowasa sebua ba gotalua ndraono Gizaraeli. Ba da''ö latörö tödöra wa''aefara moroi ba wangosawuyu ba danö Miserayi. Lafalua da''a 8 ngaluo wa''ara. Töi pascha tehalö moroi ba li Ibrani pesach, eluahania mangötö ma motalu''i. Meluo da''ö itöröi wamunu ndraono sa''a ba danö Miserayi So''aya, ba ena''ö italu''i nomora So''aya, lafahö nono mbiri-biri iraono Gizaraeli ba lafa''osi ndronia yaŵa mbawa ndruhö.","Yoh 13:1"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 3, '

Ba falukha ndra ere sebua ba satua mbanua, baolayama gere sebua andrö, sotöi Kayafa.', '["Yoh 11:47 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 4, 'Ba mamagölö ira, ena''ö la''onekhesi wondra''u Yesu, ba wamunu ya''ia.', '["Yoh 11:47 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 5, 'Ba lamane: Böi ba gowasa, fa lö aekhu niha.', '["Yoh 11:47 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 6, '

Ba me so ba Mbetania Yesu, ba nomo Zimoni andrö, sobou auri, ba i''ondrasi ia ira alawe,', '["Ayati 6–13: Mar 14:3–9; Yoh 12:1–8"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 7, 'so khönia zamba buli-buli wanikha samohua, sebua böli, ba ifaduwa ba högö Yesu, me manga ia.', '["Ayati 6–13: Mar 14:3–9; Yoh 12:1–8"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 8, '

Ba me la''ila da''ö nifahaö, ba kumökö-kökö ira, lamane: Hadia wa la''alimagösi?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 9, 'Tola sa la''amawa mena''ö, ebua mböli, ba labe''e ba zi numana mena''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 10, '

Ba me i''ila da''ö Yesu, ba imane khöra: Hadia wa mibusi dödö ndra alawe andre? si sökhi sa nilaunia khögu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 11, 'Lö''ö sa mamalö-malö khömi zi numana, ba ya''odo, ba tenga si lö mamalö-malö khömi.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 12, 'Ba wangehao ya''o, ba wogo''o ya''o, ilau ba nösigu wanikha andre.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 13, '

Si ndruhu niŵa''ögu khömi, fefu gofu heza, ba nituriagö turia somuso dödö andrö, ba guli danö ma''asagöro, ba da''ö göi te''ombakha''ö nilau da''e, ba wanörö tödö ya''ia.', '["Faigi 24:14"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 14, '

Ba möi zi samösa, awö zi felendrua, si so töi Yuda, banua Kariota, isaŵa gere sebua, imane:', '["Ayati 14–16: Mar 14:10,11; Luk 22:3–6","Sakh 11:12; MozII 21:32; Faigi 27:9"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 15, 'Ha wa''ebua mibe''e khögu, ba u''ombakha''ö ia khömi? Ba latulo khönia zi tölu ngafulu rufia.', '["Ayati 14–16: Mar 14:10,11; Luk 22:3–6","Sakh 11:12; MozII 21:32; Faigi 27:9"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 16, '

Ba i''otarai da''ö, ba i''alui lala, ba wangombakha ya''ia.', '["TimI 6:9,10"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 17, '

Ba me baŵa roti si lö mu''aisöni, si föföna, ba möi khö Yesu ndra nifahaö, lamane: Hezo zomasi''ö ma''asiwai khöu, ba wemanga wasa?', '["Baŵa roti si lö mu''aisöni: ba teks asli Yunani tesura ἀζύμων (azymōn), eluahania lö fangaisö. To''ölö la''oguna''ö wangaisö (li Indonesia ragi) na labogo roti, ena''ö manöi roti andrö ba asoso. Ba hiza börö me anaösö-naösö ndraono Gizeraeli woloi moroi ba danö Miserayi, lö fakhamö la''oguna''ö wangaisö nifotöi ragi no mege. Molo''ö MozII 12:14 silötolalö la''owasaini da''a iraono Gizeraeli ba wanörötödö wa''aefara moroi ba wangosawuyu ba danö Miserayi. Andrö wa fagölö geluahara Owasa roti si lö mu''aisöni ba wasa fasa (paskah).","Ayati 17–20: Mar 14:12–16; Luk 22:7–18","MozII 12:3 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 18, '

Ba imame: Mi''ae miyomo ba mbanua, khö zane, ba mimane khönia: Da''ö niŵa''ö zamahaö khöu: No ahatö ginötö andrö khögu; ba khöu u''a wasa, awö ndra nifahaögu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 19, '

Ba la''o''ö nifahaö andrö niŵa''ö Yesu khöra, ba la''asiwai wasa andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 20, '

Ba me bongi sa''ae, ba möi ia manga, awö zi felendrua andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 21, '

Ba me manga ira, ba imane: Si ndruhu niŵa''ögu khömi, fasamösa ami zi manga mböligu.', '["Ayati 21–25: Mar 14:18–21; Luk 22:21–23","Yoh 13:21 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 22, '

Ba abu sibai dödöra, ba labörötaigö lamane khönia, dozi ira: Hadia, ya''odo, Tua?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 23, '

Ba itema lira, imane: Si falulu manga khögu, da''ö zi manga mböligu.', '["Sin 41:10; Yoh 13:18,26","Sin 22; Yes 53; Luk 22:19,20"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 24, 'Möi sa Nono Niha, itörö nisura andrö ba khönia, ba alai niha andrö, si manga mböli Nono Niha: mohare mena''ö niha andrö, na lö irai tumbu.', '["Sin 41:10; Yoh 13:18,26","Sin 22; Yes 53; Luk 22:19,20"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 25, '

Ba itema linia Yuda andrö, si manga mbölinia, imane khönia: Ma ya''odo, samahaö? Ba imane khönia: Ya''ia niŵa''öu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 26, '

Ba me manga ira, ba ihalö roti Yesu, ifahowu''ö, iboboto ba ibe''e khö ndra nifahaö ba imane: Mitema, mi''a, botogu da''e.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 27, '

Ba ihalö mako, i''aohasi gölö Lowalangi, ibe''e khöra ba imane:', '["Mat 20:28; MozII 24:8; Yer 31:31 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 28, 'Mibadu, dozi ami, dogu sa da''e, do gamabu''ula li andrö, saduwa dania salahi zato, ba wangefa''ö horö.', '["Mat 20:28; MozII 24:8; Yer 31:31 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 29, '

Ba uŵa''ö khömi, lö''ö sa''ae ubadu nösi mbua nagu andrö, i''otarai da''e, irugi luo wamadugu si bohounia, ba mbanua Namagu andrö, awömi.', '["Luk 22:18,29,30"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 30, '

Ba me no aefa manunö ira, ba möi ira baero ba gahe hili wanikha andrö.', '["Ayati 30–35: Mar 14:26–31","Luk 21:37; 22:39"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 31, '

Ba imane khöra Yesu: Dozi te''ala ami ba khögu bongi andre. Noa sa so ba zura: "Ubago dania gubalo andrö, ba muzaewe mbiri-biri andrö, nikubaloi."', '["Sakh 13:7; Yoh 16:32"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 32, '

Ba na aefa maoso ndra''o, ba mowaö-waödo ba Galilaia, fönami.', '["Faigi 28:7,16"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 33, '

Ba itema linia Fetero, imane khönia: Ba he dozi te''ala ira ba khöu, ba ya''o, ba tebai te''ala.', '["Luk 22:33 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 34, '

Imane khönia Yesu: Si ndruhu niŵa''ögu khöu, bongi andre, lö fakhamö miŵo zilatao, ba no medölu ö''osilö''ögö ndra''o.', '["Yoh 13:38"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 35, '

Imane khönia Fetero: Ba he mate ena''ö ndra''o, awöu, ba lö u''osilö''ögö ndra''ugö. Ba si manö wanguma''ö ndra nifahaö fefu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 36, '

Ba irugi Yesu halama, Gezemane döinia, fao ira khönia. Ba imane khö ndra nifahaö: Midadao ba da''e, fatua möido ba da''ö, ba wangandrö.', '["Ayati 36–46: Mar 14:32–42; Luk 22:40–46"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 37, '

Ba i''ohe awönia Wetero, ba ono Zebedaio andrö, si darua, ba ibörötaigö abu dödö ba alangu dödö.', '["Faigi 17:1; Yes 53:7"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 38, '

Ba imane khöra: Abu sibai dödögu, irugi wa''amate; mi''iagö da''e, böi miförö, awögu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 39, '

Ba möi ia, lö aröu, ifalögu ia tou, mangandrö ia, imane: He Ama, na so lala, ba yamutalu''i ndra''o mako andrö. Ba böi somasi ndra''o, ha somasi ndra''ugö.', '["Faigi 20:22; Yoh 5:7,8"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 40, '

Ba möi ia khö ndra nifahaö andrö, ba no mörö ira, me irugi, ba imane khö Wetero: Ba tebai si lö mörö ami mato saza, awögu?', '["FetI 5:8; Gal 5:17"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 41, 'Böi miförö, ba mi''angandrö, fa lö itörö ami fanandraigö. Aoha sa gölö dödö, ba no sambö fa''abölö nösi.', '["FetI 5:8; Gal 5:17"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 42, '

Ba ifuli möi, zamuza tö, mangandrö ia, imane: He Amagu! na te''ai italu''i ndra''o, fa lö ubadu ia, ba ya''itörö zomasi ndra''ugö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 43, '

Ba me ifuli ia ba noa zui mörö ira, me irugi, noa sa abua guli höröra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 44, 'Ba iröi ira, ifuli möi mangandrö, no medölu, si manö-manö linia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 45, '

Aefa da''ö, ba möi ia khö ndra nifahaö andrö, ba imane khöra: Ba miförö sa''ae, ba mi''olombase! — Hiza, no fadege, fa tebe''e ba danga niha si so horö Nono Niha.', '[]', NULL);


Mifaoso, talabu, hiza no ahatö zi manga mböligu andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 47, '

Ba me humede ia na, ba hiza Yuda andrö, awö zi felendrua, ba ato zi fao khönia; so wöda ba bago gama, la''otarai gere sebua ba satua mbanua andrö.', '["Ayati 47–57: Mar 14:43–50; Luk 22:47–53; Yoh 18:3–12","Bago gama: ba teks asli Yunani tesura ξύλων (xylōn), eluahania eu famözi ma bago-bago. Te''oguna''ö ia i''otarai me föna irugi ma''ökhö (faigi gambara)."]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 48, 'Ba no iŵa''ö khöra dandra si manga mbölinia andrö, no imane: Si fa''ago bawa ndra''o, da''ö ia, da''ö mira''u.', '["Ayati 47–57: Mar 14:43–50; Luk 22:47–53; Yoh 18:3–12","Bago gama: ba teks asli Yunani tesura ξύλων (xylōn), eluahania eu famözi ma bago-bago. Te''oguna''ö ia i''otarai me föna irugi ma''ökhö (faigi gambara)."]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 49, '

Ba i''anema''ö i''ondrasi Yesu, imane: He samahaö? ba fa''ago bawa ia khönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 50, '

Ba imane khönia Yesu: He le, hadia, wa so ndra''ugö? Awena la''ondrasi, lababaya Yesu, lara''u.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 51, '

Ba hiza, ituyu wödania si samösa, awö Yesu, isöbi, ihare''ö khö zawuyu gere sebua, i''eŵa dalingania, si sambua.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 52, '

Ba imane khönia Yesu: Saembugö wödamö! Dozi sa sangai föda, ba föda wamunura.', '["MozI 9:6; Rom 13:4","Luk 24:44"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 53, 'Ma öwai tebai mangandrö ndra''o khö Namagu, ena''ö ifatenge awögu iada''e mala''ika, töra felendrua legio?', '["MozI 9:6; Rom 13:4","Luk 24:44"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 54, 'Ba he wisa itörö ba da''ö niŵa''ö ba zura? Lö tola lö''ö, si manö lala.', '["MozI 9:6; Rom 13:4","Luk 24:44"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 55, '

Ba da''ö iŵa''ö Yesu ba zato andrö: Hulö ba zamara''u möi ami, no moföda ami ba mobago gama, ba wondra''u ya''o. Ba no ero ma''ökhö mudadao ndra''o ba gosali, mamahaö, ba lö nira''umi ya''o.', '["Yoh 18:20"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 56, 'Ba andrö si manö da''ö fefu, ena''ö itörö zi so ba zura zama''ele''ö andrö.', '["Yoh 18:20"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 57, '

Ba la''ohe Yesu sondra''u ya''ia andrö, la''ohe khö gere sebua andrö, Kayafa, ba zi falukha zangila amakhoita ba satua mbanua andrö.', '["Ayati 57–68: Mar 14:53–65; Luk 22:54,63–71; Yoh 18:12–14,24"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 58, '

Ba i''o''ö Fetero, aröu moroi furi, irugi golayama gere sebua andrö, ba möi ia bakha, dumadao ia ba ngai genoni, ba wamaigi lua-lua.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 59, '

Ba la''alui ere sebua ba salaŵa rafe sebua andrö fefu, he lawisa wamöbögö horö khö Yesu, ba wamunu ya''ia,', '["HalZin 6:13"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 60, 'ba lö lasöndra, he ŵa''ae ato zi so samöbögö, sofaya.', '["HalZin 6:13"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 61, '

lamane: No iŵa''ö da''ö: u''ila ududugö gosali Lowalangi andrö, ba ha tölu ngaluo u''angotomosi''ö.', '["Sin 35:11; 100:2; MozV 19:15","Faigi 27:40; Yoh 2:10"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 62, '

Ba maoso gere sebua, imane khönia: Hadia, lö ötema li ba niböbögö da''e khöu?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 63, '

Ba lö hede-hede Yesu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 64, '

Imane khönia Yesu: Ya''ia niŵa''öu. Ono Lowalangi ndra''odo. Ba uŵa''ö khömi, i''otarai da''e, ba mi''ila, dumadao Nono Niha ba gambölö wa''abölo andrö, ba mi''ila so ia moroi sa, ba dete lawuo, ba mbanua si yaŵa.', '["Dan 7:13; HalZin 7:55"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 65, '

Awena isika nukhania ere sebua, imane: No mangaoha-ngaoha ia! Hadia guna zi so ba mbörö sa''ae khöda? hiza, faefa mirongo wangaoha-ngaoha andrö.', '["Yoh 10:33 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 66, 'He wisa ba dödömi?', '["Yoh 10:33 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 67, '

Ba ladidiloi mbawania, lagukhui ia, ba so göi zamalisi bawania,', '["Yes 50:6"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 68, 'lamane: Fa''ele''ö khöma, Keriso, ha niha zamösi ya''ugö?', '["Yes 50:6"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 69, '

Ba no dumadao Wetero baero ba golayama.', '["Ayati 69–75: Mar 14:66–72; Luk 22:55–62; Yoh 18:16–18,25–27"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 70, '

Ba i''osilö''ögö fönara fefu, imane: Lö u''ila hadia niŵa''öu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 71, '

Ba me itörö mbawa göli, we''amöi baero, ba i''ila ia tanö bö''ö, ba imane ba zi so ba da''ö: Awö Yesu, banua Nazareta, da''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 72, '

Ba ifuli i''osilö''ögö, fahölu ia, imane: Lö u''ila, ha niha da''ö.', '["Faigi 16:16"]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 73, '

Ba lö ara gotalua, ba möi khö Wetero zi so ba da''ö, lamane khönia: Duhu, samösa göi ndra''ugö khöra, ifa''ele''ö sa göi ndra''ugö liu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 74, '

Ba ibörögö i''elifi ia ba fahölu, imane: Lö u''ila, ha niha da''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394491, 'NT', 'Mataio', 26, 75, '

Ba itörö tödö Wetero niŵa''ö Yesu, me imane: Lö fakhamö miwo zilatao, ba no medölu ö''osilö''ögö ndra''o.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 1, 'Ba me no moluo, ba mamagölö ndra ere sebua fefu, awö zatua mbanua andrö, ba khö Yesu, ba wamunu ya''ia.', '["Mar 15:1; Luk 22:66–71","Faigi 20:19; Luk 23; Yoh 18:28"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 2, 'Ba laböbö ia, la''ohe, labe''e ba danga gumandru, Filato.', '["Mar 15:1; Luk 22:66–71","Faigi 20:19; Luk 23; Yoh 18:28"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 3, '

Ba me i''ila Yuda andrö, si no manga mbölinia, la''etu''ö huku, ba mangesa dödönia; ba ifuli zi tölu ngafulu rufia, ba gere sebua ba ba zatua mbanua andrö,', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 4, 'imane: Horögu, me no u''a mböli ndro zi lö horö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 5, '

Ba itibo''ö ba gosali rufia andrö ilau mofanö, möi ia muhie mbaginia.', '["HalZin 1:18"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 6, '

Ba lahalö rufia andrö ira ere sebua, lamane: Lö tola tabe''e ba naha game''ela, me böli ndro.', '["HalZin 1:19"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 7, 'Ba mamagölö ira, ba labe''e böli mbenua zamözi bowoa andrö, nibe''e lewatö zikoli.', '["HalZin 1:19"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 8, 'Andrö labe''e töi mbenua andrö mbenua ndro, irugi ma''ökhö andre.', '["HalZin 1:19"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 9, '

Ba da''ö itörö niŵa''ö Yeremia andrö, sama''ele''ö, me imane: "Ba lahalö zi tölu ngafulu rufia andrö, böli nifatö böli andrö, nifatö Ndraono Gizeraeli böli,', '["Sakh 11:13"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 10, 'ba labe''e böli mbenua zamözi bowoa andrö; u''o''ö niŵa''ö Zo''aya khögu."', '["Sakh 11:13"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 11, '

Ba föna gumandru so Yesu. Ba isofu khönia kumandru, imane: Hadia, razo niha Yehuda ndra''ugö?', '["Ayati 11–26: Mar 15:2–15; Luk 23:2–4,17–25; Yoh 18:33–40"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 12, '

Ba me la''adugö ia ere sebua ba satua mbanua andrö, ba lö''ö manö itema li.', '["Faigi 26:63"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 13, '

Ba imane khönia Filato: Hadia, lö örongo, hadia ia fefu, wangadugöra ya''ugö?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 14, '

Ba lö itema linia, sambua li lö''ö, töbali ahöli-höli sibai dödö gumandru.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 15, '

Ba no muböwögö, ero na owasa ibe''e aefa kumandru ba zato zamösa nikuru, ha niha zomasi ira.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 16, 'Ba so khöra nikuru, safaito, me luo da''ö, Baraba döinia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 17, '

Ba me owulo ira, ba imane khöra Filato: Ha niha zomasi ami, u''efa''ö khömi, Baraba andrö, ba ma Yesu andrö, nifotöi Keriso?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 18, 'Noa sa i''ila, börö wa''afökhö dödö, wa labe''e ia ba dangania.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 19, '

Ba me dumadao ia ba dadaoma zanguhuku, ba ifatenge khönia fo''omonia, imane: Böi babaya niha satulö andrö, noa sa tefakao sibai ndra''o, ba khönia andrö, ba wangifi me owi.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 20, '

Ba lafawe''e zato ira, ere sebua ba satua mbanua andrö, ena''ö la''andrö Mbaraba andrö, ba ena''ö lafakiko Yesu.', '["HalZin 3:13,14"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 21, '

Ba humede kumandru, imane khöra: Ha niha zomasi ami u''efa''ö khömi, ba zi darua andrö?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 22, '

Imane khöra Filato: Ba he uwisa khö Yesu andrö, nifotöi Keriso?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 23, '

Lamane fefu: Niforöfa!', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 24, '

Ba me i''ila Filato, lö''ö manö manandrösa, ba tedou manö wagua-guasa, ba ihalö nidanö, isasai dangania, föna zato, imane: Lö horögu ba ndro da''e; mifaigi he miwisa.', '["MozV 21:6 b.t.; Sin 26:6"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 25, '

Ba latema linia niha sato fefu, lamane: Yamöi ba huluma ndronia ba ba hulu ndraonoma.', '["Faigi 23:35; HalZin 5:28"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 26, '

Ba aefa da''ö, ba i''efa''ö khöra Mbaraba andrö, ba Yesu, ba ifabözi''ö ba ibe''e niforöfa.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 27, '

Ba la''ohe ba gödo Yesu saradadu gumandru andrö, ba la''owuloi khönia zi sabari andrö fefu.', '["Ayati 27–30: Mar 15:16–19; Yoh 19:1–3"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 28, '

Ba laheta khönia nukhania, ba lafobaru ia baru luo soyo.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 29, 'Ba lalalau dakula doi ba lafotakula ia ba sara zukhu labe''e ba dangania kambölö, ba latuhi danö fönania, la''o''aya ia, lamane: Ya''ugö, razo niha Yehuda?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 30, 'Ba ladidiloi ia, lahalö zukhu no mege, ba lahare''ö ba högönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 31, '

Ba me no aefa la''o''aya ia, ba laheta khönia mbaru luo andrö, ba lafonukha ia nukhania, ba la''ohe ia misa, ba wamoröfa ya''ia.', '["Ayati 31–44: Mar 15:20–32; Luk 23:26,33–39; Yoh 19:16–24"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 32, '

Ba me möi ira baero, ba falukha ira niha, banua Girene, Simoni döinia, ba lara''u da''ö, ba wolohe röfania.', '["Heb 13:12,13"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 33, '

Ba me larugi naha andrö, sotöi Gologota —', '["Agu nifaruka awökhu: Asese lafabadugö da''a ba niha nifakao me föna ena''ö ambö taraso khöra wamakaora.","Sin 69:22; Amaed 31:6"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 34, 'sokamu''u geluaha — ba lafabadugö khönia nagu nifaruka awökhu, ba me no itandra, ba lö edöna ibadu.', '["Agu nifaruka awökhu: Asese lafabadugö da''a ba niha nifakao me föna ena''ö ambö taraso khöra wamakaora.","Sin 69:22; Amaed 31:6"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 35, '

Ba me no laforöta ia, ba lafosasi nukhania, fadahö-dahö ira.', '["Sin 22:19"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 36, 'Ba dumadao ira, manaro ya''ia ba da''ö.', '["Sin 22:19"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 37, '

Ba labe''e yaŵa högönia mbörö wa''amatenia, sura: "Yesu da''e, razo niha Yehuda."', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 38, '

Ba laforöfa awönia zamara''u, darua, samösa ba gambölö ba samösa ba gabera.', '["Luk 23:32; Yes 53:12"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 39, '

Ba latandrawaisi ia sanörö, lafalikhö ira,', '["Sin 22:8","Faigi 26:61; 4:3,6"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 40, 'ba lamane: He sanudugö osali andrö, ba sangotomosi ya''ia, si ha tölu ngaluo, orifi ndra''ugö, na Ono Lowalangi ndra''ugö; ba ae tou moroi ba röfa andrö!', '["Sin 22:8","Faigi 26:61; 4:3,6"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 41, '

Si manö göi ndra ere sebua, la''o''aya ia, awö zangila amakhoita awö zatua mbanua andrö, lamane:', '["Sin 22:9"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 42, 'Niha bö''ö, ba no i''orifi, ba tebai i''orifi ia. Razo Ndraono Gizeraeli ia, yamöi tou iada''e moroi ba röfa, ba mamati sa''ae ita khönia.', '["Sin 22:9"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 43, 'No faduhu dödönia khö Lowalangi, ba yamu''efa''ö ia da''ö iada''e, na i''omasi''ö ia: noa sa iŵa''ö: Ono Lowalangi ndra''o.', '["Sin 22:9"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 44, '

Ba si manö göi zamara''u andrö, niforöfa awönia, wanandraŵaisi ya''ia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 45, '

Ba i''otarai laluo, ba tobali ogömi-gömi ba danö ma''asagörö, irugi labözi tölu.', '["Ayati 45–56: Mar 15:33–41; Luk 23:44–49; Yoh 19:28–30","Labözi tölu: Me föna lö tandraluo. Ena''ö la''ila sobanua wa no irugi sambua za, labözi zi''öli si terongo ba mbanua. Moroi ba da''ö wehede mamözi (li Indonesia pukul)."]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 46, '

Ba so labözi tölu, ba mu''ao Yesu, ebua li, imane: Eli! Eli! lema sabakhtani? He Lowalangigu! He Lowalangigu! hana wa no ö''erogö ndra''o? geluahania.', '["Sin 22:2"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 47, '

Ba lamane ösa, si so ba da''ö, me larongo da''ö: Mogaoni Eliya da''ö.', '["Faigi 17:10"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 48, '

Ba i''anema''ö fagohi zamösa khöra, ihalö rabo, ifo''ösi niro aisö, ibe''e ba mbalö zukhu ba ifabadugö khönia.', '["Rabo: li Indonesia sepon, li Inggris sponge","Niro aisö: faigi geluaha nagu nifaruka awökhu"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 49, 'Ba lamane tanö bö''ö: Böi ua! datafaigi, na möi Geliya, ba wangorifi ya''ia.', '["Rabo: li Indonesia sepon, li Inggris sponge","Niro aisö: faigi geluaha nagu nifaruka awökhu"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 50, '

Ba ifuli mu''ao Yesu, ebua li, ba aetu noso.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 51, '

Ba hiza, asika mba''a-ba''a andrö ba gosali, fabali, i''otarai si yaŵa, numalö mitou, ba moduru danö, fabali gara,', '["MozII 26:31; Heb 10:19,20"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 52, 'ba teboka lewatö ba oya zi maoso boto niha ni''amoni''ö, si no mate, laröi lewatö,', '["MozII 26:31; Heb 10:19,20"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 53, 'me no aefa maoso Yesu, möi ira ba mba nua ni''amoni''ö andrö, ato zangila ya''ira.', '["MozII 26:31; Heb 10:19,20"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 54, '

Ba me la''ila ira kumandra andrö ba awönia sanaro Yesu, ndruru danö andrö ba hadia ia fefu, ba ata''u sibai ira, lamane: Duhu, Ono Lowalangi da''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 55, '

Ba ato zi so ba da''ö ira alawe, samaigi-maigi, moroi ba zaröu, si no molo''ö Yesu, moroi ba Galilaia, si no möi ngoni-ngoninia;', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 56, 'ira Maria, banua Magadala, ba Maria ina ndra Yakobo Yosefo, ba ina nono Zebedaio andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 57, '

Ba mafi owi, ba so niha so''ana''a banua Garimatia, Yosefo döinia, si no möi nifahaö Yesu göi.', '["Ayati 57–61: Mar 15:42–47; Luk 23:50–55; Yoh 19:38–42","MozV 21:23"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 58, 'Da''ö zi möi khö Wilato, mangandrö boto Yesu andrö. Ba i''oroi''ö Filato labe''e.', '["Ayati 57–61: Mar 15:42–47; Luk 23:50–55; Yoh 19:38–42","MozV 21:23"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 59, '

Ba ihalö mboto Yosefo, i''olohuni muko si sökhi,', '["Yes 53:9"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 60, 'ba ibe''e ba lewatö si bohou khönia, nifakharu''önia ba gara, ba ifagaölö gowe sebua ba mbawa lewatö andrö, ba mofanö ia.', '["Yes 53:9"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 61, '

Ba so ba da''ö Maria andrö, banua Magadala ba Maria si sambua andrö, dumadao ira ba gamaudu lewatö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 62, '

Ba sara wongi aefa da''ö, me no aefa luo wangehao andrö, ba falukha ndra ere sebua ba farizaio, khö Wilato,', '["Yoh 19:14","Faigi 16:21; 17:23"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 63, 'lamane: He Tua, no itörö tödöma, wa no iŵa''ö samaelungu andrö, me lö si mate ia na: Na aefa tölu ngaluo, ba maoso ndra''o;', '["Yoh 19:14","Faigi 16:21; 17:23"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 64, 'andrö oroi''ö, ena''ö latarogö lewatö, irege tölu ngaluo, fa böi möi nifahaönia andrö managö ya''ia, ba ma lamane dania ba niha: No maoso ia moroi ba ngai zi mate, ba tobali abölö-bölö wamaelungu safuria andrö, moroi ba zi föföna.', '["Yoh 19:14","Faigi 16:21; 17:23"]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 65, '

Imane khöra Filato: Labe''e khömi zanaro; mi''ae''e, mihaogö wanaro.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394493, 'NT', 'Mataio', 27, 66, '

Ba möi ira, lafotandro gowe ba lafatarogö''ö lewatö ba zanaro no mege.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 1, 'Ba ba zi bongi, me no aefa luo sabato, me arakha moluo luo migu, ba möi Maria andrö, banua Magadala, awö Maria si sambua andrö, mamaigi lewatö.', '["Ayati 1–8: Mar 16:1,2,5–8; Luk 24:5–9","Yoh 20:1"]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 2, '

Ba hiza ziheu sabölö-bölö. No möi tou mala''ika Zo''aya, moroi ba zorugo, möi ia mameta gowe andrö, ba idadaoni.', '["HalZin 1:10"]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 3, 'Ba hulö gari mbanua wamaigira ya''ia, ba barunia, ba no afusi, hulö mbetua.', '["HalZin 1:10"]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 4, '

Ba manizi-nizi zanaro andrö, fa''ata''ura ia ba tobali hulö zi mate ira.', '[]', NULL);


Ba humede mala''ika andrö, imane ba ndra alawe andrö: Böi mi''ata''ufi! u''ila sa, mi''alui Yesu andrö, niforöfa.', '["Faigi 12:40; 16:21"]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 6, 'Lö ya''ia ba da''e; noa sa maoso ia, itörö niŵa''önia; mi''ae mifaigi naha andrö, ba zi so ia mege.', '["Faigi 12:40; 16:21"]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 7, '

Ba mita''i-ta''i, mi''ae miŵa''ö khö ndra nifahaönia, wa no maoso ia moria ba ngai zi mate, ba hiza, mowaö-waö ia ba Galilaia, ba da''ö mi''ila ia dania.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 8, '

Hiza, no uŵa''ö khömi. Ba la''ailo''ö ira, laröi lewatö, ata''u ira, ba omuso sibai dödöra, fagohi ira, ba wangombakha ba nifahaönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 9, '

Ba hiza, falukha ira Yesu, ba imane khöra: Ya''ami! Ba la''ondrasi ia, lara''u gahenia, latuhi danö fönania.', '["SalII 4:27"]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 10, '

Ba imane khöra Yesu: Böi mi''ata''ufi, mi''ae miŵa''ö ba dalifusögu, ena''ö möi ira ba Galilaia, ba ba da''ö la''ilado dania.', '["Yoh 20:17"]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 11, '

Ba me möi ira, ba hiza zanaro ösa, möi ira miyomo ba mbanua, ba la''ombakha''ö da''ö no mege fefu khö ndra ere sebua.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 12, '

Ba falukha ira, awö zatua mbanua andrö, mamagölö ira, ba labe''e gana''a sabönö ba zaradadu andrö, lamane:', '["Faigi 27:64"]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 13, 'Mimane: No möi ndra nifahaönia andrö, ba zi bongi, no latagö ia, me no alau höröma.', '["Faigi 27:64"]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 14, 'Ba na terongo khö gumandru, ba ya''aga zi honogö ya''ia, ba lö mabe''e abu dödömi.', '["Faigi 27:64"]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 15, '

Ba lahalö gana''a andrö, la''o''ö niŵa''ö khöra. Ba si manö duria andrö, ba Niha Yehuda, irugi ma''ökhö andre.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 16, '

Ba möi ba Galilaia nifahaö andrö, si felezara, ba hili andrö, niŵa''ö Yesu khöra.', '["Faigi 26:32; 28:7"]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 17, '

Ba me la''ila ia, ba latuhi danö; ba so zanufa tödö ösa.', '["Luk 24:11"]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 18, '

Ba i''ondrasi ira Yesu, humede ia khöra, imane: Fefu wa''abölö andrö ba zorugo ba ba guli danö, ba no mube''e khögu.', '["Faigi 11:27; Luk 10:22; Yoh 13:3; Fil 2:9 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 19, '

Mi''ae''e, mibali''ö nifahaö fefu soi, wamayagö idanö ya''ira ba döi Nama ba ba döi Nono ba ba döi Geheha ni''amoni''ö;', '["Mar 16:15,16; HalZin 1:8","Faigi 18:20; Yoh 14:18"]', NULL),
  (3394495, 'NT', 'Mataio', 28, 20, 'mifahaö ira ba wolo''ö fefu hadia ia niŵa''ögu khömi. Ba hiza, fao khömi ndra''o, ero ma''ökhö, irugi gamozua götö danö andrö.', '["Mar 16:15,16; HalZin 1:8","Faigi 18:20; Yoh 14:18"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 1, 'Böröta duria somuso dödö andrö, khö Yesu Keriso.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 2, '

Si mane si so ba zura zama''ele''ö andrö, "Hiza, ufatenge zinengegu, sowaö-waö fönau, sangehao lalamö".', '["Ayati 2–8: faigi Mat 3:1–12; Luk 3:1–9, 15–18; Yoh 1:19–28","Mal 3:1","Yes 40:3"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 3, '"Li zi''ao ba danö si mate: Mihaogö lala Zo''aya, mifadaya lalania!"', '["Ayati 2–8: faigi Mat 3:1–12; Luk 3:1–9, 15–18; Yoh 1:19–28","Mal 3:1","Yes 40:3"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 4, '

So Yohane andrö, samayagö idanö ba danö si mate, mangombakha famayagö idanö andrö, ba wamalalini era-era, ba wangefa''ö horö.', '["Yoh 1:6; HalZin 19:4"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 5, 'Ba möi baero khönia mbanua Yudaia fefu ba samba banua Yeruzalema, ba lafabayagö''ö idanö ira ba Yoridano, la''ombakha''ö horöra.', '["Yoh 1:6; HalZin 19:4"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 6, '

Ba bu gondra mbaru Yohane, ba uli zawi mböbö talunia; tamo gönia, awö ŵe ŵani ba gatua.', '["HalZin 13:25; 19:4","Manoto''ö böbö mbadagahe eluahania mangefa''ö mböbö mbadagahe ena''ö tola teheta ia moroi ba gahe. To''ölö meföna latotogö mböbö mbadagahe zokhö ya''ira ira sawuyu.","Mombayagö eluahania mangabasöi''ö, bahiza ba da''a eluahania mangöhöndrögö samösa niha tou ba nidanö Yoridano si tobali tandra wanasai horö. Samalua halöŵö andre ha ere ma ya''ira si tola mamalua halöŵö gere. Simanö ifalua me föna Yohane, bahiza lö ta''ila na ifalua göi zimanö Yesu. Te lö''ö, me tenga ba Yoridano ba tenga göi ba danö-si-mate toröi-röi Yesu simane Yohane. Latohugö ira niha Keriso halöŵö wanasai horö andre faoma famayagö idanö, na laduwagö nidanö ba högö samösa niha. Andrö faudu sibai göi latötöi ia bakha ba Gereja Katolik fanasa ni''amoni''ö, me tuhonia fanasa ba wangefa''ö horö. Simane nisura ba ayati 8, ha tandra ia, eheha ni''amoni''ö sa zohalöŵö. Lö moguna oi möi ita ba nidanö Yoridano ba danö Israel ba wanasai horö ena''ö tobali ita ono Lowalangi ba solo''ö khö Yesu.","HalZin 1:5"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 7, 'Ba mangombakha ia, imane: So furigu dania zabölö moroi khögu, ba ambö ndra''o khönia, ufaöndrö ndra''o ba wanoto''ö böbö mbadagahenia.', '["HalZin 13:25; 19:4","Manoto''ö böbö mbadagahe eluahania mangefa''ö mböbö mbadagahe ena''ö tola teheta ia moroi ba gahe. To''ölö meföna latotogö mböbö mbadagahe zokhö ya''ira ira sawuyu.","Mombayagö eluahania mangabasöi''ö, bahiza ba da''a eluahania mangöhöndrögö samösa niha tou ba nidanö Yoridano si tobali tandra wanasai horö. Samalua halöŵö andre ha ere ma ya''ira si tola mamalua halöŵö gere. Simanö ifalua me föna Yohane, bahiza lö ta''ila na ifalua göi zimanö Yesu. Te lö''ö, me tenga ba Yoridano ba tenga göi ba danö-si-mate toröi-röi Yesu simane Yohane. Latohugö ira niha Keriso halöŵö wanasai horö andre faoma famayagö idanö, na laduwagö nidanö ba högö samösa niha. Andrö faudu sibai göi latötöi ia bakha ba Gereja Katolik fanasa ni''amoni''ö, me tuhonia fanasa ba wangefa''ö horö. Simane nisura ba ayati 8, ha tandra ia, eheha ni''amoni''ö sa zohalöŵö. Lö moguna oi möi ita ba nidanö Yoridano ba danö Israel ba wanasai horö ena''ö tobali ita ono Lowalangi ba solo''ö khö Yesu.","HalZin 1:5"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 8, 'Ya''o, ha idanö ubayagö khömi ba Eheha ni''amoni''ö ibayagö khömi dania.', '["HalZin 13:25; 19:4","Manoto''ö böbö mbadagahe eluahania mangefa''ö mböbö mbadagahe ena''ö tola teheta ia moroi ba gahe. To''ölö meföna latotogö mböbö mbadagahe zokhö ya''ira ira sawuyu.","Mombayagö eluahania mangabasöi''ö, bahiza ba da''a eluahania mangöhöndrögö samösa niha tou ba nidanö Yoridano si tobali tandra wanasai horö. Samalua halöŵö andre ha ere ma ya''ira si tola mamalua halöŵö gere. Simanö ifalua me föna Yohane, bahiza lö ta''ila na ifalua göi zimanö Yesu. Te lö''ö, me tenga ba Yoridano ba tenga göi ba danö-si-mate toröi-röi Yesu simane Yohane. Latohugö ira niha Keriso halöŵö wanasai horö andre faoma famayagö idanö, na laduwagö nidanö ba högö samösa niha. Andrö faudu sibai göi latötöi ia bakha ba Gereja Katolik fanasa ni''amoni''ö, me tuhonia fanasa ba wangefa''ö horö. Simane nisura ba ayati 8, ha tandra ia, eheha ni''amoni''ö sa zohalöŵö. Lö moguna oi möi ita ba nidanö Yoridano ba danö Israel ba wanasai horö ena''ö tobali ita ono Lowalangi ba solo''ö khö Yesu.","HalZin 1:5"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 9, '

Ba me luo da''ö, ba so Yesu, i''otarai Nazareta ba Galilaia, ifabayagö''ö idanö ia khö Yohane, ba Yoridano.', '["Ayati 9–11: faigi Mat 3:13–17; Luk 3:21,22; Yoh 1:31–34","Luk 2:51","Faigi 9:7"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 10, 'Ba me möi ia miyaŵa moroi ba nidanö, ba i''anema''ö i''ila tebokai mbanua si yaŵa, ba möi mitou ba khönia Geheha, hulö marafadi.', '["Ayati 9–11: faigi Mat 3:13–17; Luk 3:21,22; Yoh 1:31–34","Luk 2:51","Faigi 9:7"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 11, 'Ba so li moroi ba zorugo, imane: "Onogu omasi''ö ndra''ugö, wa''omasigu ndra''ugö."', '["Ayati 9–11: faigi Mat 3:13–17; Luk 3:21,22; Yoh 1:31–34","Luk 2:51","Faigi 9:7"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 12, '

Ba i''anema''ö ifarou ia Eheha, ba we''amöi ba danö si mate.', '["Ayati 12–13: faigi Mat 4:1–11; Luk 4:1–13"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 13, 'Ba öfa wulu wonginia ba danö si mate andrö, ba itandraigö ia Satana; fao ia ba gutu ndru''u, ba ngoni-ngoninia mala''ika.', '["Ayati 12–13: faigi Mat 4:1–11; Luk 4:1–13"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 14, '

Ba aefa tekuru Yohane andrö, ba möi ba Galilaia Yesu, mangombakha turia somuso dödö andrö, khö Lowalangi, imane:', '["Ayati 14–15: faigi Mat 4:12–17; Luk 4:14–15","Molo''ö Luk 3:19, ibe ba gurunga Yohane Herode, börö me no itegu ia Yohane me ihalö wo''omo dalifusönia tobali ndrongania","Bakha ba Gamabu''ulali Sibohou tefotöi wamahaö moroi khö Yesu turia somuso dödö. Lö ta''ila sibai mbörötania bahiza itaria itegu ndra farizaio Yesu (faigi Luk 11:37–54 faoma Mat 23:1–39) me famahaöra no tobali \"noro\". Molo''ö Yesu taromali andrö tenga sangabua''ö noro niha bahiza samohouni fa''auri niha, sambua turia sangomusoi''ö tödö niha.","Faigi 6:17","Banua Lowalangi eluahania amatöröŵa Lowalangi. Ba wangera-gera niha me föna Lowalangi andrö hulö samösa razo si so bolo danö nifatörönia. Fefu danö si so barö mbawania lafotöi ia amatöröŵa razo (li Indonesia kerajaan). Na iŵaö Mareko wa no ahatö mbanua Lowalangi eluahania ba zi lö ataratö ba fefu hadia ia möi barö wamatörö Lowalangi.","Gal 4:4"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 15, 'No irugi inötö ba no ahatö mbanua Lowalangi andrö; mifalalini gera-erami ba mifati duria somuso dödö andrö.', '["Ayati 14–15: faigi Mat 4:12–17; Luk 4:14–15","Molo''ö Luk 3:19, ibe ba gurunga Yohane Herode, börö me no itegu ia Yohane me ihalö wo''omo dalifusönia tobali ndrongania","Bakha ba Gamabu''ulali Sibohou tefotöi wamahaö moroi khö Yesu turia somuso dödö. Lö ta''ila sibai mbörötania bahiza itaria itegu ndra farizaio Yesu (faigi Luk 11:37–54 faoma Mat 23:1–39) me famahaöra no tobali \"noro\". Molo''ö Yesu taromali andrö tenga sangabua''ö noro niha bahiza samohouni fa''auri niha, sambua turia sangomusoi''ö tödö niha.","Faigi 6:17","Banua Lowalangi eluahania amatöröŵa Lowalangi. Ba wangera-gera niha me föna Lowalangi andrö hulö samösa razo si so bolo danö nifatörönia. Fefu danö si so barö mbawania lafotöi ia amatöröŵa razo (li Indonesia kerajaan). Na iŵaö Mareko wa no ahatö mbanua Lowalangi eluahania ba zi lö ataratö ba fefu hadia ia möi barö wamatörö Lowalangi.","Gal 4:4"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 16, '

Ba me itörö zinga mbaŵa Galilaia, ba i''ila Zimoni ba Andrea, talifusö Zimoni, si fakiri ba mbaŵa. Tuka giri ira.', '["Ayati 16–20: faigi Mat 4:18–22; Luk 5:1–11"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 17, 'Ba imane khöra Yesu: Mi''o''ö ndra''o, ba ubali''ö sama''u''u niha ami.', '["Ayati 16–20: faigi Mat 4:18–22; Luk 5:1–11"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 18, 'Ba i''anema''ö laröi giri, la''o''ö ia.', '["Ayati 16–20: faigi Mat 4:18–22; Luk 5:1–11"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 19, 'Ba me no mofanö ia ma''ifu, ba i''ila Yakobo, ono Zebedaio, awö dalifusönia Yohane, ba dundraha göi yaŵa, mamönö kiri ira.', '["Ayati 16–20: faigi Mat 4:18–22; Luk 5:1–11"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 20, 'Ba i''anema''ö ikaoni ira; ba laröi namara Sebedaio ba dundraha, awö genoni, la''o''ö ia.', '["Ayati 16–20: faigi Mat 4:18–22; Luk 5:1–11"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 21, '

Ba möi ira miyomo ba Gafanauma, ba i''anema''ö mamahaö ia ba zekola, ba luo sabato.', '["Ayati 21–28: Luk 4:31–37","Sekola eluahania angowuloa ba wombaso Taromali Lowalangi ba ba wamatimba geluahania ba wa''auri niha. Sekola andre tenga simane SD ma SMP bahiza simane sekola wanunö, sekola daromali ma sekola nifalua ba gosali/gereja.","Mat 7:28–29"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 22, 'Ba tobali dödöra ba wamahaönia; no abölö ia wamahaö ya''ira, ba tenga si mane sangila amakhoita andrö.', '["Ayati 21–28: Luk 4:31–37","Sekola eluahania angowuloa ba wombaso Taromali Lowalangi ba ba wamatimba geluahania ba wa''auri niha. Sekola andre tenga simane SD ma SMP bahiza simane sekola wanunö, sekola daromali ma sekola nifalua ba gosali/gereja.","Mat 7:28–29"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 23, '

Ba so ba da''ö ba zekola khöra niha si so bekhu si ra''iö, mu''ao ia, imane:', '["Niha si so bekhu si ra''iö eluahania niha si no fakuyu era-era ma asese laŵa''ö ba khöda niha sowöhö. Molo''ö niha me föna fefu wökhö wangera-ngera no börö mbekhu. Sindruhunia lö sigöna ira bekhu, bahiza no mo''amböta ira ba wamatörö lala wangera-ngerara. Lafotöi ia ba li Indonesia sakit jiwa.","Faigi 5:7"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 24, 'Hadia niŵa''öu khöma, Yesu, banua Nazareta? Ba wamakiko ya''aga möi''ö? Ma''ila, ha niha ndra''ugö; ni''amoni''ö andrö khö Lowalangi!', '["Niha si so bekhu si ra''iö eluahania niha si no fakuyu era-era ma asese laŵa''ö ba khöda niha sowöhö. Molo''ö niha me föna fefu wökhö wangera-ngera no börö mbekhu. Sindruhunia lö sigöna ira bekhu, bahiza no mo''amböta ira ba wamatörö lala wangera-ngerara. Lafotöi ia ba li Indonesia sakit jiwa.","Faigi 5:7"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 25, '

Ba itenaŵa ia Yesu, imane: Böi hede-hede sa''ae ba heta''ögö khönia!', '["Faigi 9:25","Falukhasata niha andrö khö Yesu molua-lua ia wa ifuli teföfö wangera-ngerania irege tobali ia simane niha si to''ölö."]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 26, 'Ba idödöni niha andrö bekhu si ra''iö andrö, mu''ao ia, ebua linia, ba iheta ia khönia.', '["Faigi 9:25","Falukhasata niha andrö khö Yesu molua-lua ia wa ifuli teföfö wangera-ngerania irege tobali ia simane niha si to''ölö."]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 27, '

Ba oi so wa''atobali dödöra, dozi ira; faoma lamane khö nawöra: Hadia da''ö? famahaö si bohou, ba so wa''abölö! ba mbekhu si ra''iö göi ibe''e goroisa, ba la''o''ö linia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 28, '

Ba i''anema''ö humöngö duriania misa ba danö Galilaia andrö si fasui, ma''asagörö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 29, '

Ba ladölö ira ba nomo ndra Simoni Andrea, la''otarai zekola, fao ndra Yakobo Yohane.', '["Ayati 29–34; Mat 8:14–17; Luk 4:38–40"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 30, 'Ba no so tou ba zalo matua Zimoni, ira alawe, akhömö, fa''aukhu, ba la''anema''ö la''ombakha''ö khönia.', '["Ayati 29–34; Mat 8:14–17; Luk 4:38–40"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 31, 'Ba möi ia khönia, ira''u danga, ifazaŵa, ba döhö wa''aukhu, ba möi ia ngoni-ngonira.', '["Ayati 29–34; Mat 8:14–17; Luk 4:38–40"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 32, '

Ba me bongi, me aekhu luo, ba la''ohe khönia fefu zofökhö, awö zobekhu.', '["Mar 3:11–12; HalZin 16:17–18"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 33, 'Ba samba banua manö ira, oi owulo baolayama.', '["Mar 3:11–12; HalZin 16:17–18"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 34, 'Ba ato nifadöhönia fökhö, oya ngawalö wökhö, ba oya ifofanö bekhu. Ba lö itehe ba mbekhu andrö muhede ira, me no la''ila, ha niha ia.', '["Mar 3:11–12; HalZin 16:17–18"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 35, '

Ba mahemolu ö, me lö moluo na, ba maoso ia, möi ia baero, isaŵa zi lö niha-niha, mangandrö ia ba da''ö.', '["Ayati 35–39: Luk 4:42–44","Moguna sibai mutöngöni da''a: möi Yesu ba wangandrö ba nahia si lö niha-niha. Töra-töra ba ginötö iada''a me ato niha somasi-masi mangoroma''ö na mangandrö ira (la''ebua lira la''oguna''ö wangebuali nifotöi loudspeaker). Labali''ö wangandrö ba fanunöra tobali fae''atasa (li Indonesia pertunjukan, li Inggris show). Ha''uga kali itegu ndra farizaio Yesu börö me somasi ira wangorama''ö ba niha sato wa mangandrö ira, ba tenga ba wahuhuosa khö Lowalangi samösa."]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 36, '

Ba la''o''ö ia Simoni ba awönia,', '[]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 37, 'ba lasöndra ia, ba lamane khönia: Oi dozi la''alui ndra''ugö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 38, '

Ba imane khöra: Datasaŵa misa mbanua sahatö, ena''ö mangombakha ndra''o ba da''ö göi; da''ö sa danigu we''amöi.', '["Yes 61:1","Tani we''amöi sindruhunia tani we''aso Yesu. Andrö dani we''asonia tenga ba wangoroma''ö zahöli-höli dödö ba niha sato, ba hiza ba wanuriaigö turia somuso dödö ba niha sabu tödö."]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 39, 'Ba möi ia mangombakha ba zekola khöra, ba danö Galilaia ma''asagörö, ba ifofanö mbekhu.', '["Yes 61:1","Tani we''amöi sindruhunia tani we''aso Yesu. Andrö dani we''asonia tenga ba wangoroma''ö zahöli-höli dödö ba niha sato, ba hiza ba wanuriaigö turia somuso dödö ba niha sabu tödö."]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 40, '

Ba i''ondrasi ia sobou auri, mangandrö khönia, ibalöduhini danö, imane khönia: Na edöna ndra''ugö, ba ö''ila öfadöhö wökhögu.', '["Ayati 40–45: Mat 8:1–4; Luk 5:12–15"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 41, '

Ba ahakhö dödönia, i''oro''ö dangania, itufa, imane: Edöna ndra''o, yadöhö!', '[]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 42, '

Ba i''anema''ö aheta mbou auri andrö khönia, döhö.', '["MozIII 14:2"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 43, 'Ba ifeta''u, i''anema''ö ifofanö, imane khönia:', '["MozIII 14:2"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 44, 'Faigi, fa böi ö''ombakha''ö hadia ia, gofu ha ökhö; ba ae''e sa, oroma''ö ndra''ugö khö gere ba be''e game''ela andrö, ba wa''aheta wökhöu andrö, ni''oroi''ö Moze, famaduhu''ö khöra.', '["MozIII 14:2"]', NULL),
  (3393827, 'NT', 'Mareko', 1, 45, '

Ba me möi ia baero, ba ibörötaigö i''ombakha''ö, iforege, ifahöngö duria andrö. Tobali tebai sa''ae i''oroma''ö ia Yesu, we''amöi ba mbanua misa; baero, ba naha si lö niha-niha, soso ia, ba la''ondrasi ia, moroi ba zi fasui fefu.', '["Faigi 7:36"]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 1, 'Ba lö ara si''ai,[1] ba ifuli möi ia ba Gafanauma, ba terongo, wa no so ia yomo.', '["Ayati 1–12: Mt 9:1–8; Luk 5:17–26"]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 2, 'Ba ato zowulo khönia niha, tobali ambö nahara, he baolayama, ba ituriagö khöra daroma li.', '["Ayati 1–12: Mt 9:1–8; Luk 5:17–26"]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 3, 'Ba la''ohe khönia zi mate dambai; daöfa zangosa''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 4, 'Ba me lö lalara khönia, ba wa''ato niha, ba labokai zagö, ba zi so ia. Ba me no latöla''ö, ba ladada gaso andrö, naha zi mate dambai andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 5, 'Ba me i''ila wamatira Yesu, ba imane khö zi mate dambai andrö: No te''efa''ö khöu horöu, onogu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 6, 'Ba so zangila amakhoita ösa, sidadao ba da''ö, ba lamane dödöra:', '["Sin 32:5; 130:4; Yes 43:25; 44:22"]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 7, 'Hadia, wa imanö da''ö? Mangaoha-ngaoha! Ha niha zangila mangefa''ö horö, baero zi ha samösa andrö, Lowalangi?[2]', '["Sin 32:5; 130:4; Yes 43:25; 44:22"]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 8, 'Ba i''anema''ö i''ila Yesu tödönia, wa no si manö gera-era dödöra, ba imane khöra: Hadia wa si manö gera-era dödömi?[3]', '["Yoh 2:25"]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 9, 'He zaoha ira, fanguma''ö khö zi mate dambai andrö: No te''efa''ö khöu horöu? ba ma fanguma''ö: Faoso, fazaŵa gasomö ba ofanö?', '["Yoh 2:25"]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 10, 'Ba ena''ö mi''ila, tola i''efa''ö horö ba guli danö Ono Niha, ba imane khö zi mate dambai andrö:', '["Yoh 2:25"]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 11, 'Da''ö niŵa''ögu khöu: faoso, fazaŵa gasomö ba fuli''ö khömi!', '["Yoh 2:25"]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 12, 'Ba maoso ia, i''anema''ö ifazaŵa gasonia ba möi baero, oi anehe ira; tobali ahöli-höli dödöra fefu, lasuno Lowalangi, lamane: Lö irai ta''ila zi manö!', '[]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 13, 'Ba ifuli möi ia baero ba zinga mbaŵa, ba la''ondrasi ia niha sato fefu, ba ifahaö ira.[4]', '["Ayati 13–17: Mat 9:9–13; Luk 5:27–32"]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 14, 'Ba me itörö, ba i''ila Lewi, ono Galifaio, si dadao ba naha wanema beo. Ba imane khönia: O''ö ndra''o. Ba maoso ia, i''o''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 15, 'Ba me manga ia ba nomo da''ö, ba ato zanema beo ba sebua horö, si manga awö Yesu ba awö nifahaönia; ato sa ira zolo''ö ya''ia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 16, 'Ba me la''ila sangila amakhoita, farizaio, manga ia awö zanema beo ba awö zebua horö, ba lamane ba nifahaönia: Hadia, awö zanema beo ba awö zebua horö manga ia?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 17, 'Ba me irongo Yesu, ba imane khöra: Tenga ba zabölö moguna zame''e dalu-dalu, ba zofökhö moguna ia. Tenga ba wogaoni satulö möi ndra''o, no ba wogaoni si so horö möido.[5]', '["1Kor 1:26 b.t.; Hes 33:11"]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 18, 'Ba no samoni ba gö nifahaö Yohane ba nifahaö warizaio,[6] ba möi ira khönia, lamane: Hana wa mamoni ba gö nifahaö Yohane, awö nifahaö warizaio, ba lö mamoni ba gö nifahaömö?', '["Ayati 18–22: Mat 9:13–17; Luk 5:33–39"]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 19, 'Ba imane khöra Yesu: Hadia, la''ila mamoni ba gö si möi ba walöŵa, fatua awöra zangowalu? Tebai mamoni ba gö ira, fatua so zangowalu, awöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 20, 'Ba irugi baŵa dania, ba aheta khöra zangowalu, ba awena mamoni ba gö ira, na baŵa da''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 21, 'Lö sombalo baru satua balo-balo si bohou, ba na imanö, ba atika mbaru satua andrö, ba zinga mbalo-balo, ba abölö-bölö zatikania.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 22, 'Ba lö solau agu si bohou ba naha satua, ba na lalau, ba itika''ö naha andrö agu, ba tekiko nagu, fabaya naha.', '[]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 23, 'Ba me itörö nowi,[7] me luo sabato, ba labörötaigö nifahaönia ladödöni lai wakhe si fatimba ba lala.', '["Ayati 23–28: Mat 12:1–8; Luk 6:1–5"]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 24, 'Ba lamane khönia farizaio, Hiza, hana wa lalau ba luo sabato zi lö tola?', '[]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 25, 'Ba imane khöra: Hadia, lö mirai mibaso nilau Dawido, me moguna khönia ba me olofo ia, ba awönia fao?[8]', '["SamI 21:6.","MozII 29:32."]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 26, 'Me möi ia ba nomo Lowalangi, me ere sebua Gabiataro, me i''a roti nifaigi-faigi andrö, si lö tola i''a niha bö''ö, baero gere, ba me ibe''e göi ba nawönia fao.[9]', '["SamI 21:6.","MozII 29:32."]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 27, 'Ba imane khöra: Börö niha, wa so zabato, ba tenga börö zabato, wa so niha.[10]', '["MozV 5:14.","So''aya zabato Nono Niha eluahania mofa''abölö Yesu andrö (bakha ba Injil Ono Niha no töi Yesu) irege tola ifataro hadia zi tola ba hadia zi tebai mu''ohalöŵögöigö ba luo sabato."]', NULL),
  (3394501, 'NT', 'Mareko', 2, 28, 'Tobali So''aya sabato göi Nono Niha.[11]', '["MozV 5:14.","So''aya zabato Nono Niha eluahania mofa''abölö Yesu andrö (bakha ba Injil Ono Niha no töi Yesu) irege tola ifataro hadia zi tola ba hadia zi tebai mu''ohalöŵögöigö ba luo sabato."]', NULL),
  (3394502, 'NT', 'Mareko', 3, 1, 'Ba ifuli möi ba zekola.[1] Ba so ba da''ö niha si no mate tanga,[2] si sara.', '["Ayati 1–6: Mat 12:9–14; Luk 6:6–11","Mate tanga eluahania tebai mamaliŵa tanga sa''ae börö wökhö.","Tola mu''alösö''ö wanguma''ö andre tobali: Hadia zinangea mufalua ba luo sabato, molau si sökhi, ya''ia da''ö mangorifi niha ma zui molau si lö sökhi, ya''ia da''ö mamunu niha?"]', NULL),
  (3394502, 'NT', 'Mareko', 3, 2, 'Ba lafaigi-faigi ia, na ifadöhö ba luo sabato, ba wangadugö ya''ia.', '["Ayati 1–6: Mat 12:9–14; Luk 6:6–11","Mate tanga eluahania tebai mamaliŵa tanga sa''ae börö wökhö.","Tola mu''alösö''ö wanguma''ö andre tobali: Hadia zinangea mufalua ba luo sabato, molau si sökhi, ya''ia da''ö mangorifi niha ma zui molau si lö sökhi, ya''ia da''ö mamunu niha?"]', NULL),
  (3394502, 'NT', 'Mareko', 3, 3, 'Ba imane ba niha andrö, si no mate tanga: Faoso, ae ba da''e!', '["Ayati 1–6: Mat 12:9–14; Luk 6:6–11","Mate tanga eluahania tebai mamaliŵa tanga sa''ae börö wökhö.","Tola mu''alösö''ö wanguma''ö andre tobali: Hadia zinangea mufalua ba luo sabato, molau si sökhi, ya''ia da''ö mangorifi niha ma zui molau si lö sökhi, ya''ia da''ö mamunu niha?"]', NULL),
  (3394502, 'NT', 'Mareko', 3, 4, 'Ba imane khöra: Hadia, tola lalau zi sökhi ba luo sabato, ba ma si lö sökhi, tola la''orifi niha, ma labunu?[3] Ba lö hede-hedera.', '["Ayati 1–6: Mat 12:9–14; Luk 6:6–11","Mate tanga eluahania tebai mamaliŵa tanga sa''ae börö wökhö.","Tola mu''alösö''ö wanguma''ö andre tobali: Hadia zinangea mufalua ba luo sabato, molau si sökhi, ya''ia da''ö mangorifi niha ma zui molau si lö sökhi, ya''ia da''ö mamunu niha?"]', NULL),
  (3394502, 'NT', 'Mareko', 3, 5, 'Ba ifaigi ira, fasui, mofönu ia, abu dödönia ba wa''abe''e dödöra, ba imane ba niha no mege: Oro''ö dangau! Ba i''oro''ö, ba döhö wökhö dangania.', '["Ayati 1–6: Mat 12:9–14; Luk 6:6–11","Mate tanga eluahania tebai mamaliŵa tanga sa''ae börö wökhö.","Tola mu''alösö''ö wanguma''ö andre tobali: Hadia zinangea mufalua ba luo sabato, molau si sökhi, ya''ia da''ö mangorifi niha ma zui molau si lö sökhi, ya''ia da''ö mamunu niha?"]', NULL),
  (3394502, 'NT', 'Mareko', 3, 6, 'Ba ladölö ira baero farizaio, mamagölö ira ba zi fao-fao khö Herode, ba khönia andrö, ba wamunu ya''ia.[4]', '["Mat 22:16"]', NULL),
  (3394502, 'NT', 'Mareko', 3, 7, 'Ba iheta ia Yesu, awö nifahaönia, isaŵa mbaŵa,[5] ba ato niha solo''ö ya''ia, banua Galilaia ba banua Yudaia,', '["Baŵa eluahania idanö si hulö nasi si so yaŵa ba danö (li Indonesia danau)."]', NULL),
  (3394502, 'NT', 'Mareko', 3, 8, 'ba banua Yeruzalema ba banua Gidumaia ba moroi ba zi tambai Yoridano ba moroi ba zi fasui Diro ba Sidona, ato niha, me larongo nilaunia fefu, ba la''ondrasi ia.', '["Baŵa eluahania idanö si hulö nasi si so yaŵa ba danö (li Indonesia danau)."]', NULL),
  (3394502, 'NT', 'Mareko', 3, 9, 'Ba iŵa''ö ba nifahaönia, ena''ö lahönagö lafaigi dundraha khönia, ba wa''ato niha, fa böi lalangögö ia.', '["Luk 6:18 ba Mat 14:36"]', NULL),
  (3394502, 'NT', 'Mareko', 3, 10, 'Ato sa nifadöhönia fökhö, tobali lafadege ira khönia dozi si so safökhö, ba wombambaya ya''ia.[6]', '["Luk 6:18 ba Mat 14:36"]', NULL),
  (3394502, 'NT', 'Mareko', 3, 11, 'Ba bekhu si ra''iö andrö, na la''ila ia, ba latuhi danö, fönania, mu''ao ira, lamane: Ono Lowalangi ndra''ugö![7]', '["1:24,34; Luk 4:41","Mat 12:16"]', NULL);







Me luo Herode andrö, razo Yudaia, ba so gere, Sakharia döinia, ma''uwu Gabia, ba fo''omonia, ba ma''uwu Ga''aroni, Elizabe döi.', '["Mat 2:1; Nga''ötI 24:10; Luk 22:52; Neh 12:14,17","MozV 10:12; Yob 1:1,8"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 6, 'Ba no faoma satulö tödö ira, föna Lowalangi, la''o''ö goroisa Zo''aya fefu, awö gamakhoita, lö sinegu.', '["Mat 2:1; Nga''ötI 24:10; Luk 22:52; Neh 12:14,17","MozV 10:12; Yob 1:1,8"]', NULL);


Ba tobali me mo''ere ia föna Lowalangi, me inötö khöra ma''uwu Gabia, ba göna ia fanunu kumöyö,', '["SalII 11:9","Fanunu kumöyö: nifalua samösa ere bakha ba nomo Lowalangi. Hua gumöyö andrö amuhua na no mutunu ba oya zimbonia si möi miyaŵa (faigi foto Zakharia ba nga''örö andre solohe nahia gumöyö). He ba gotalua niha Yahudi, niha Keriso ba he göi ba agama tanöbö''ö no te''oguna''ö wanunu gumöyö andre tobali tandra wamasao fangandrö ba famosumange niha samati khö Lowalangi. Asese ta''ila wanunu kumöyö da''a irugi ma''ökhö bakha ba Gereja Katolik ba ginötö gowasa sebua simane Natal, Paskah ma zui owasa Gereja bö''ö segebua.","MozII 30:7"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 9, '(fadahö-dahösa huku ba gere, wangohonogöi da''ö) ba möi ia ba gosali Zo''aya.', '["SalII 11:9","Fanunu kumöyö: nifalua samösa ere bakha ba nomo Lowalangi. Hua gumöyö andrö amuhua na no mutunu ba oya zimbonia si möi miyaŵa (faigi foto Zakharia ba nga''örö andre solohe nahia gumöyö). He ba gotalua niha Yahudi, niha Keriso ba he göi ba agama tanöbö''ö no te''oguna''ö wanunu gumöyö andre tobali tandra wamasao fangandrö ba famosumange niha samati khö Lowalangi. Asese ta''ila wanunu kumöyö da''a irugi ma''ökhö bakha ba Gereja Katolik ba ginötö gowasa sebua simane Natal, Paskah ma zui owasa Gereja bö''ö segebua.","MozII 30:7"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 10, 'Ba niha sato fefu, ba mangandrö baero, barö wanunu kumöyö andrö.', '["SalII 11:9","Fanunu kumöyö: nifalua samösa ere bakha ba nomo Lowalangi. Hua gumöyö andrö amuhua na no mutunu ba oya zimbonia si möi miyaŵa (faigi foto Zakharia ba nga''örö andre solohe nahia gumöyö). He ba gotalua niha Yahudi, niha Keriso ba he göi ba agama tanöbö''ö no te''oguna''ö wanunu gumöyö andre tobali tandra wamasao fangandrö ba famosumange niha samati khö Lowalangi. Asese ta''ila wanunu kumöyö da''a irugi ma''ökhö bakha ba Gereja Katolik ba ginötö gowasa sebua simane Natal, Paskah ma zui owasa Gereja bö''ö segebua.","MozII 30:7"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 11, '

Ba i''ila mala''ika Zo''aya, ba gambölö naha wanunu kumöyö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 12, 'Ba tokea Zakharia me i''ila da''ö, ihawui ia fa''ata''u.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 13, '

Ba imane khönia mala''ika andrö: Böi ata''ufi, Sakharia, me no tefondrondrongo wangandröu, ba mo''ono khöu dania wo''omou, Elizabe, ono matua, ba öbe''e töinia Yohane.', '["Hal.Zin 13:31","Mat 11:9,11; MozIV 6:3","Sin 8:2; Mat 11:14; 17:11,12; Mal 3:1,4,5,6"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 14, 'Ba omuso dödöu ba owua-wua dödöu, ba ato zomuso tödö, ba wa''atumbunia.', '["Hal.Zin 13:31","Mat 11:9,11; MozIV 6:3","Sin 8:2; Mat 11:14; 17:11,12; Mal 3:1,4,5,6"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 15, 'Me ebua dania ia, föna Zo''aya; agu ba sofi, ba lö ibadu, ba no fahöna dania khönia Geheha ni''amoni''ö, moroi ba dalu ninania,', '["Hal.Zin 13:31","Mat 11:9,11; MozIV 6:3","Sin 8:2; Mat 11:14; 17:11,12; Mal 3:1,4,5,6"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 16, 'ba ato dania ibe''e lafuli ira, Iraono Gizeraeli, khö Lowalangira, So''aya.', '["Hal.Zin 13:31","Mat 11:9,11; MozIV 6:3","Sin 8:2; Mat 11:14; 17:11,12; Mal 3:1,4,5,6"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 17, 'Ba sowaö-waö fönania ia, so khönia Geheha Geliya ba fa''abölönia, ba wamuli tödö ndra ama ba ndraono, ba ba wamuli si lö molo''ö ba wa''atua-tua zatulö, ba wanga''asogö banua nihaogö, khö Zo''aya.', '["Hal.Zin 13:31","Mat 11:9,11; MozIV 6:3","Sin 8:2; Mat 11:14; 17:11,12; Mal 3:1,4,5,6"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 18, '

Ba imane Sakharia khö mala''ika andrö: Heza oroma khögu da''ö? Noa sa atua ndra''odo, ba fo''omogu andrö, ba no numalö ndröfi.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 19, '

Ba itema linia mala''ika andrö, imane khönia: Gaberi''eli ndra''odo, si so föna Lowalangi, ba no tefatenge ndra''o, ba wehede khöu ba ba wanuriagö khöu turia somuso dödö andrö.', '["Dan 8:16; 9:21"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 20, 'Ba hiza, si lö hede ndra''ugö dania, tebai muhede''ö, irugi luo itörö da''ö, börö wa lö si faduhu dödöu ba ligu andrö; itörö dania, na baŵania.', '["Dan 8:16; 9:21"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 21, '

Ba labaze-baze''ö Zakharia niha sato, ba ahöli-höli dödöra wa''arania ba gosali.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 22, '

Ba me möi ia baero, ba tebai humede ia khöra ba aboto ba dödöra, no i''ila gangilata ba gosali, ba ifazaŵa dangania, tandra; ba si manö-manö ia dania, si lö hede.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 23, 'Ba me no aefa mbaŵa halöŵönia, ba mofanö ia ba khöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 24, '

Ba me aefa luo da''ö, ba manabina Gelizabe, fo''omonia, ba ibini''ö ia lima waŵa wa''ara, imane: 25 Si manö wolau Zo''aya khögu, me baŵa wamaiginia ya''o, ba wameta fa''ailagu andrö ba niha.', '["MozI 30:23"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 26, '

Ba arakha önö waŵa, ba ifatenge mala''ika Gaberi''eli andrö Lowalangi ba mbanua Galilaia, sotöi Nazareta,', '["Faigi 2:4; Mat 1:18"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 27, 'khö nono alawe, sinandra ndra matua, sotöi Yosefo, ma''uwu Dawido; ba töi nono alawe andrö, ba Maria.', '["Faigi 2:4; Mat 1:18"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 28, '

Ba möi si bakha khönia mala''ika andrö, imane: Ya''ugö, si no falukha fa''ebua dödö! Yamutolo''ö So''aya!', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 29, '

Ba tobali dödönia, ba niŵa''önia andrö, imane dödönia: Hadia wangowai da''ö?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 30, '

Ba imane mala''ika andrö khönia: Böi ata''ufi Maria; noa sa falukha''ö wa''ebua dödö khö Lowalangi;', '["Yes 7:14; Mat 1:21","Yes 9:6; SamII 7:16","Yer 33:14; Dan 7:14"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 31, 'ba hiza, manabina dania ndra''ugö, ba mo''ono''ö ono matua, ba öbe''e töinia Yesu.', '["Yes 7:14; Mat 1:21","Yes 9:6; SamII 7:16","Yer 33:14; Dan 7:14"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 32, 'Salaŵa dania da''ö, ba labe''e töinia Nono Wondrege Zalaŵa, ba ibe''e khönia Lowalangi So''aya dadaoma duania Dawido.', '["Yes 7:14; Mat 1:21","Yes 9:6; SamII 7:16","Yer 33:14; Dan 7:14"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 33, 'Ba samatörö ma''uwu Yakobo ia, götö-götö wa''ara, ba si lö aetu wa''asalaŵania andrö.', '["Yes 7:14; Mat 1:21","Yes 9:6; SamII 7:16","Yer 33:14; Dan 7:14"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 34, '

Ba imane Maria khö mala''ika andrö: He wisa lala da''ö, me lö u''ila ndra matua?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 35, '

Ba itema linia mala''ika, imane khönia: So dania Geheha ni''amoni''ö, ba ilumö''ö ndra''ugö fa''abölö Wondrege Zalaŵa; andrö göi labe''e töi ni''amoni''ö andrö, si tumbu dania, Nono Lowalangi.', '["Mat 1:20; Yoh 1:34","Faigi 18:27; MozI 18:14"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 36, 'Ba hiza Gelizabe andrö, sitengabö''ömi, no manabina göi, ono matua, ba wa''atuania, no arakha önö waŵania iya''e, niŵa''ö föna, si lö ono.', '["Mat 1:20; Yoh 1:34","Faigi 18:27; MozI 18:14"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 37, 'Lö''ö sa hadia ia zi tebai ba Lowalangi.', '["Mat 1:20; Yoh 1:34","Faigi 18:27; MozI 18:14"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 38, '

Ba imane Maria: Hiza, enoni Zo''aya ndra''o, ya''itörö khögu niŵa''öu. Ba iröi ia mala''ika no mege.', '["Rom 4:21"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 39, '

Ba maoso Maria, me luo da''ö, i''alio''ö we''amöi ba hili, isaŵa mbanua Yuda;', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 40, 'möi ia yomo ba nomo Zakharia, ba i''owai Gelizabe andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 41, '

Ba tobali, me irongo Elizabe wangowai Maria andrö, ba manara dabinania ba dalunia. Ba fahöna khö Gelizabe Geheha ni''amoni''ö,', '["Yoh 20:29"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 42, 'ba humede ia, ebua linia, imane: Nifahowu''ö ndra''ugö, moroi ba ndra alawe bö''ö, ba nifahowu''ö dabinamö andrö!', '["Yoh 20:29"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 43, 'Ba he moroi khögu da''ö, wa möi khögu nina Zo''aya ya''o?', '["Yoh 20:29"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 44, 'Hiza sa, me irongo tögi dalingagu wangowaimö andrö, ba manara dabina ba dalugu, ba wa''owua-wua dödö.', '["Yoh 20:29"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 45, 'Ba ya''ahowu zi no faduhu tödö, me itörö dania nifa''ombakha''ögö Zo''aya khönia.', '["Yoh 20:29"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 46, '

Ba imane Maria: "Isuno Zo''aya tödögu,', '["SamI 2:1","Yes 61:10","Sin 113:6","Sin 126:3; 111:9","MozII 20:6; Sin 103:13, 17","Yes 51:9; FetI 5:5","SamI 2:3; Yob 5:11; Mat 23:12","Sin 107:9","Yes 41:8; Yer 31:3,20","MozI 17:7,19; 22:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 47, 'ba no owua-wua dödögu, börö Lowalangi, sangorifi ya''o,', '["SamI 2:1","Yes 61:10","Sin 113:6","Sin 126:3; 111:9","MozII 20:6; Sin 103:13, 17","Yes 51:9; FetI 5:5","SamI 2:3; Yob 5:11; Mat 23:12","Sin 107:9","Yes 41:8; Yer 31:3,20","MozI 17:7,19; 22:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 48, 'me no inehegö wa''anumana genoninia andre. Hiza sa, i''otarai da''e, ba lafahowu-howu''ö ndra''o dozi ma''uwu,', '["SamI 2:1","Yes 61:10","Sin 113:6","Sin 126:3; 111:9","MozII 20:6; Sin 103:13, 17","Yes 51:9; FetI 5:5","SamI 2:3; Yob 5:11; Mat 23:12","Sin 107:9","Yes 41:8; Yer 31:3,20","MozI 17:7,19; 22:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 49, 'me no ebua itolodo sabölö andrö ba ni''amoni''ö döinia.', '["SamI 2:1","Yes 61:10","Sin 113:6","Sin 126:3; 111:9","MozII 20:6; Sin 103:13, 17","Yes 51:9; FetI 5:5","SamI 2:3; Yob 5:11; Mat 23:12","Sin 107:9","Yes 41:8; Yer 31:3,20","MozI 17:7,19; 22:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 50, 'Ba fa''ahakhö dödönia andrö, ba götö-götö wa''ara, khöra sangata''ufi ya''ia.', '["SamI 2:1","Yes 61:10","Sin 113:6","Sin 126:3; 111:9","MozII 20:6; Sin 103:13, 17","Yes 51:9; FetI 5:5","SamI 2:3; Yob 5:11; Mat 23:12","Sin 107:9","Yes 41:8; Yer 31:3,20","MozI 17:7,19; 22:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 51, 'No i''oroma''ö wa''abe''e dangania. No ifazaewe zi fayaŵa ba gera-era dödöra,', '["SamI 2:1","Yes 61:10","Sin 113:6","Sin 126:3; 111:9","MozII 20:6; Sin 103:13, 17","Yes 51:9; FetI 5:5","SamI 2:3; Yob 5:11; Mat 23:12","Sin 107:9","Yes 41:8; Yer 31:3,20","MozI 17:7,19; 22:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 52, 'No itimba zalaŵa ba dadaomara, ba no ibali''ö salaŵa zide-ide.', '["SamI 2:1","Yes 61:10","Sin 113:6","Sin 126:3; 111:9","MozII 20:6; Sin 103:13, 17","Yes 51:9; FetI 5:5","SamI 2:3; Yob 5:11; Mat 23:12","Sin 107:9","Yes 41:8; Yer 31:3,20","MozI 17:7,19; 22:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 53, 'Solofo, ba no i''abusoi''ö si sökhi, ba so''ana''a, ba no ifofanö lö öra', '["SamI 2:1","Yes 61:10","Sin 113:6","Sin 126:3; 111:9","MozII 20:6; Sin 103:13, 17","Yes 51:9; FetI 5:5","SamI 2:3; Yob 5:11; Mat 23:12","Sin 107:9","Yes 41:8; Yer 31:3,20","MozI 17:7,19; 22:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 54, 'No itolo genoninia Izeraeli, ena''ö itörö tödönia wa''ahakhö dödö andrö,', '["SamI 2:1","Yes 61:10","Sin 113:6","Sin 126:3; 111:9","MozII 20:6; Sin 103:13, 17","Yes 51:9; FetI 5:5","SamI 2:3; Yob 5:11; Mat 23:12","Sin 107:9","Yes 41:8; Yer 31:3,20","MozI 17:7,19; 22:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 55, 'si mane niŵa''önia khö ndra tuada khö Gaberahamo ba ba ma''uwunia, si lö aetu".', '["SamI 2:1","Yes 61:10","Sin 113:6","Sin 126:3; 111:9","MozII 20:6; Sin 103:13, 17","Yes 51:9; FetI 5:5","SamI 2:3; Yob 5:11; Mat 23:12","Sin 107:9","Yes 41:8; Yer 31:3,20","MozI 17:7,19; 22:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 56, '

Ba mato tölu waŵa wa''ara Maria khönia, awena ifuli ia khöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 57, '

Ba irugi baŵa Gelizabe, baŵa wo''ono khönia, ba madono ia, ono matua.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 58, 'Ba larongo banuara ba talifusöra, wa no abölö wa''ahakhö dödö Zo''aya khönia, ba omuso dödöra göi, awönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 59, '

Ba me no aefa zi fitu bongi, ba möi ira mamoto ono andrö, ba labe''e töinia döi namania, Sakharia andrö.', '["MozI 17:12; 21:3,4"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 60, '

Ba humede ninania, imane: Böi! Yohane labe''e töinia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 61, '

Ba lamane khönia: Samösa lö''ö, motöi ya''ami, sotöi da''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 62, 'Ba lakhawi tangara namania, wanofu, hadia zomasi ia, töi nono.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 63, '

Ba i''andrö wanura, isura, imane: Yohane döinia. Ba oi ahöli-höli dödöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 64, '

Ba i''anema''ö tebokai mbawania, ba aefa lelania, ba humede ia, isuno Lowalangi.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 65, '

Ba tobali ihawui fa''ata''u fefu mbanuara, ba tedunö-dunö da''ö fefu ba hili Yudaia andrö ma''asambua.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 66, 'Ba latanö ba dödöra dozi samondrongo, lamane: Ta''ila he wisa dania nono da''ö? noa sa göi itolo ia tanga Zo''aya.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 67, '

Ba fahöna Geheha ni''amoni''ö khö namania Sakharia, mama''ele''ö ia, imane:', '[]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 68, '

"Nisuno Zo''aya, Lowalangi Ndraono Gizeraeli andrö, me no möi ia mufaigi mbanuaNia, ba me no i''asogö khöra wangöhöli,', '["Faigi 7:16; Sin 111:9","Sin 132:17","Yes 35:4; Yer 23:6; HalZin 3:21,24","Sin 106:10","Yer 31:33","Gal 1:4; Heb 2:15; 9:14","Efes 4:24; Tit 2:11—14","Faigi 1:17; Mat 3:3","Faigi 3:3; Yes 31:34","Mal 4:2; Yes 60:1,2","Yes 9:2; 49:6; Mat 4:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 69, 'ba no ifasindro khöda dandru fangorifi, ba nomo genoninia Dawido andrö,', '["Faigi 7:16; Sin 111:9","Sin 132:17","Yes 35:4; Yer 23:6; HalZin 3:21,24","Sin 106:10","Yer 31:33","Gal 1:4; Heb 2:15; 9:14","Efes 4:24; Tit 2:11—14","Faigi 1:17; Mat 3:3","Faigi 3:3; Yes 31:34","Mal 4:2; Yes 60:1,2","Yes 9:2; 49:6; Mat 4:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 70, 'itörö nifaŵa''ögönia, ni''ombakha''ö zama''ele''ö ni''amoni''ö andrö khönia, sagötö tanö sa''ae:', '["Faigi 7:16; Sin 111:9","Sin 132:17","Yes 35:4; Yer 23:6; HalZin 3:21,24","Sin 106:10","Yer 31:33","Gal 1:4; Heb 2:15; 9:14","Efes 4:24; Tit 2:11—14","Faigi 1:17; Mat 3:3","Faigi 3:3; Yes 31:34","Mal 4:2; Yes 60:1,2","Yes 9:2; 49:6; Mat 4:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 71, 'fangefa ba nemalida, ba ba danga zi fatiu tödö khöda fefu.', '["Faigi 7:16; Sin 111:9","Sin 132:17","Yes 35:4; Yer 23:6; HalZin 3:21,24","Sin 106:10","Yer 31:33","Gal 1:4; Heb 2:15; 9:14","Efes 4:24; Tit 2:11—14","Faigi 1:17; Mat 3:3","Faigi 3:3; Yes 31:34","Mal 4:2; Yes 60:1,2","Yes 9:2; 49:6; Mat 4:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 72, 'Ena''ö ihakhösi tödö ndra tuada ba ena''ö itörö tödönia gamabu''ula li, ni''amoni''ö andrö khönia,', '["Faigi 7:16; Sin 111:9","Sin 132:17","Yes 35:4; Yer 23:6; HalZin 3:21,24","Sin 106:10","Yer 31:33","Gal 1:4; Heb 2:15; 9:14","Efes 4:24; Tit 2:11—14","Faigi 1:17; Mat 3:3","Faigi 3:3; Yes 31:34","Mal 4:2; Yes 60:1,2","Yes 9:2; 49:6; Mat 4:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 73, 'fahölusa andrö, me fahölu ia khö duada Aberahamo;', '["Faigi 7:16; Sin 111:9","Sin 132:17","Yes 35:4; Yer 23:6; HalZin 3:21,24","Sin 106:10","Yer 31:33","Gal 1:4; Heb 2:15; 9:14","Efes 4:24; Tit 2:11—14","Faigi 1:17; Mat 3:3","Faigi 3:3; Yes 31:34","Mal 4:2; Yes 60:1,2","Yes 9:2; 49:6; Mat 4:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 74, 'ba wanolo ya''ita, fa döhö wa''ata''u, aefa ita ba danga nemalida, enoninia ita,', '["Faigi 7:16; Sin 111:9","Sin 132:17","Yes 35:4; Yer 23:6; HalZin 3:21,24","Sin 106:10","Yer 31:33","Gal 1:4; Heb 2:15; 9:14","Efes 4:24; Tit 2:11—14","Faigi 1:17; Mat 3:3","Faigi 3:3; Yes 31:34","Mal 4:2; Yes 60:1,2","Yes 9:2; 49:6; Mat 4:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 75, 'sohau-hau ita ba satulö tödö, fönania, sagötö ya''ita.', '["Faigi 7:16; Sin 111:9","Sin 132:17","Yes 35:4; Yer 23:6; HalZin 3:21,24","Sin 106:10","Yer 31:33","Gal 1:4; Heb 2:15; 9:14","Efes 4:24; Tit 2:11—14","Faigi 1:17; Mat 3:3","Faigi 3:3; Yes 31:34","Mal 4:2; Yes 60:1,2","Yes 9:2; 49:6; Mat 4:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 76, 'Ba ya''ugö, ono, ba sama''ele''ö khö Wondrege Zalaŵa andrö labe''e töimö, me sowaö-waö ndra''ugö föna Zo''aya, ba wangehao lalania,', '["Faigi 7:16; Sin 111:9","Sin 132:17","Yes 35:4; Yer 23:6; HalZin 3:21,24","Sin 106:10","Yer 31:33","Gal 1:4; Heb 2:15; 9:14","Efes 4:24; Tit 2:11—14","Faigi 1:17; Mat 3:3","Faigi 3:3; Yes 31:34","Mal 4:2; Yes 60:1,2","Yes 9:2; 49:6; Mat 4:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 77, 'ba wamotokhi ba dödö mbanuaNia wangorifi andrö, ba wangefa horöra andrö;', '["Faigi 7:16; Sin 111:9","Sin 132:17","Yes 35:4; Yer 23:6; HalZin 3:21,24","Sin 106:10","Yer 31:33","Gal 1:4; Heb 2:15; 9:14","Efes 4:24; Tit 2:11—14","Faigi 1:17; Mat 3:3","Faigi 3:3; Yes 31:34","Mal 4:2; Yes 60:1,2","Yes 9:2; 49:6; Mat 4:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 78, 'börö wa''ahakhö dödö Lowalangi andrö, si ndruhu-ndruhu; ba da''ö moroi, wa no möi mufaigi ita zi tumbu moroi si yaŵa andrö,', '["Faigi 7:16; Sin 111:9","Sin 132:17","Yes 35:4; Yer 23:6; HalZin 3:21,24","Sin 106:10","Yer 31:33","Gal 1:4; Heb 2:15; 9:14","Efes 4:24; Tit 2:11—14","Faigi 1:17; Mat 3:3","Faigi 3:3; Yes 31:34","Mal 4:2; Yes 60:1,2","Yes 9:2; 49:6; Mat 4:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 79, 'ba wangoroma''ö ya''ia khöra, si dadao ba zogömi-gömi ba ba lumö wa''amate, ba ifasao ita ba lala saekhu ba wa''ohahau dödö."', '["Faigi 7:16; Sin 111:9","Sin 132:17","Yes 35:4; Yer 23:6; HalZin 3:21,24","Sin 106:10","Yer 31:33","Gal 1:4; Heb 2:15; 9:14","Efes 4:24; Tit 2:11—14","Faigi 1:17; Mat 3:3","Faigi 3:3; Yes 31:34","Mal 4:2; Yes 60:1,2","Yes 9:2; 49:6; Mat 4:16"]', NULL),
  (3393924, 'NT', 'Luka', 1, 80, '

Ba manöi nono, ba tobali sabölö eheha, ba ba danö si mate so ia, irugi luo wama''ele''ö ya''ia ba Ndraono Gizeraeli.', '["Faigi 2:40; Mat 3:1"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 1, 'Ba me luo da''ö, ba ibe''e goroisa kaizaro Auguso, latanö ba zura fefu döi niha ba danö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 2, 'Fananö töi andrö, ba si föföna, me luo kumandru ba Ziria Girenio andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 3, 'Ba möi niha fefu, ba wamatanö''ö töira ba zura, isaŵa mbanua zatua khöra zamösana.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 4, '

Ba möi göi misi yaŵa Yosefo andrö, moroi ba Galilaia, moroi ba mbanua Nazareta; isaŵa Yudaia, mbanua Dawido andrö, sotöi Betilekhema, me ma''uwu Dawido ia,', '["Faigi 1:26,27; SamI 17:12; Mikha 5:2; Yoh 7:41","Faigi 1:31 btn; Mat 1:18 btn"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 5, 'ba wamatanö''ö ba zura töira, awö Maria, fo''omonia, si no manabina.', '["Faigi 1:26,27; SamI 17:12; Mikha 5:2; Yoh 7:41","Faigi 1:31 btn; Mat 1:18 btn"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 6, '

Ba tobali, me so ira ba da''ö, ba irugi baŵania wo''ono, ba madono ia,', '["Mat 1:25"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 7, 'ononia si a''a, ono matua, ilölö ba ifagaya ba luha, me lö nahara ba nomo ba zi mörö zikoli.', '["Mat 1:25"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 8, '

Ba so gubalo ba danöra andrö, si mörö ba danö, manaro biri-birira, ba zi bongi.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 9, 'Ba i''ondrasi ira mala''ika Zo''aya, ba ifasui ira haga Zo''aya, ba oi so wa''ata''ura.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 10, '

Ba imane khöra mala''ika andrö: Böi mi''ata''ufi. Hiza sa, uturiagö khömi wa''omuso dödö, sabölö-bölö, si rugi niha fefu dania.', '["Yes 9:2,3,6; 49:6"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 11, 'Me no tumbu khömi zangorifi andrö, bongi andre, Keriso, So''aya, ba mbanua Dawido.', '["Yes 9:2,3,6; 49:6"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 12, 'Ba da''ö dandra khömi; ba luha yaŵa dania mi''ila nono, no mulölö.', '["Yes 9:2,3,6; 49:6"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 13, '

Ba i''anema''ö so mala''ika zorugo sato, awö mala''ika no mege, lasuno Lowalangi, lamane:', '["Rom 5:1; Efes 2:14,17"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 14, 'Lakhömi khö Lowalangi si yaŵa, ba fa''atulö ba guli danö, ba niha ni''omasi''ö andrö.', '["Rom 5:1; Efes 2:14,17"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 15, '

Ba me no mofanö mala''ika andrö, ba zorugo, me no laröi ira, ba faoma lamane kubalo andrö khö nawöra: Talabu ba Mbetilekhema ba tafaigi da''ö, nifa''ombakha''ögö Zo''aya khöda.', '["Mat 2:11"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 16, 'Ba la''alio''ö we''amöi, ba falukha ira ndra Maria, Yosefo, awö nono no mege, nifagaya ba luha.', '["Mat 2:11"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 17, '

Ba me no la''ila, ba la''ombakha''ö daroma li andrö, niŵa''ö khöra, ba nono andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 18, 'Ba dozi samondrongo, ba ahöli-höli dödö, ba ni''ombakha''ö gubalo andrö khöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 19, '

Ba lö olifu Maria fefu niŵa''ö andrö, ifatou-tou tödönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 20, '

Ba lafuli ira kubalo andrö, lafosumange Lowalangi, lasuno ia, ba nirongora ba ba ni''ila höröra, balazi niŵa''ö khöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 21, '

Ba me no irugi fitu bongi, ba wamoto ya''ia, ba labe''e töinia Yesu, nitötöi mala''ika no, me lö''ö na tabina ia.', '["Faigi 1:31","MozIII 12:2 btn","Mangaruwusi eluahania molohe nono sawuyu sawena tumbu föna zatua ma föna Lowalangi ba wangandrö howu-howu. Tehalö moroi ba wehede foruwu eluahania adu zatua.","MozII 13:2,12-15","MozIII 12:6-8"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 22, 'Ba me no aefa mbongi wangehao khö Maria, niŵa''ö ba goroisa Moze andrö, ba la''ohe ba Yeruzalema nono, ba wangaruwusi ya''ia khö Zo''aya.', '["Faigi 1:31","MozIII 12:2 btn","Mangaruwusi eluahania molohe nono sawuyu sawena tumbu föna zatua ma föna Lowalangi ba wangandrö howu-howu. Tehalö moroi ba wehede foruwu eluahania adu zatua.","MozII 13:2,12-15","MozIII 12:6-8"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 23, 'La''o''ö zi so ba zura goroisa Zo''aya, imane: Fefu nono matua, na si a''a nono khö ninania, ba ni''amoni''ö khö Zo''aya', '["Faigi 1:31","MozIII 12:2 btn","Mangaruwusi eluahania molohe nono sawuyu sawena tumbu föna zatua ma föna Lowalangi ba wangandrö howu-howu. Tehalö moroi ba wehede foruwu eluahania adu zatua.","MozII 13:2,12-15","MozIII 12:6-8"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 24, 'ba wame''e sumange, si mane niŵa''ö ba goroisa Zo''aya, dombua wune, ba ma dombua nono marafadi.', '["Faigi 1:31","MozIII 12:2 btn","Mangaruwusi eluahania molohe nono sawuyu sawena tumbu föna zatua ma föna Lowalangi ba wangandrö howu-howu. Tehalö moroi ba wehede foruwu eluahania adu zatua.","MozII 13:2,12-15","MozIII 12:6-8"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 25, '

Ba hiza, so niha ba Yeruzalema Simeoni döinia, ba satulö tödö niha da''ö, sangata''ufi Lowalangi, no ibalo-baloi wondrara dödö Ndraono Gizeraeli andrö, ba so Geheha ni''amoni''ö ba dödönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 26, 'Ba no ibokai khönia Eheha Ni''amoni''ö andrö, lö tola i''ila wa''amate, na lö ni''ilania ua Keriso Zo''aya andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 27, '

Ba möi ia ba gosali, nifarou Geheha; ba me la''ohe bakha nonora Yesu ira inania, ba wanörö khönia nifakhoi ba goroisa,', '[]', NULL);


Awena ohahau dödö genoniu, na ö''efa''ö ia, So''aya, itörö niŵa''öu,', '["MozI. 46:30","Faigi 3:6; MozI 49:10, 18","Sin 98:2,3; Yes 52:10","Yes 42:6"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 30, 'me no i''ila hörögu wangorifi andrö khöu,', '["MozI. 46:30","Faigi 3:6; MozI 49:10, 18","Sin 98:2,3; Yes 52:10","Yes 42:6"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 31, 'si no ö''asogö tanö föna niha fefu, gofu ha soi ira,', '["MozI. 46:30","Faigi 3:6; MozI 49:10, 18","Sin 98:2,3; Yes 52:10","Yes 42:6"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 32, 'haga ni''oroma''ö ba niha baero, ba lakhömi mbanuau Iraono Gizeraeli.', '["MozI. 46:30","Faigi 3:6; MozI 49:10, 18","Sin 98:2,3; Yes 52:10","Yes 42:6"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 33, '

Ba ahöli-höli dödö ndra amania inania ba niŵa''ö andrö ba khönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 34, '

Ba ifahowu''ö ira Simeoni ba imane khö ninania Maria: Hiza, tebe''e dania, ato zalau ba ato zi maoso ba da''e, ba Ndraono Gizeraeli, ba tebe''e tandra ia, nifadaö,', '["Yes 8:14 b.t., 28:16; Rom 9:33; KorI 1:23 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 35, 'ba tödöu andrö, ba itörö föda dania, ena''ö ato zi teboka era-era dödö.', '["Yes 8:14 b.t., 28:16; Rom 9:33; KorI 1:23 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 36, '

Ba so zama''ele''ö ira alawe, Ana döinia, ono Wanueli, mado Gaseri, no arara ba guli danö, no lahalö ia föna, me ono alawe ia na, ba ha mewitu fakhe,', '["TimI 5:5"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 37, 'ba lakha mbanua ia, no ŵalu ngafulu a öfa fakhe wa''atua. Lö iröi-röi gosali, ifosumange Lowalangi famoni ba fangandrö-ngandrö, bongi ma''ökhö.', '["TimI 5:5"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 38, '

Ba ba da''ö sibai i''ondrasi ira, isuno Lowalangi ba itörö linia khöra fefu sombalo-mbaloi fangöhöli andrö ba Yeruzalema.', '["Faigi 23:51"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 39, '

Ba me no ahori latörö fefu hadia ia, wolo''ö oroisa Zo''aya andrö, ba lafuli ira ba Galilaia ba mbanuara Nazareta.', '["Mat 2:19-23","Faigi 1:80"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 40, 'Ba manöi nono, ba abölö, fahöna khönia wa''atua-tua, ba no falukha ia wa''ebua dödö Lowalangi.', '["Mat 2:19-23","Faigi 1:80"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 41, '

Ba ero röfi möi misi yaŵa ba Yeruzalema ndra inania, na owasa fasa.', '["MozII 23:15; MozV 16:1 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 42, 'Ba me no mewelendrua fakhe ia, ba möi ira misi yaŵa göi, la''o''ö huku ba gowasa.', '["MozII 23:15; MozV 16:1 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 43, '

Ba me no irugi bongi andrö, me lafuli ira, ba toröi ba Yeruzalema nono, Yesu; ba lö la''ila ira inania.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 44, 'Lawai so ia ba nawöra fao, ba möi ira, ma''ökhö fofanö, wangalui ya''ia, ba dalifusöra ba ba zi no fa''ila li khöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 45, '

Ba me lö lasöndra ia, ba lafuli ira ba Yeruzalema, wangalui ya''ia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 46, 'Ba tölu bongi, ba lasöndra ia ba gosali, no dumadao ia ba hunö zamahaö, wamondrondrongo khöra, awö wanofu-nofu khöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 47, '

Ba dozi samondrondrongo khönia, ba ahöli-höli dödö, ba wa''atua-tuania ba ba wanemania li.', '["Yoh 7:15"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 48, '

Ba tobali dödöra, me la''ila ia, ba imane khönia inania: He onogu! Hana wa ömanö khöma? Faigi, no abu dödöma amau, wangalui ya''ugö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 49, '

Ba imane khöra: Hadia wa mi''alui ndra''o? Hadia, lö mi''ila, wa lö tola lö sodo ba nahia Namagu!', '["Yoh 4:34"]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 50, '

Ba lö aboto ba dödöra daroma li andrö, niŵa''önia khöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 51, '

Ba fao ia khöra, we''amöi misi tou, ba larugi Nazareta, ba i''o''ö lira.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393925, 'NT', 'Luka', 2, 52, '

Ba tedou khö Yesu wa''atua-tua ba fa''ebua ba fa''ebua dödö Lowalangi, awö wa''ebua dödö niha.', '["SamI 2:26"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 1, 'Ba me no alua mewele''öfa fakhe razo kaizaro Tiberio andrö, me kumandru ba Yudaia Wondrio Filato, me salaŵa ba Galilaia Herode, ba zi sagörö ni''o''öfa tanö; ba me salaŵa ba zi sagörö dalifusönia Filifo, ba Gituraia ba ba danö Darakhoniti, ba me salaŵa ba zi sagörö zui Lisania, ba Gabilene;', '["Mat 27:2; 14:1,3","Faigi 1:80; Yoh 1:6; 11:49; 18:13"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 2, 'me ere sebua Hanasi ba Kayafa andrö; ba da''ö humede Lowalangi khö Yohane, ono Zakharia andrö, ba danö si mate.', '["Mat 27:2; 14:1,3","Faigi 1:80; Yoh 1:6; 11:49; 18:13"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 3, '

Ba itöröi danö si fatambai Yoridano fefu, wanuriagö famayagö idanö andrö, famalalini era-era, ba wangefa''ö horö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 4, '

Itörö zi so ba zura huhuo Yesaya andrö, imane: "Li zi''ao ba danö si mate: Mihaogö lala Zo''aya, mifadaya lalania.', '["Yes 40:3; Mal 3:1","Yes 52:10"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 5, 'Nifo''ösi fefu mbawa danö, ba fefu hili, awö hili-hili, ba nihöndrögö; ni''adölö''ö zabila, ba lala siwedeö, ba ni''a''alösöi''ö;', '["Yes 40:3; Mal 3:1","Yes 52:10"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 6, 'ba dozi niha, ba la''ila dania wangorifi andrö, khö Lowalangi."', '["Yes 40:3; Mal 3:1","Yes 52:10"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 7, '

Imane sa ba niha sato, si möi baero khönia, ba wamabayagö''ö idanö ya''ira khönia: He ya''ami, ono gulö! ha niha zanguma''ö khömi, aefa ami ba wönu andrö dania?', '["Mat 7:19"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 8, 'Andrö mi''asogö mbua-bua, si nangea bua-bua wamalilini era-era, ba böi mibörötaigö miŵa''ö tödömi: "Furugöma Gaberahamo." Uŵa''ö sa khömi, i''ila Lowalangi ibali''ö ma''uwu Gaberahamo gara andrö.', '["Mat 7:19"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 9, 'Ba noa sa mufaudugö göi wato ba ŵa''a geu andrö, ba fefu döla geu, si lö mowua bua si sökhi, ba la''obö, ba latibo''ö ba galitö.', '["Mat 7:19"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 10, '

Ba lasofu khönia sato, lamane: Ba he mawisa?', '["HalZin 2:37","Yak 2:15","Mat 21:31,32","Faigi 19:8","MozIII 19:18"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 11, 'Ba itema lira, imane khöra: Si dua görö baru, ba yamube''e zagörö ba zi lö baru, ba yamanö göi zi so balazo.', '["HalZin 2:37","Yak 2:15","Mat 21:31,32","Faigi 19:8","MozIII 19:18"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 12, 'Ba möi göi zanema beo, ba wamabayagö''ö idanö ya''ira, ba lamane khönia: He samahaö, he mawisa?', '["HalZin 2:37","Yak 2:15","Mat 21:31,32","Faigi 19:8","MozIII 19:18"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 13, 'Ba imane khöra: Böi mi''andrö zi töra moroi ba nihuku andrö khömi.', '["HalZin 2:37","Yak 2:15","Mat 21:31,32","Faigi 19:8","MozIII 19:18"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 14, 'Ba lasofu göi khönia saradadu andrö, lamane: He mawisa göi, ya''aga andre? Ba imane khöra: Böi mifakao niha, ba böi mitandraŵaisi, ba böi mikökö-kökö ba wa''ide-ide luomi.', '["HalZin 2:37","Yak 2:15","Mat 21:31,32","Faigi 19:8","MozIII 19:18"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 15, '

Ba me lafaigi-faigi niha sato, me la''owanö-wanöi tödöra, ba khö Yohane andrö, ma ta''ila ya''ia Keriso andrö,', '["Yoh 1:19","Hes 36:26 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 16, 'ba humede Yohane, imane khöra fefu: Ya''odo, ba idanö ubayagö khömi, ba so dania zabölö moröi khögu, khönia ambö ndra''o sanoto''ö böbö mbadagahenia, ba Eheha ni''amoni''ö ba alitö ibayagö khömi da''ö dania.', '["Yoh 1:19","Hes 36:26 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 17, 'So ba dangania döri, ba wangehao olayama mbasitö khönia, ba ba wangozaragö ba halasania ulitö andrö, ba adaya, ba itunu ba galitö si lö mate-mate.', '["Yoh 1:19","Hes 36:26 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 18, '

Ba oya na ngawalö tanö bö''ö khönia, famarou dödö, wangombakha turia somuso dödö andrö, ba niha sato.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 19, '

Ba maoso Herode andrö, salaŵa ba zi sagörö ni''o''öfa danö, nitegunia ba khö Herodia andrö, fo''omo dalifusönia, ba ba zi lö sökhi andrö fefu, nifazökhi Herode, inönö na da''ö fefu,', '["Mar 6:17 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 20, 'ikuru Yohane andrö, bakha ba gurunga.', '["Mar 6:17 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 21, '

Ba me oi lafabayagö''ö idanö ira niha sato, me tebayagö göi Yesu, me mangandrö ia, ba teboka mbanua si yaŵa.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 22, 'Ba möi mitou khönia Geheha ni''amoni''ö, moboto wamaigira, hulö marafadi; ba so zihede moroi ba zorugo, imane: Onogu omasiö ndra''ugö, somasi ndra''o.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 23, '

Ba ya''ia, Yesu, ba arakha tölu ngafulu fakhe, me ibörötaigö mamahaö, ono Yosefo ia laŵa''ö; ba Yosefo, ba ono Eli,', '["Ayati 23-38: Mat 1:1-16","Faigi 4:22; Mat 13:55; MozIV 36:8,9; 27:8","SamII 5:14","Nga''ötI 1:24-27","MozI 5:3-32","MozI 5:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 24, 'ba ono Mata da''ö, ba ono Lewi da''ö, ba ono Melekhi da''ö, ba ono Yana''i da''ö, ba ono Yosefo da''ö,', '["Ayati 23-38: Mat 1:1-16","Faigi 4:22; Mat 13:55; MozIV 36:8,9; 27:8","SamII 5:14","Nga''ötI 1:24-27","MozI 5:3-32","MozI 5:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 25, 'ba ono Matatia da''ö, ba ono Gamosi da''ö, ba ono Na''uma da''ö, ba ono Geseli da''ö, ba ono Nangai da''ö,', '["Ayati 23-38: Mat 1:1-16","Faigi 4:22; Mat 13:55; MozIV 36:8,9; 27:8","SamII 5:14","Nga''ötI 1:24-27","MozI 5:3-32","MozI 5:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 26, 'ba ono Ma''ata da''ö, ba ono Matatia da''ö, ba ono Zema''i da''ö, ba ono Yosekho da''ö, ba ono Yuda da''ö,', '["Ayati 23-38: Mat 1:1-16","Faigi 4:22; Mat 13:55; MozIV 36:8,9; 27:8","SamII 5:14","Nga''ötI 1:24-27","MozI 5:3-32","MozI 5:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 27, 'ba ono Yo''ana da''ö, ba ono Resa da''ö, ba ono Zerubabeli da''ö, ba ono Zalatieli da''ö, ba ono Neri da''ö,', '["Ayati 23-38: Mat 1:1-16","Faigi 4:22; Mat 13:55; MozIV 36:8,9; 27:8","SamII 5:14","Nga''ötI 1:24-27","MozI 5:3-32","MozI 5:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 28, 'ba ono Melekhi da''ö, ba ono Nadi da''ö, ba ono Gosa da''ö, ba ono Gelimada da''ö, ba ono Gero da''ö,', '["Ayati 23-38: Mat 1:1-16","Faigi 4:22; Mat 13:55; MozIV 36:8,9; 27:8","SamII 5:14","Nga''ötI 1:24-27","MozI 5:3-32","MozI 5:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 29, 'ba ono Yesu da''ö, ba ono Geliezeri da''ö, ba ono Yore da''ö, ba ono Mata da''ö,', '["Ayati 23-38: Mat 1:1-16","Faigi 4:22; Mat 13:55; MozIV 36:8,9; 27:8","SamII 5:14","Nga''ötI 1:24-27","MozI 5:3-32","MozI 5:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 30, 'ba ono Lewi da''ö, ba ono Zimeoni da''ö, ba ono Yuda da''ö, ba ono Yosefo da''ö, ba ono Yona da''ö, ba ono Geliaki da''ö,', '["Ayati 23-38: Mat 1:1-16","Faigi 4:22; Mat 13:55; MozIV 36:8,9; 27:8","SamII 5:14","Nga''ötI 1:24-27","MozI 5:3-32","MozI 5:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 31, 'ba ono Melea da''ö, ba ono Mena da''ö, ba ono Matata da''ö, ba ono Natano da''ö, ba ono Dawido da''ö,', '["Ayati 23-38: Mat 1:1-16","Faigi 4:22; Mat 13:55; MozIV 36:8,9; 27:8","SamII 5:14","Nga''ötI 1:24-27","MozI 5:3-32","MozI 5:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 32, 'ba ono Giza''i da''ö, ba ono Gobedi da''ö, ba ono Mboasi da''ö, ba ono Zala da''ö', '["Ayati 23-38: Mat 1:1-16","Faigi 4:22; Mat 13:55; MozIV 36:8,9; 27:8","SamII 5:14","Nga''ötI 1:24-27","MozI 5:3-32","MozI 5:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 33, 'ba ono Nahaso da''ö, ba ono Gaminadabi da''ö, ba ono Gadami da''ö, ba ono Gareni da''ö, ba ono Geseromo da''ö, ba ono Weresi da''ö, ba ono Yuda da''ö,', '["Ayati 23-38: Mat 1:1-16","Faigi 4:22; Mat 13:55; MozIV 36:8,9; 27:8","SamII 5:14","Nga''ötI 1:24-27","MozI 5:3-32","MozI 5:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 34, 'ba ono Yakobo da''ö, ba ono Giza''aki da''ö, ba ono Gaberahamo da''ö, ba ono Dara da''ö, ba ono Nakhori da''ö,', '["Ayati 23-38: Mat 1:1-16","Faigi 4:22; Mat 13:55; MozIV 36:8,9; 27:8","SamII 5:14","Nga''ötI 1:24-27","MozI 5:3-32","MozI 5:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 35, 'ba ono Zerukhi da''ö, ba ono Ragu da''ö, ba ono Waleki da''ö, ba ono Geberi da''ö, ba ono Zala da''ö,', '["Ayati 23-38: Mat 1:1-16","Faigi 4:22; Mat 13:55; MozIV 36:8,9; 27:8","SamII 5:14","Nga''ötI 1:24-27","MozI 5:3-32","MozI 5:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 36, 'ba ono Ga''ina da''ö, ba ono Garafasa da''ö, ba ono Zemi da''ö, ba ono Noakhi da''ö, ba ono Lameki da''ö,', '["Ayati 23-38: Mat 1:1-16","Faigi 4:22; Mat 13:55; MozIV 36:8,9; 27:8","SamII 5:14","Nga''ötI 1:24-27","MozI 5:3-32","MozI 5:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 37, 'ba ono Metusala da''ö, ba ono Khenoki da''ö, ba ono Yaredi da''ö, ba ono Maleleli da''ö, ba ono Ka''ina da''ö,', '["Ayati 23-38: Mat 1:1-16","Faigi 4:22; Mat 13:55; MozIV 36:8,9; 27:8","SamII 5:14","Nga''ötI 1:24-27","MozI 5:3-32","MozI 5:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393927, 'NT', 'Luka', 3, 38, 'ba ono Genosi da''ö, ba ono Zeti da''ö, ba ono Gadamo da''ö, ba khö Lowalangi da''ö.', '["Ayati 23-38: Mat 1:1-16","Faigi 4:22; Mat 13:55; MozIV 36:8,9; 27:8","SamII 5:14","Nga''ötI 1:24-27","MozI 5:3-32","MozI 5:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 1, 'Ba mangawuli Yesu moroi ba Yoridano; no fahöna khönia Geheha ni''amoni''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 2, '

ba itandraigö ia Afökha, öfa wulu wongi wa''ara. Ba lö si manga ia, götö mbongi andrö, ba me no aefa da''ö, ba olofo ia.', '["MozII 34:28; SalI 19:8"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 3, '

Ba imane khönia Afökha: Na ono Lowalangi ndra''ugö, ba hede ba gara andrö, ena''ö tobali roti.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 4, '

Ba itema linia Yesu, imane: No so ba zura: "Tenga ha ba gönia auri niha."', '["MozV 8:3"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 5, '

Ba i''ohe ia yaŵa ba hili, i''oroma''ö khönia fefu mbanua ba guli danö, ha mamö''i hörö wa''ara.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 6, '

Ba imane khönia Afökha: Khöu ube''e wa''abölö andrö fefu, awö lakhöminia; noa sa mube''e ba dangagu, ba ube''e ba zomasido.', '["Yoh 14:30; KorII 4:4"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 7, 'Ba na ötuhi danö fönagu, wangalulu khögu, ba khöu dania ia fefu.', '["Yoh 14:30; KorII 4:4"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 8, '

Ba itema linia Yesu, imane khönia: No so ba zura: "Khö Zo''aya ya''ugö mangalulu ndra''ugö, ba ha ya''ia öfosumange."', '["MozV 6:13"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 9, '

Ba i''ohe ia ba Yeruzalema, ifa''aso ba mbumbu gosali, imane khönia: Na Ono Lowalangi ndra''ugö, ba tibo''ögö tou ba da''e.', '["Sin 91:11 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 10, 'Noa sa so ba zura: "Iŵa''ö ba mala''ika andrö khönia, ba khömö andrö, ena''ö larorogö ndra''ugö;', '["Sin 91:11 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 11, 'lataya dania tangara ndra''ugö, fa böi manendre gaheu ba gara."', '["Sin 91:11 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 12, '

Ba itema linia Yesu, imane khönia: No muŵa''ö: "Böi tandraigö Lowalangi, So''aya ya''ugö."', '["MozV 6:16"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 13, '

Ba me no i''o''ozui Afökha fefu wanandraigö, ba iböhöi ia ua, folombase ginötö.', '["Mat 4:23 b.t"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 14, 'Ba ifuli ia ba Galilaia Yesu, ba wa''abölö Geheha, ba humöngö duriania ba danö si fasui andrö fefu.', '["Mat 4:23 b.t"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 15, 'Ba mamahaö ia ba zekola khöra, ba oi dozi lasuno ia.', '["Mat 4:23 b.t"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 16, '

Ba irugi Nazareta, ba zebua ia, ba möi ia ba zekola, me luo sabato; itörö zi no to''ölö ia; ba muzizio ia, ba wombaso sura.', '["Mat 13:54 b.t.; Mar 6:1 b.t.","Yes 61:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 17, 'Ba labe''e khönia zura Yesaya, sama''ele''ö andrö, ba me ibokai zura andrö, ba i''ila nisura andre:', '["Mat 13:54 b.t.; Mar 6:1 b.t.","Yes 61:1,2"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 18, '

No so khögu Geheha Zo''aya, me no ibayoini ndra''o, no ifatenge ndra''o, ba wangombakha turia somuso dödö andrö, ba zi numana,', '["MozIII 25:10"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 19, 'ba wanuriagö fangefa ba nikuru, awö wangila niha ba zagau''a, ba womolala nifakao, ba wangefa, ba wanuriagö döfi omasiö andrö khö Zo''aya.', '["MozIII 25:10"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 20, '

Ba igölugö zura, ibe''e khö zangai halöŵö, ba mudadao ia. Ba oi lanehegö ia, dozi si so ba zekola andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 21, 'Ba ibörötaigö fahuhuo khöra, imane: Ma''ökhö andre no itörö zi so ba zura andrö, irongo tögi dalingami.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 22, '

Ba oi dozi lafaduhu''ö ia, ba ahöli-höli dödöra, ba daroma li andrö, somasi niha huhuonia andrö, ba lamane: Hadia, tenga ono Yosefo da''ö?', '["Sin 45:3; Mar 6:2 b.t.; Yoh 6:42","Mat 13:57","SalI 17:1,9; Yak 5:17","SalII 5:14"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 23, 'Ba imane khöra: Duhu, miŵa''ö sa khögu gamaedola andrö: "Dalu-daluni ndra''ugö, same''e dalu-dalu!" Hadia nirongoma, nilau ba Gafanauma, ba lau göi ba da''e, ba mbanuada.', '["Sin 45:3; Mar 6:2 b.t.; Yoh 6:42","Mat 13:57","SalI 17:1,9; Yak 5:17","SalII 5:14"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 24, 'Ba imane: Si ndruhu niŵa''ögu khömi, lö sama''ele''ö, somasi mbanuara,', '["Sin 45:3; Mar 6:2 b.t.; Yoh 6:42","Mat 13:57","SalI 17:1,9; Yak 5:17","SalII 5:14"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 25, 'Ba uŵa''ö khömi, tenga faya: Ato lakha mbanua ba Ndraono Gizeraeli, me luo so Geliya, me teduhö mbanua si yaŵa zi medölu fakhe a matonga, me tobali lofo sebua ba danö ma''asagörö,', '["Sin 45:3; Mar 6:2 b.t.; Yoh 6:42","Mat 13:57","SalI 17:1,9; Yak 5:17","SalII 5:14"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 26, 'ba lö nifatenge Eliya, samösa lö''ö, ha ba Zarefa andrö, ba danö Zidona, ba ndra alawe, lakha mbanua andrö.', '["Sin 45:3; Mar 6:2 b.t.; Yoh 6:42","Mat 13:57","SalI 17:1,9; Yak 5:17","SalII 5:14"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 27, 'Ba ato zobou auri ba Ndraono Gizeraeli, me luo Gelisa andrö, sama''ele''ö, ba samösa lö nifadöhö fökhö, ya''ira, baero Ndrawa Garamo andrö, Na''ema.', '["Sin 45:3; Mar 6:2 b.t.; Yoh 6:42","Mat 13:57","SalI 17:1,9; Yak 5:17","SalII 5:14"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 28, '

Ba dozi si so ba zekola andrö, ba mofönu sibai, me larongo da''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 29, 'Ba maoso ira, latuli''ö ia baero mbanua la''ohe ia ba zinga hili andrö, ba nitaru''ö banua andrö khöra, ena''ö latibo''ö ia si tou.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 30, '

Ba itörö manö gotaluara, wofanö.', '["Yoh 8:59"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 31, '

Ba irugi si tou Gafanauma, banua ba Galilaia andrö, ba ifahaö ira, na luo sabato;', '["Mat 4:13 b.t.","Mat 7:28 b.t.; Mar 1:21 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 32, 'ba tobali dödöra ba wamahaönia, me huhuo sabölö huhuonia.', '["Mat 4:13 b.t.","Mat 7:28 b.t.; Mar 1:21 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 33, '

Ba so ba zekola andrö niha sobekhu si ra''iö. Ba mu''ao ia, ebua linia, imane:', '["Mat 13:54"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 34, 'Alai ndra''o! hadia niŵa''öu khöma, Yesu, banua Nazareta? Hadia, ba wamakiko ya''aga möi ndra''ugö? U''ila ha niha ndra''ugö, ni''amoni''ö andrö, khö Lowalangi!', '["Mat 13:54"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 35, '

Ba itenaŵa ia Yesu, imane: Böi hede-hede, ba heta''ö khönia. Ba ilaugö tou ia bekhu andrö, ba hunö niha ba iheta ia khönia, lö''ö sa ifakiko.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 36, '

Ba oi tobali dödöra fefu, ba fahuhuo ira, lamane: Hadia li da''ö, wa tola manö i''abe''e''ö wanguma''ö ba mbekhu si ra''iö andrö, ba laheta ira?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 37, '

Ba humöngö duriania ba mbanua si fasui andrö fefu.', '[]', NULL);


Ba maoso ia, iheta ia ba zekola, möi ia ba nomo Zimoni. Ba no akhömö sibai matua Zimoni ira alawe, ba mangandrö ira khönia, ba khönia andrö.', '["Ayati 38-41: Mat 8:14-17; Mar 1:29-34"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 39, 'Ba ifaöndrö ia yaŵania, itenaŵa wa''akhömö andrö, ba döhö. Ba i''anema''ö maoso, möi ia ngoni-ngoninia.', '["Ayati 38-41: Mat 8:14-17; Mar 1:29-34"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 40, '

Ba aekhu-aekhu luo, ba dozi si so sofökhö, hadia ia ngawalö wökhö, ba la''ohe khönia. Ba idozigö ira wanufa tangania, wamadöhö fökhöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 41, 'Ba ato göi zaheta bekhu, mu''ao ira, lamane: Ono Lowalangi ndra''ugö! Ba itenaŵa ira, lö itehe laŵa''ö, wa no la''ila, wa Keriso ia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 42, '

Ba mahemolu ö, si hulö wongi, ba mofanö ia, isaŵa naha si lö niha-niha, ba la''alui ia sato, la''ondrasi ia, ba lataha ia, fa böi iheta ia khöra.', '["Ayati 42-44: Mar 1:35-39"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 43, 'Ba imane khöra: Lö tola lö uturiagö ba mbanua bö''ö göi duria somuso dödö andrö, turia mbanua Lowalangi andrö; ba da''ö sa tefatenge ndra''o.', '["Ayati 42-44: Mar 1:35-39"]', NULL),
  (3393928, 'NT', 'Luka', 4, 44, '

Ba mangombakha ia ba zekola khöra misa, ba Galilaia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 1, 'Ba me laforege khönia niha sato, me lafondrondrongo khönia daroma li Lowalangi, ba ba mbewe mbaŵa Genezare andrö so ia.', '["Ayati 1-11: Mat 4:18-22; Mar 1:36-20"]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 2, '

Ba i''ila dundraha, dua rozi, ba zinga nene, no laröi sangai i''a, mamabago kiri.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 3, 'Ba möi ia yaŵa ba dundraha si sara, tundraha Wetero, i''andrö khönia, ena''ö isola ma''ifu, iheta baene. Ba mudadao ia ba dundraha, mamahaö niha sato.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 4, '

Ba me no ibato hoehuo, ba imane khö Zimoni: Misola ba zabakha ba milau giri, ba wama''u''u i''a.', '["Yoh 21:6"]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 5, '

Ba itema linia Simoni, imane: He samahaö, sara wongi manö no ma''eregeisi dödöma, ba lö sahulu ndra''aga; ba me no öŵa''ö, ba ulau giri.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 6, 'Ba lalau, ba ahulu ira i''a, oya sibai; ba aetu-aetu girira.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 7, 'Ba lakhawi tanga nawöra, si so ba dundraha si sara, ena''ö möi ira wolului khöra. Ba so ira, ba lafo''ösi dundraha, ma''adua, irege ahöndrö-höndrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 8, '

Ba me i''ila da''ö Simoni Fetero, ba ituhi danö föna Yesu, imane: He Tua, heta''ö khögu, me no niha si so horö ndra''o!', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 9, 'Noa sa ihawui ia fa''ata''u ba awönia fefu, ba wangai i''a andrö, sahulu ira;', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 10, 'si manö göi Yakobo ba Yohane, ono Zebedaio andrö, awö Zimoni.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 11, '

Ba la''ohe baene dundraha, laröi fefu hadia ia ba la''o''ö ia.', '["Faigi 18:28"]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 12, '

Ba me so ia ba mbanua si sambua, ba hiza niha, ira matua, si no falawu bou auri; ba me i''ila Yesu, ba ifalögu tou ia ba danö, mangandrö ia khönia, imane: He Tua, na edöna ndra''ugö, ba ö''ila öfadöhö wökhögu.', '["Ayati 12-16: Mat 8:2-4; Mar 1:40-45"]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 13, '

Ba i''oro''ö dangania Yesu, itufa, imane: Edöna ndra''o, yadöhö; ba i''anema''ö aheta khönia mbou auri andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 14, '

Ba iŵa''ö khönia, böi yamu''ombakha''ö, gofu ha ökhö, imane: Ae sa, oroma''ö ndra''ugö khö gere, ba be''e zumange andrö, ba wa''adöhö andrö, si mane ni''oroi''ö Moze ba wamaduhu''ö khöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 15, '

Ba tedou na wa''aterongo duriania, ba owulo niha, ato sibai, ba wamondrondrongo ba ba wamamadöhö''ö fökhöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 16, '

Ba iheta ia, isaŵa zi lö niha-niha ba mangandrö-ngandrö ia\1', '["Mar 1:35"]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 17, '

Ba ha samuza ma''ökhö, ba mamahaö ia, ba so warizaio ba sangila amakhoita, sangondrasi moroi ba mbanua fefu ba Galilaia ba ba Yudaia ba moroi ba Yeruzalema, ba so wa''abölö Zo''aya, ba wamadöhönia fökhö.', '["Ayati 17-26: Mat 9:2-8; Mar 2:1-12"]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 18, '

Ba hiza, so niha solohe ira matua, samösa, si mate dambai, ba gaso. Ba la''alui lala, wolohe yomo ba wanou''ö tou ya''ia fönania.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 19, 'Ba me lö lasöndra lala, wolohe yomo, ba wa''ato niha, ba möi ira yaŵa ba gero zagö, lafatörö ia ba zagö, wanada ya''ia, fabaya kaso, bakha ba hunö niha, föna Yesu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 20, '

Ba me i''ila wamatira, ba imane: He le, no mu''efa''ö khöu horöu.', '["Faigi 7:48"]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 21, '

Ba labörötaigö sangila amakhoita ba farizaio lafatou-tou tödöra, lamane: Ha niha da''ö, sangaoha-ngaoha andrö; ha niha zi tola mangefa''ö horö, baero Lowalangi, ha ya''ia?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 22, '

Ba me i''ila gera-erara Yesu ba imane khöra: Hana wa mifatou-tou tödömi?', '["Faigi 6:8"]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 23, 'He zaoha ira fanguma''ö: aefa khöu horöu, ba ma fanguma''ö: faoso ba owaö-waö?', '["Faigi 6:8"]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 24, 'Ba ena''ö mi''ila, tola i''efa''ö horö ba guli danö Ono Niha — ba imane ba zi mate dambai andrö: Da''ö ligu khöu: Faoso, ohe gasomö ba fuli''ö yomo khömi.', '["Faigi 6:8"]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 25, '

Ba i''anema''ö maoso, ba zanehe ira, i''ohe nahania andrö, mofanö ia miyomo khöra, isuno Lowalangi.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 26, '

Ba oi tobali dödöra, ba lasuno Lowalangi ba oi so wa''ata''ura, lamane: Si lö faböbö ba dödöda ni''ilada ma''ökhö andre.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 27, '

Ba aefa da''ö, ba mofanö ia, ba i''ila zanema beo, Lewi döinia, si dadao ba naha wanema beo, ba imane khönia:', '["Ayati 27-32: Mat 9:9-13; Mar 2:13-17"]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 28, 'O''ö ndra''o. Ba iröi fefu, hadia ia, maoso ia, i''o''ö.', '["Ayati 27-32: Mat 9:9-13; Mar 2:13-17"]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 29, '

Ba ifodiwo ia Lewi ba nomonia, ato nikaoni niha, ato sibai zi manga awöra, sanema beo, awö niha bö''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 30, '

Ba kumökö-kökö warizaio ba sangila amakhoita khöra, ba nifahaönia, lamane: Hana wa orudu manga ami ba zanema beo ba ba zi so horö andrö?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 31, '

Ba itema lira Yesu, imane khöra: Tenga ba zabölö moguna zame''e dalu-dalu, ha ba zofökhö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 32, 'Tenga ba wogaoni satulö tödö möi ndra''o, ha ba wogaoni si so horö, ba wamalalini era-era.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 33, '

Ba lamane khönia: Nifahaö Yohane andrö, ba asese mamoni ba gö ba mangandrö, ba si manö göi nifahaö warizaio andrö; ba khömö andrö, ba manga-manga ba mamadu-madu hadia ia.', '["Ayati 33-39: Mat 9:14-17; Mar 2:18-22"]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 34, '

Ba imane khöra Yesu: Hadia, mi''ila mifamoni nawö zangowalu, fatua awöra zangowalu andrö?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 35, 'Ba so sa mbaŵa dania — ba na aheta khöra zangowalu, awena dania mamoni ira, na baŵa da''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 36, '

Ba iŵa''ö khöra gamaedola göi, imane: Lö itika mbalo-balo niha ba nukha si bohou, ba itagu ba mbaru satua, ba na imanö, ba atika zi bohou ibe''e ba lö''ö sa atö faböbö ba zatua mbalo-balo nihalö ba zi bohou.', '["Agu si no ara: famo''eluaha andre ambö fagöna. Sindruhunia latötöi ia agu satua (li Yunani παλαιὸν). Simanö göi tenga agu si bohou, bahiza agu sawuyu. Itugu atua nidanö nagu itugu sökhi ia, andrö wa itugu ebua göi mbölinia. Lö ebua mböli nagu sawuyu, eluahania sawena mufera''ö ba mufa''anö ba mube ba mboto-boto. Agu satua, simane nifa''anö me 30 fakhe si lalö (1990) töra ebua mbölinia moroi ba agu sawuyu nifazökhi me döfi si lalö (2021)."]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 37, 'Ba lö solau agu si bohou ba nahia satua, ba na so zolau da''ö, ba ire''a nahia andrö agu si bohou andrö, ba ya''ia, ba aduwa, ba nahia, ba tekiko.', '["Agu si no ara: famo''eluaha andre ambö fagöna. Sindruhunia latötöi ia agu satua (li Yunani παλαιὸν). Simanö göi tenga agu si bohou, bahiza agu sawuyu. Itugu atua nidanö nagu itugu sökhi ia, andrö wa itugu ebua göi mbölinia. Lö ebua mböli nagu sawuyu, eluahania sawena mufera''ö ba mufa''anö ba mube ba mboto-boto. Agu satua, simane nifa''anö me 30 fakhe si lalö (1990) töra ebua mbölinia moroi ba agu sawuyu nifazökhi me döfi si lalö (2021)."]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 38, 'Ba nahia si bohou lalau nagu si bohou.', '["Agu si no ara: famo''eluaha andre ambö fagöna. Sindruhunia latötöi ia agu satua (li Yunani παλαιὸν). Simanö göi tenga agu si bohou, bahiza agu sawuyu. Itugu atua nidanö nagu itugu sökhi ia, andrö wa itugu ebua göi mbölinia. Lö ebua mböli nagu sawuyu, eluahania sawena mufera''ö ba mufa''anö ba mube ba mboto-boto. Agu satua, simane nifa''anö me 30 fakhe si lalö (1990) töra ebua mbölinia moroi ba agu sawuyu nifazökhi me döfi si lalö (2021)."]', NULL),
  (3393929, 'NT', 'Luka', 5, 39, 'Ba ha niha fefu, zi no mamadu-madu si no ara, ba lö omasi ia zi bohou, imane sa: Sökhi zi no ara andrö.', '["Agu si no ara: famo''eluaha andre ambö fagöna. Sindruhunia latötöi ia agu satua (li Yunani παλαιὸν). Simanö göi tenga agu si bohou, bahiza agu sawuyu. Itugu atua nidanö nagu itugu sökhi ia, andrö wa itugu ebua göi mbölinia. Lö ebua mböli nagu sawuyu, eluahania sawena mufera''ö ba mufa''anö ba mube ba mboto-boto. Agu satua, simane nifa''anö me 30 fakhe si lalö (1990) töra ebua mbölinia moroi ba agu sawuyu nifazökhi me döfi si lalö (2021)."]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 1, 'Ba itörö nowi Yesu, me luo sabato, ba lasösöbi lai wakhe nifahaönia, la''a, lafarekha ba dangara.', '["Ayati 1-5: Mat 12:1-8; Mar 2:23-28"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 2, '

Ba so warizaio ösa, ba lamane: Hana wa milau zi lö tola ba luo sabato?', '["Manofu dödöda hana wa tebai lateu lai wakhe ba lagulu ia ba danga? Ta''ila wa oya zalua ero ma''ökhö, göi ba luo Sabato, si lötolalö''ö mu''ohalöŵögöi. Duma-dumania möi wame''e ö zofökhö, manolo niha salabu ba zinga lala, mondra''u bawi soloi moroi ba mba''o, btn. Bahiza me luo da''ö tebai mufalua fefu da''a molo''ö ndra farizaio. Molo''ö ya''ira, molombase eluahania sindruhu molombase, irege faneu sara lai wakhe manö awö na tagulu-gulu ia ba dangada no tebai. Andrö wa itenaŵa ira Yesu. Lötolalö''ö mufo''eluaha Goroisa Lowalangi molo''ö ohitö dödö Lowalangi, tenga molo''ö ila-ila zura. Tatörö dödöda da''a na ta''ila so niha sabe''e sibai wamatörö \"goroisa\" irege lö ahakhö dödönia niha. Lowalangi andrö Lowalangi sahakhötödö ba somasi mangorifi niha."]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 3, '

Ba humede Yesu, imane khöra: Hadia, lö nibasomi göi, hadia nilau Dawido, me olofo ia ba awönia fao?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 4, 'Wa no möi ia ba nomo Lowalangi, wa ihalö roti nifaigi-faigi andrö, i''a, ba ibe''e göi ba nawönia fao, si lö tola i''a niha bö''ö, ha ere.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 5, 'Ba imane khöra: So''aya sabato göi Nono Niha andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 6, '

Ba me luo sabato bö''ö, ba möi ia ba zekola, mamahaö. Ba so niha ba da''ö, si no ariri tanga, kambölö.', '["Ayati 6-11: Mat 12:9-14; Mar 3:1-6","Faigi 14:3 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 7, 'Ba ladaro-darogö ia sangila amakhoita, awö warizaio, na ifadöhö wökhö, ba luo sabato, ena''ö lasöndra wangadugö ya''ia.', '["Ayati 6-11: Mat 12:9-14; Mar 3:1-6","Faigi 14:3 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 8, '

Ba i''ila gera-erara; ba imane ba niha andrö, si so tanga si no ariri andrö: Faoso, ae ba da''e; ba maoso ia, möi ia.', '["Faigi 5:22; Mat 9:4; 12:25)","Faigi göi yaŵa wamotokhi ba gahe Luk 6:1. Si lötolalö''ö mufo''eluaha Goroisa Lowalangi molo''ö ohitö dödö Lowalangi, tenga molo''ö ila-ila zura. Tatörö dödöda da''a na ta''ila so niha sabe''e sibai wamatörö goroisa irege lö ahakhö dödönia niha. Lowalangi andrö Lowalangi sahakhötödö ba somasi mangorifi niha."]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 9, 'Ba imane khöra Yesu: Usofu khömi, hadia, tola lalau zi sökhi, na luo sabato, ba ma si lö sökhi lalau, hadia, la''orifi niha, ma lafakiko?', '["Faigi 5:22; Mat 9:4; 12:25)","Faigi göi yaŵa wamotokhi ba gahe Luk 6:1. Si lötolalö''ö mufo''eluaha Goroisa Lowalangi molo''ö ohitö dödö Lowalangi, tenga molo''ö ila-ila zura. Tatörö dödöda da''a na ta''ila so niha sabe''e sibai wamatörö goroisa irege lö ahakhö dödönia niha. Lowalangi andrö Lowalangi sahakhötödö ba somasi mangorifi niha."]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 10, 'Ba ifakhölö ia, inehegö ira fefu, ba imane khönia: Oro''ö dangau. Ba i''o''ö, ba te''azökhi dangania.', '["Faigi 5:22; Mat 9:4; 12:25)","Faigi göi yaŵa wamotokhi ba gahe Luk 6:1. Si lötolalö''ö mufo''eluaha Goroisa Lowalangi molo''ö ohitö dödö Lowalangi, tenga molo''ö ila-ila zura. Tatörö dödöda da''a na ta''ila so niha sabe''e sibai wamatörö goroisa irege lö ahakhö dödönia niha. Lowalangi andrö Lowalangi sahakhötödö ba somasi mangorifi niha."]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 11, '

Ba oi so wa''afökhö dödöra, ba fahuhuo ira, he lawisa khö Yesu andrö.', '["Yoh 11:47"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 12, '

Ba me luo da''ö, ba möi ia baero, ba hili, mangandrö, ba sara wongi lö ibato wangandrö khö Lowalangi.', '["Ayati 12-16: Mat 10:1-4; Mar 3:13-19","Mat 14:23"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 13, 'Ba me moluo, ba humede ia ba nifahaönia, ba itutuyu zi felendrua, ba khöra, nifotöinia sinenge göi.', '["Ayati 12-16: Mat 10:1-4; Mar 3:13-19","Mat 14:23"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 14, 'Simoni andrö, nibe''enia töi Fetero göi ba Andrea, talifusönia, ba Yakobo ba Yohane ba Filifo ba Batolomaio,', '["Ayati 12-16: Mat 10:1-4; Mar 3:13-19","Mat 14:23"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 15, 'ba Mataio ba Toma ba Yakobo, ono Galifaio, ba Simoni, nifotöi Selote,', '["Ayati 12-16: Mat 10:1-4; Mar 3:13-19","Mat 14:23"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 16, 'ba Yuda, ono Yakobo, ba Yuda, banua Kariota, si manga mböli dania.', '["Ayati 12-16: Mat 10:1-4; Mar 3:13-19","Mat 14:23"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 17, '

Ba möi ia mitou, fao ira khönia, i''iagö zalo''o, ba ato nawönia, nifahaönia, awö niha sato, ato sibai, si oroi Yudaia ma''asagörö ba si oroi Yeruzalema ba mbewe nasi andrö, Tiro ba Sidona, si no möi ba wamondrondrongo linia ba ba wamadöhö''ö fökhöra;', '["Mat 4:23 b.t.","Faigi 8:44 b.t.; Mar 3:10"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 18, 'te''orifi göi nifakao mbekhu si ra''iö.', '["Mat 4:23 b.t.","Faigi 8:44 b.t.; Mar 3:10"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 19, 'Ba dozi niha zangalui fombambaya ya''ia, me no so wa''abölö, si otarai khönia, famadöhö wökhöra fefu.', '["Mat 4:23 b.t.","Faigi 8:44 b.t.; Mar 3:10"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 20, '

Ba ifakhölö ia, ifaigi nifahaönia ba imane: Ya''ahowu ami, si numana, me khömi mbanua Lowalangi andrö.', '["Ayati 20-26: Mat 5:2-12","Yes 55:1; 61:3","FetI 2:19; 3:14","HalZin 5:41"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 21, 'Ya''ahowu ami, solofo iada''e, me ni''abusoi''ö ami dania. Ya''ahowu ami, sege-ege iada''e me sa''iki ami dania.', '["Ayati 20-26: Mat 5:2-12","Yes 55:1; 61:3","FetI 2:19; 3:14","HalZin 5:41"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 22, 'Ya''ahowu ami, na fatiu dödö niha khömi, na latibo''ö ami, na latandraŵaisi ami, na la''ositengagö döimi, hulö na si lö sökhi, na börö Nono Niha.', '["Ayati 20-26: Mat 5:2-12","Yes 55:1; 61:3","FetI 2:19; 3:14","HalZin 5:41"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 23, 'Mi''omusoi''ö dödömi, na luo si manö, mi''amaröga; hiza sa, ebua luomi ba zorugo. Si manö sibai wolau ndra tuara, ba zama''ele''ö andrö.', '["Ayati 20-26: Mat 5:2-12","Yes 55:1; 61:3","FetI 2:19; 3:14","HalZin 5:41"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 24, '

Ba alai sa ami, so''ana''a! noa sa''ae mitema wondrara dödömi andrö.', '["Yak 5:1 b.t.; Mar 10:24","Yes 65:13","Yak 4:4; Mikh 2:11"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 25, 'Alai ami, sabuso iada''e, olofo sa''ae ami dania. Alai ami, sa''iki iada''e! abu sa''ae dania dödömi ba mege-ege ami.', '["Yak 5:1 b.t.; Mar 10:24","Yes 65:13","Yak 4:4; Mikh 2:11"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 26, 'Alai ami, na lasuno ami niha fefu! si manö sibai sa göi wolau ndra tuara ba zama''ele''ö sofaya andrö.', '["Yak 5:1 b.t.; Mar 10:24","Yes 65:13","Yak 4:4; Mikh 2:11"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 27, '

Ba ya''ami, samondrongo, ba da''ö ligu khömi: Mi''omasi''ö zi fa''udu khömi, mitolo zi fatiu tödö khömi,', '["Mat 5:44","Mat 5:39.40","Mat 5:42"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 28, 'mifahowu''ö zangelifi ya''ami; mi''angandrö salahi zangosiwawöi ya''ami.', '["Mat 5:44","Mat 5:39.40","Mat 5:42"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 29, 'Na so zamalisi bo''ömö, ba oro''ö khönia zi tambai göi, ba na so zangai lembeu, ba lulu khönia mbaru göi.', '["Mat 5:44","Mat 5:39.40","Mat 5:42"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 30, 'Fefu ha niha zangandrö khöu, ba be''e khönia, ba na so zangai si so khöu, ba böi andrö mangawuli.', '["Mat 5:44","Mat 5:39.40","Mat 5:42"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 31, '

Ba hadia zomasi ami lalau khömi niha, da''ö milau khöra, si manö göi.', '["Mat 7:12","Mat 5:46 b.t.","MozIII 25:35 b.t.; MozV 15:10; Mat 5:45"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 32, 'Ba na mi''omasi''ö zangomasi''ö ya''ami, ba hadia wa''ebua dödö khömi! he niha si lö atulö, ba la''omasi''ö göi zangomasi''ö ya''ira.', '["Mat 7:12","Mat 5:46 b.t.","MozIII 25:35 b.t.; MozV 15:10; Mat 5:45"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 33, 'Ba na mitolo sa zanolo ya''ami, ba hadia wa''ebua dödö khömi? Si manö sa göi zi so horö andrö.', '["Mat 7:12","Mat 5:46 b.t.","MozIII 25:35 b.t.; MozV 15:10; Mat 5:45"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 34, 'Ba na mibe''e nifalali ba nidöna-dönami mitema mangawuli, ba hadia wa''ebua dödö khömi? Labe''e göi nifalali si lö atulö ba zi lö atulö, ena''ö latema mangawuli zi manö zui.', '["Mat 7:12","Mat 5:46 b.t.","MozIII 25:35 b.t.; MozV 15:10; Mat 5:45"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 35, 'Ba mi''omasi''ö zi fa''udu khömi, ba mitolo ba mibe''e nifalali ba zi lö midöna-döna hadia ia mangawuli, ba ebua luomi, ba ono Wondrege Zalaŵa ami, me ebua dödönia ba zi lö mangandrö saoha gölö göi ba ba zi lö sökhi.', '["Mat 7:12","Mat 5:46 b.t.","MozIII 25:35 b.t.; MozV 15:10; Mat 5:45"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 36, '

Ya sahakhö tödö ami, si mane fa''ahakhö dödö Namami andrö', '["Mat 5:7,48","Mat 7:1"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 37, 'Ba böi mihuku niha, ba lö''ö manö tehuku ami göi. Ba böi mi''etu''ö huku, ba lö''ö manö la''etu''ö hukumi. Mi''efa''ö zala, ba te''efa''ö zalami.', '["Mat 5:7,48","Mat 7:1"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 38, '

Mibe''e, ba tebe''e khömi; su''a-su''a nifozuzu, nisösö, nihöndrögö, si falawu, lafaduwa ba gahetami; su''a-su''a sa ni''anu''a''ömi, la''anu''a''ö zui khömi dania.', '["Amaed 19:17; KorII 9:6 b.t.; Mar 4:24"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 39, '

Ba iŵa''ö khöra gamaedola, imane: Hadia, tola göi i''ohe danga zau''a niha sau''a, ba lala? Tenga faoma aekhu ira ba dögi?', '["Mat 15:14","Mat 10:24","Mat 7:3 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 40, 'Tenga sebua moroi khö zamahaö nifahaö; ba dozi dania, na nifamaha, si mane samahaö ya''ira.', '["Mat 15:14","Mat 10:24","Mat 7:3 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 41, 'Ba hana wa ö''ila golowingö ba hörö dalifusöu, ba boto geu ba hörömö, ha lö ö''ila?', '["Mat 15:14","Mat 10:24","Mat 7:3 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 42, 'Hadia wa tola öŵa''ö khö dalifusöu: He ga''a da''uheta golowingö andrö ba höröu, ba ya''ugö, ba lö ö''ila mboto geu andrö ba hörömö? He samini tödö! Ofönai''ö wangeheta boto geu andrö ba hörömö, ba awena öfaigi wangeheta olowingö ba hörö dalifusöu.', '["Mat 15:14","Mat 10:24","Mat 7:3 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 43, '

Lö''ö sa eu si sökhi, sowua bou sobou, ba lö''ö göi eu sobou, sowua bua si sökhi.', '["Mat 7:17 b.t.; 12:33","Mat 12:34,35"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 44, 'Fefu ngawalö döla geu, ba ba mbunia ta''ila he wisa. Lö lateteu marafala ba manaze, ba lö lateteu mbua nagu ba za''a-sa''a mao.', '["Mat 7:17 b.t.; 12:33","Mat 12:34,35"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 45, 'Niha si sökhi ifaluagö zi sökhi, moroi ba girö-girö dödönia andrö, si sökhi, ba si lö sökhi, ba ifaluagö zi lö sökhi, moroi ba zi lö sökhi andrö khönia. Hadia sa zi no fahöna ba dödö, da''ö wehede mbewe.', '["Mat 7:17 b.t.; 12:33","Mat 12:34,35"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 46, '

Ba hana wa faso''aya ami khögu, wanguma''ö: He So''aya! he So''aya! ba lö mi''o''ö niŵa''ögu?', '["Mal 1:6; Mat 7:21"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 47, '

Dozi si möi khögu, samondrongo ligu, solo''ö ya''ia - ba da''u''ombakha''ö khömi, ha khö fakhili-khili ia.', '["Ayati 47-49: Mat 7:24-27"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 48, 'Ba niha solau omo fakhili-khili ia, sogo''o tanö, abakha, sanandrösaigö ba gara toyo gehomo. Ba me ebua nidanö ba itörö nomo andrö hohou, ba tebai ifadögö, me no sökhi wanaru''ö ya''ia.', '["Ayati 47-49: Mat 7:24-27"]', NULL),
  (3393930, 'NT', 'Luka', 6, 49, 'Ba na so zamondrongo ba na lö i''o''ö, ba no fakhili-khili ba niha sanaru''ö omo ba danö si lö dane-dane tou: me itörö hohou nidanö, ba i''anema''ö aso''a, ba abölö-bölö wa''aso''a nomo da''ö.', '["Ayati 47-49: Mat 7:24-27"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 1, 'Ba me no i''o''ozui fefu huhuonia, nifondrondrongo niha, ba möi ia miyomo ba Gafanauma.', '["Ayati 1-10: Mat 8:5-13"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 2, 'Ba so zofökhö, onali mate, sawuyu gumandra, somasi ia.', '["Ayati 1-10: Mat 8:5-13"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 3, 'Ba me irongo Yesu sokhö, ba ifatenge khönia zatua niha Yehuda, ifa''andrö''ö khönia, ena''ö möi ia mu''orifi zawuyunia.', '["Ayati 1-10: Mat 8:5-13"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 4, 'Ba me falukha ira Yesu, ba laforege wangandrö khönia, lamane: Tola sa ö''o''ö khönia da''ö;', '["Ayati 1-10: Mat 8:5-13"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 5, 'me no sangomasi''ö ya''ita, ba no ya''ia zolau khöda omo zekola andrö.', '["Ayati 1-10: Mat 8:5-13"]', NULL);


Ba möi Yesu, fao ia khöra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 7, '

Andrö göi uŵa''ö tödögu, tenga si nangea möi ndra''o khöu; ba hede manö ha sambua li, ba döhö wökhö zawuyugu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 8, 'Ya''odo göi, ba no niha, si so barö mbawa zalaŵa ndra''odo, ba so barö mbawagu zaradadu, ba na umane ba zi samösa: Ae''e, ba mofanö ia, ba ba zi samösa: Aine, ba i''ondrasido; ba na uŵa''ö khö zawuyugu: Halöŵöu da''ö, ba ihalö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 9, '

Ba me irongo da''ö Yesu, ba ahöli-höli dödönia khönia, ba ibali''ö ia ba niha sato, solo''ö ya''ia, imane: Uŵa''ö khömi, ba Ndraono Gizeraeli na i, ba lö nisöndragu famati si manö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 10, '

Ba me mangawuli ba nomo zinenge no mege, ba no döhö wökhö zawuyu andrö, fönara.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 11, '

Ba mahemolu ö, ba möi ia ba mbanua, sotöi Na''i, ba ato zi fao khönia nifahaönia, awö niha sato.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 12, 'Ba me no ahatö ia ba mbawa göli, ba hiza, la''ohe baero zi mate, awai nono ninania, ba lakha mbanua nina, ba ato zi fao khönia banuara.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 13, '

Ba me i''ila ia So''aya, ba ahakhö dödönia ia, imane khönia: Böi e''e!', '["Faigi 8:52 b.t.","SalI 17:23","Faigi 1:68; Yoh 6:14","Mat 9:26"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 14, 'Ba i''ondrasi, ibabaya hasi, ba labadugö ira sangosa''ö, ba imane: He ono matua! da''ö ligu khöu: Faoso!', '["Faigi 8:52 b.t.","SalI 17:23","Faigi 1:68; Yoh 6:14","Mat 9:26"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 15, 'Ba mudadao zi mate, ibörögö muhede; ba ibe''e khö ninania Yesu.', '["Faigi 8:52 b.t.","SalI 17:23","Faigi 1:68; Yoh 6:14","Mat 9:26"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 16, 'Ba ihawui ira fefu fa''ata''u, lasuno Lowalangi, lamane: No maoso zama''ele''ö sebua ba khöda, ba no möi mufaigi mbanuania Lowalangi.', '["Faigi 8:52 b.t.","SalI 17:23","Faigi 1:68; Yoh 6:14","Mat 9:26"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 17, 'Ba humöngö duriania andrö ba danö Yudaia ma''asagörö ba ba danö si fasui fefu.', '["Faigi 8:52 b.t.","SalI 17:23","Faigi 1:68; Yoh 6:14","Mat 9:26"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 18, '

Ba la''ombakha''ö khö Yohane, da''ö fefu nifahaönia. Ba humede Yohane ba nifahaönia,', '["Ayati 18-23: Mat 11:2-6"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 19, 'darua, ifatenge ira khö Zo''aya, imane: Hadia, ya''ugö zi möi andrö, ma mabase''ö danö bö''ö?', '["Ayati 18-23: Mat 11:2-6"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 20, '

Ba me falukha ira khönia, ba lamane: Yohane andrö, samayagö idanö, ifatenge ndra''aga khöu, imane: Hadia, ya''ugö zi möi andrö, ma mabase''ö danö bö''ö?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 21, '

Ba faudu da''ö sibai, ba ato itolo sofökhö ba si so famakao ba sobekhu si lö sökhi; ba ba zau''a i''amualagö wangila niha, ato ira.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 22, '

Ba itema lira imane khöra: Mifuli ami, mi''ombakha''ö khö Yohane hadia ni''ila hörömi ba hadia nirongomi. Ifuli la''ila niha saua, mowaö-waö zi no ombuyu-mbuyu, döhö wökhö zobou auri, larongo li niha safiso, tesusugi zi no mate ba te''ombakha''ö duria somuso dödö ba zi numana;', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 23, 'ba ya''ahowu ba zi lö fatuwu ndra''o.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 24, '

Ba me no mofanö zinenge Yohane andrö, ba ibörögö fahuhuo ba niha sato, ba khö Yohane andrö, imane:', '["Ayati 24-35: Mat 11,7-19"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 25, '

Ma hadia nifaigimi, wa möi baero ami mege? Hadia, niha si so nukha sombuyu-mbuyu? Hiza, ba nomo zalaŵa so niha si so nukha sogini-gini, ba sangehao göra.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 26, 'Ma hadia nifaigimi, wa möi baero mege ami? Hadia, sama''ele''ö? Si ndruhu niŵa''ögu khömi, si no ebua göi moroi ba zama''ele''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 27, '

Ya''ia zi so ba zura andrö: "Hiza ufowaö-waö mala''ika andrö khögu, fönau, sangehao lalamö fönau."', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 28, 'Uŵa''ö khömi, samösa lö sama''ele''ö, sebua moroi khö Yohane andrö, samayagö idanö, ba ni''adonogö ndra alawe, fefu. Ba fondrege zide-ide ba mbanua Lowalangi andrö, ba no ebua moroi khönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 29, '

Ba niha fefu, samondrongo, ba sanema beo andrö, ba satulö Lowalangi laŵa''ö, ba lafabayagö''ö idanö ira, famayagö idanö andrö, khö Yohane.', '["Mat 21:32"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 30, 'Ba farizaio andrö, ba sangila amakhoita, ba labali''ö si lö boto dödö Lowalangi andrö khöra, me lö edöna ira wamayagö idanö andrö khönia.', '["Mat 21:32"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 31, '

Ba ha ube''e famaedo niha si sagötö andre, ba ha khö fakhili-khili ira?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 32, 'Ba ndraono fakhili-khili ira, si dadao ba kade, si faoma mu''ao khö nawöra, wanguma''ö: No malau zigu khömi, ba lö solaya ami; no fa''ala-alai ndra''aga khömi, ba lö se''e ami.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 33, '

Noa sa möi Yohane andrö, samayagö idanö, lö i''a roti, ba lö ibadu nagu, ba mimane: Sobekhu.', '["Mar 1:6"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 34, 'Ba no möi Nono Niha, manga-manga ia, ba mamadu-madu hadia ia, ba mimane: Hiza niha solu''a-lu''a, sabuso-buso agu ba si fahuwu ba zanema beo ba ba zebua horö!', '["Mar 1:6"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 35, 'Ba tobali samu''a ba hulu wa''atua-tua andrö nononia fefu.', '["Mar 1:6"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 36, '

Ba ikaoni ia manga farizaio. Ba möi ia ba nomo warizaio andrö, mudadao ia manga.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 37, '

Ba hiza ndra alawe, banua da''ö, sebua horö, me no irongo, no möi ia manga ba nomo warizaio andrö, ba i''ohe zamba buli-buli kara fanikha samohua,', '["Mat 26:7 b.t.","Yoh 12:3"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 38, 'i''ondrasi moroi furi gahenia ba me''e, ibörögö ibasöi gahe idanö hörönia ba i''osi bunia, i''ago gahe ba ibayoini fanikha no mege.', '["Mat 26:7 b.t.","Yoh 12:3"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 39, '

Ba me i''ila da''ö farizaio andrö, sogaoni ya''ia, ba imane dödönia: Na sama''ele''ö da''ö, ba i''ila ena''ö ha niha, ba he wisa mbua-bua ndra alawe andrö, sombambaya ya''ia, wa no sebua horö.', '["Faigi 15:2"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 40, '

Ba humede khönia Yesu, imane khönia: So niŵa''ögu khöu, Simoni. Ba imane: Ŵa''ö, samahaö. [Ba imane]:', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 41, 'So zosugilö, darua zo''ömö khönia; ömö zi samösa, ba dua ngaotu a lima wulu rufia, ba ömö zi samösa, ba dua wulu a lima.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 42, 'Ba me lö khöra famu''a, ba faoma ibe''e bualania khöra zugilönia andrö. Ba ha niha ba zi darua andrö zabölö mangomasi''ö ya''ia?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 43, '

Itema linia Simoni, imane: Ba dödögu, sebua ibe''e buala.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 44, '

Ba ibali''ö ia ba ndra alawe andrö, imane khö Zimoni: Hadia, ö''ila ndra alawe andrö? No möido ba nomou; idanö khögu, ba gahe, ba lö nibe''eu. Ba da''e, ba no ibasöi taŵa hörönia gahegu, ba bunia wolosi khönia.', '["Sin 23:5"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 45, 'Lö si fa''ago bawa ndra''ugö khögu. Ba da''e, ba i''otarai möi ia yomo, ba lö nibatonia fangago ahegu.', '["Sin 23:5"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 46, 'Lö nibayoiniu fanikha högögu. Ba da''e, ba no ibayoini gahegu fanikha samohua.', '["Sin 23:5"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 47, 'Andrö uŵa''ö khöu: No mu''efa''ö khönia horö soya andrö, me no abölö wa''omasinia. Ba ba ni''efa''ö si lö oya-oya, ba lö abölö wa''omasinia.', '["Sin 23:5"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 48, '

Ba imane ba ndra alawe andrö: No mube''e aefa khöu horöu.', '["Faigi 5:20.21"]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 49, '

Ba labörötaigö awönia ba wemanga, lamane dödöra: Ha niha da''ö, sangefa''ö horö göi?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393931, 'NT', 'Luka', 7, 50, '

Ba imane ba ndra alawe andrö: Famatimö zangorifi ya''ugö; fuli''ö, ya''ohahau dödöu.', '["Faigi 8:48; Mar 5:34"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 1, 'Ba me aefa da''ö, ba itörö mbanua sebua, awö zide-ide, mangombakha ia, manuriagö turia mbanua Lowalangi andrö; ba awönia zi felendrua,', '["Faigi 4:43; 13:22","Mar 15:40,41; 16:9"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 2, 'ba ira alawe ösa, nifofanö bekhu si lö sökhi ba nifadöhö fökhö, Maria andrö, banua Magadala, ba zaheta bekhu andrö, si fitu,', '["Faigi 4:43; 13:22","Mar 15:40,41; 16:9"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 3, 'ba Yohana, fo''omo Khusa andrö, durutuli Herode ba Susana ba tanö bö''ö na, ato, sanolo ya''ira balazo.', '["Faigi 4:43; 13:22","Mar 15:40,41; 16:9"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 4, '

Ba me ato zowulo niha, ba me la''o''ö ia moroi ba mbanua misa, ba ilau khöra gamaedola, imane:', '["Ayati 8:4-15: Mat 13:1-23; Mar 4:1-20"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 5, '

No möi zamazaewe tanömö, ba wamazaewe tanömö zinanö könia. Ba ba wamazaewenia, ba so zi göna ba lala, ba lahundra-hundra niha ba la''a fofo ba dalu mbanua.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 6, 'Ba so zi göna ba dete gara, ba me motalinga, ba aleu, me no oköli-köli danö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 7, 'Ba so zi göna barö ndroi, ba molewiö göi ndroi, ba mate zinanö ibe''e.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 8, 'Ba so zi göna ba danö si sökhi, ba motalinga ba i''owua zi dua wulu zamba yöu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 9, '

Ba lasofu khönia nifahaönia, hadia geluaha gamaedola andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 10, '

Ba imane: Khömi no mube''e wa''aboto ba dödömi zi tobini andrö, lala mbanua Lowalangi andrö. Ba da danö bö''ö, ba ba gamaedola, ena''ö lö la''ila, he no anehe ira, ba ena''ö lö aboto ba dödöra, he no larongo.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 11, '

Ba da''ö geluaha gamaedola no mege: Tanömö zinanö andrö, ba taroma li Lowalangi andrö.', '["FetI 1:23"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 12, 'Ba si so ba lala, ba ya''ia na so zamondrongo, ba aefa da''ö, ba so Gafökha, ba iheta daroma li andrö ba dödöra, ena''ö lö mamati ira, ena''ö lö auri.', '["FetI 1:23"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 13, 'Ba si so ba dete gara, ba na larongo, ba labe''e ba dödöra, omuso dödöra, ba ya''ira, ba si lö ŵa''a, götö iada''e mamati ira, ba na baŵa wanandraigö, ba lafuli furi.', '["FetI 1:23"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 14, 'Ba si göna barö ndroi, ba ya''ia zi no mamondrongo, ba mofanö, ba mate, ba wa''abu dödö ba ba gana''a andrö, ba ba zomasi dödöra ba guli danö andre, ba lö fakhamö atua mbua.', '["FetI 1:23"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 15, '

Ba si so ba danö si sökhi, ba ya''ia zananö ba dödö taroma li andrö, nirongora, ba dödö si sökhi, satulö, ba mowua, anau gölöra.', '["Faigi 11:28; HalZin 16:14","Faigi 11:33; Mat 5:15","Faigi 12:2","Faigi 19:26; Mat 13:12"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 16, 'Lö samalugö fandru bowoa, na no itunu, ba lö same''e barö warate, ba naha wandru ibe''e, ena''ö la''ila hagania si möi yomo andrö.', '["Faigi 11:28; HalZin 16:14","Faigi 11:33; Mat 5:15","Faigi 12:2","Faigi 19:26; Mat 13:12"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 17, 'Lö''ö sa hadia ia zi tobini, si lö oroma dania, ba lö hadia ia nibalugö, si lö te''ila dania ba si lö to''ele dania.', '["Faigi 11:28; HalZin 16:14","Faigi 11:33; Mat 5:15","Faigi 12:2","Faigi 19:26; Mat 13:12"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 18, 'Ba mifaigi, he wisa wamondrongomi. Ha niha sa zi so, ba da''ö tebe''e, ba ha niha zi lö''ö, ba ba da''ö laheta göi zi no so khönia, niŵa''önia.', '["Faigi 11:28; HalZin 16:14","Faigi 11:33; Mat 5:15","Faigi 12:2","Faigi 19:26; Mat 13:12"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 19, '

Ba möi khönia ninania ba talifusönia, ba tebai falukha ira khönia, ba wa''ato niha.', '["Ayati 19-21: Mat 12:46-50; Mar 3:21,31-35"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 20, 'Ba te''ombakha''ö khönia: So tou ninau ba talifusöu, si möi mamaigi ya''ugö.', '["Ayati 19-21: Mat 12:46-50; Mar 3:21,31-35"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 21, 'Ba itema li, imane khöra: Inagu ba talifusögu da''ö, samondrongo taroma li Lowalangi, ba solo''ö.', '["Ayati 19-21: Mat 12:46-50; Mar 3:21,31-35"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 22, '

Ba ha samuza ma''ökhö, ba möi ia baowo, awö nifahaönia, ba imane khöra: Tasaŵa si yefo.', '["Ayati 8:22-25; Mat 8:18,23-27; Mar 4:35-41"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 23, '

Ba me moloyo, ba mörö ia; ba ilabu bade ba mbaŵa, afönu nowo idanö, ba tosasa ira.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 24, '

Ba möi ira khönia, lasusugi ia, lamane: He samahaö! he samahaö! tekiko ita! Ba maoso ia, itenaŵa nangi, awö ndrulu, ba tebato ba ahono.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 25, '

Ba imane khöra: Heza so wamatimi? Ba ata''u ira ba ahöli-höli dödöra, faoma lamane khö nawöra: Ta''ila ha niha da''ö, wa ibe''e goroisa ba nangi göi ba ba ndrulu, ba la''o''ö khönia?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 26, '

Ba lasaŵa danö Gadara, si fatahö Galilaia.', '["Ayati 8:26-39; Mat 8:29-34; Mar 5:1-20"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 27, 'Ba me no möi ia ba danö, ba ifaondragö ia niha, moroi yomo ba mbanua, si so bekhu, no ara sa''ae lö sonukha ia, ba tenga yomo so ia, no ba lewatö misa.', '["Ayati 8:26-39; Mat 8:29-34; Mar 5:1-20"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 28, '

Ba me i''ila Yesu, ba mu''ao ia, itibo''ö tou ia fönania, i''ebua''ö linia, imane: Hadia niŵa''öu khögu, Yesu, Ono Lowalangi Fondrege Zalaŵa? U''andrö khöu, böi fakao ndra''o.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 29, '

Me iŵa''ö ba mbekhu si ra''iö andrö, iheta ia ba niha andrö; noa sa asese idöni-döni, ba laböbö-böbö ia rate ba fesu gahe fangelama, ba i''etu-etu''ö wesu andrö, ba i''ohe ia bekhu andrö ba danö si mate.', '["Faigi 9:39,42"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 30, '

Ba isofu khönia Yesu, imane: Ha niha döiu? Ba imane: Liwu, me ato mbekhu, sanaŵa ya''ia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 31, '

Ba la''andrö khönia, ena''ö lö iŵa''ö khöra we''amöi ba gawuwukha.', '["Fam 20:3"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 32, 'Ba so ba da''ö mbawi sambawa sebua, nikubaloi ba hili, ba la''andrö khönia, ena''ö itehe khöra lasaŵa da''ö; ba itehe khöra.', '["Fam 20:3"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 33, '

Ba laheta ira ba niha andrö bekhu andrö, lasaŵa mbawi. Ba latibo''ö ira ba nasi bawi andrö, si sambawa, moroi ba zanaere, ba alömö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 34, '

Ba me la''ila da''ö kubalo, ba moloi ira, la''ombakha''ö ba mbanua ba ba zi fahalama misa.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 35, '

Ba möi ira baero, ba wamaigi hadia, ba la''ondrasi Yesu, ba la''ila niha no mege, ba zaheta bekhu andrö, no dumadao ia föna Yesu, no monukha, no döhö wa''owöhö, ba ata''u ira.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 36, 'Ba si no anehe mege, ba la''ombakha''ö khöra he wisa wangorifi sobekhu andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 37, 'Ba la''andrö khönia, dozi niha andrö, si fasui Gadara, ena''ö iheta ia khöra, me no ihawui ira fa''ata''u sabölö-bölö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 38, '

Ba i''andrö khönia niha andrö, ba zaheta bekhu no mege, ena''ö tola möi ia awönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 39, '

Ba ifofanö, imane: Fuli''ö khömi, ba dunö-dunö hadia nilau Lowalangi khöu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 40, '

Ba me mangawuli Yesu, ba lafaondragö ia niha sato; dozi sa''ae labalo-baloi ia.', '["Ayati 40-56; Mat 9:18-26; Mar 5:21-43"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 41, '

Ba hiza niha, Ya''iro döi, satua zekola, ituhi danö föna Yesu, i''andrö khönia, ena''ö möi ia ba nomonia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 42, 'So khönia nono alawe, ha sambua, so mewelendrua fakhe wa''ebua, ba si onali mate da''ö. Ba me möi ia, ba lafadege ira khönia niha sato.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 43, '

Ba so ndra alawe sendro talu, no mewelendrua fakhe wa''ara, no ahori gana''ania ba zame''e dalu-dalu, ba lö sangila mamadöhö fökhönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 44, 'I''ondrasi Yesu moroi furi, ibabaya gahe mbarunia, ba i''anema''ö tebato ndro andrö khönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 45, '

Ba imane Yesu: Ha niha zombambaya ya''o?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 46, '

Ba imane Yesu: So zi no mombambaya ya''o niha, no sa u''ila, so zaheta khögu fangabölö.', '["Faigi 6:19"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 47, '

Ba me i''ila ira alawe andrö, tebai tobini, ba möi ia, manizi-nizi ia, ituhi danö fönania, i''ombakha''ö, ba zi so niha fefu, hadia mbörö, wa no ibabaya, awö wa no i''anema''ö döhö wökhönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 48, '

Ba imane khönia: Famatimö zangorifi ya''ugö, onogu alawe; fuli''ö, ya''ohahau dödöu.', '["Faigi 7:50"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 49, '

Ba me humede ia na, ba so genoni zatua zekola no mege, imane: No mate nonou, böi sa''ae fakao zamahaö andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 50, '

Ba me irongo Yesu, ba imane khönia: Böi ata''ufi, amati manö, ba auri ia dania.', '["Mat 17:1"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 51, 'Ba me no irugi nomo andrö, ba lö ifa''amöi yomo niha, awönia, ha Fetero ba Yohane ba Yakobo ba ama nono andrö no mege ba inania.', '["Mat 17:1"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 52, '

Ba oi mege-ege ira, la''e''esi.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 53, '

Ba la''igi-igi''ö ia, me no la''ila wa si no mate.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 54, '

Ba ira''u danga, imane: He onogu, faoso!', '["Yoh 11:44"]', NULL),
  (3393933, 'NT', 'Luka', 8, 55, 'Ba mangawuli nosonia, ba i''anema''ö maoso: ba iŵa''ö khöra Yesu, labe''e gönia.', '["Yoh 11:44"]', NULL);


Ba tobali dödö ndra amania; ba iŵa''ö khöra, böi la''ombakha''ö da''ö, gofu ha ökhö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 1, 'Ba humede ia ba zi felendrua andrö, ibe''e khöra wa''abölö, ba itehe khöra wamofanö bekhu fefu, awö wamadöhö fökhö.', '["Ayati 1-5: Mat 10:1; 7:9-14; Mar 6:7-13","Faigi 10:5 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 2, 'Ba ifatenge ira, ba wanuriagö banua Lowalangi andrö ba ba wamadöhö fökhö,', '["Ayati 1-5: Mat 10:1; 7:9-14; Mar 6:7-13","Faigi 10:5 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 3, 'ba imane khöra: Böi mi''ohe hadia ia ba lala; he si''o ba he bola ba he roti ba he kefe, ba böi dua görö mbarumi.', '["Ayati 1-5: Mat 10:1; 7:9-14; Mar 6:7-13","Faigi 10:5 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 4, 'Ba ba zi möi ami yomo, ba da''ö mi''iagö ba ba da''ö mi''otarai wofanö.', '["Ayati 1-5: Mat 10:1; 7:9-14; Mar 6:7-13","Faigi 10:5 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 5, 'Ba ba zi lö lafa''amöi yomo ami, ba da''ö miheta ami, ba mbanua andrö, ba mi''anotogö gawu-gawu ba gahemi, ba wamaduhu''ö khöra.', '["Ayati 1-5: Mat 10:1; 7:9-14; Mar 6:7-13","Faigi 10:5 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 6, '

Ba mofanö ira, latöröi mbanua misa, wanuriagö turia somuso dödö, awö wamadöhö fökhö, fefu gofu heza möi ira.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 7, '

Ba irongo fefu hadia ia Herode andrö, salaŵa ba zi sagörö ni''o''öfa tanö, ba i''abusi tödö, me no so ösa zanguma''ö: No maoso Yohane moroi ba ngai zi mate;', '["Ayati 7-9; Mat 14:1,2; Mar 6:14-16","Ayati 18:19","Faigi 23:8"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 8, 'ba so ösa, ba laŵa''ö: No to''ele Geliya; ba so danö bö''ö, ba lamane: No maoso zama''ele''ö föna, samösa.', '["Ayati 7-9; Mat 14:1,2; Mar 6:14-16","Ayati 18:19","Faigi 23:8"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 9, 'Ba imane Herode: Yohane andrö, ba no ufa''eŵa''ö mbagi, ba ha niha da''ö? Ba i''alui lala, ena''ö falukha ia khönia.', '["Ayati 7-9; Mat 14:1,2; Mar 6:14-16","Ayati 18:19","Faigi 23:8"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 10, '

Ba mangawuli zinenge no mege, ladunö-dunö khönia, hadia nilaura. Ba i''ohe ira, awönia, mofanö ia ba zi ha ya''ira, isaŵa mbanua, sotöi Betisa''ida.', '["Mar 6:30; Mat 14:13"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 11, '

Ba la''ila niha sato, ba la''o''ö ia, ba ifa''amöi ira khönia, fahuhuo ia khöra, i''ombakha''ö mbanua Lowalangi andrö, ba ha niha zofökhö, ba ifadöhö wökhö.', '["Ayati 11-17: Mat 14:13-21; Mar 6:31-44; Yoh 6:1-14"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 12, '

Ba lö sa''ae alaŵa luo. Ba möi khönia zi felendrua, lamane khönia: Fofanö niha sato andrö, ena''ö möi ira mörö ba mbanua si fasui ba ba halama, ba ena''ö lasöndra gö, me ba danö si mate so ita ba da''e.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 13, '

Ba imane khöra: Mibe''e göra, ya''ami.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 14, '

So sa lima ngahönö ndra matua.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 15, '

Ba la''o''ö da''ö, lafedadao ira fefu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 16, '

Ba ihalö roti andrö, si lima, ba i''a andrö, si dua rozi, ifaöga horönia miyaŵa ba zorugo, ifahowu''ö gö andrö ba iboboto ba ibe''e khö ndra nifahaö, ba wame''e ba niha sato.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 17, '

Ba manga ira ba abuso fefu. Ba la''ozaragö zi tosai, akhökhöla, felendrua kude.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 18, '

Ba me mangandrö ia, ha ya''ia, ba la''ondrasi ia nifahaö, ba isofu khöra, imane: Ha laŵa''ö niha sato, ha niha ndra''odo?', '["Ayati 18-22: Mat 16:13-21; Mar 8:27-31"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 19, '

Ba latema linia, lamane: Laŵa''ö: Yohane andrö, samayagö idanö; ba so zanguma''ö: Eliya; ba so ösa, ba laŵa''ö: No maoso zama''ele''ö föna andrö, samösa.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 20, '

Ba imane khöra: Ba ya''ami, ha miŵa''ö, ha niha ndra''o?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 21, '

Ba itenaŵa ira, iŵa''ö khöra, böi la''ombakha''ö da''ö, gofu ha ökhö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 22, 'Imane: Lö tola lö oya itaha famakao Ono Niha, ba latibo''ö ia dania satua mbanua andrö ba ere sebua ba sangila amakhoita andrö, ba labunu ia, ba tölu ngaluo, ba tesusugi ia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 23, '

Ba imane khöra fefu: Na so zedöna molo''ö ya''o, ba yamu''ositengagö ia, yamulu''i röfania, ero maökhö, ba yamu''o''ö ndra''o.', '["Ayati 23-27: Mat 16:24-28; Mar 8:34-38","Mar 8:34","Mat 10:33; Mar 8:38","Mar 9:1"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 24, 'Ha niha sa zedöna manganau''ö nosonia, khönia aetu dania; ba ha niha zaetu noso, na börö ndra''o, da''ö zanganau''ö ya''ia.', '["Ayati 23-27: Mat 16:24-28; Mar 8:34-38","Mar 8:34","Mat 10:33; Mar 8:38","Mar 9:1"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 25, 'Hadia sa guna ba niha, na isöndra harenia fefu hadia ia zi so ba guli danö, ba na ya''ia zi taya, na te''ala ia ba khönia?', '["Ayati 23-27: Mat 16:24-28; Mar 8:34-38","Mar 8:34","Mat 10:33; Mar 8:38","Mar 9:1"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 26, 'Ha niha sa zaila ba khögu andre ba ba daroma ligu andrö, da''ö göi zaila dania Nono Niha, na so ia, na so khönia lakhöminia, awö lakhömi Nama, awö lakhömi mala''ika ni''amoni''ö andrö.', '["Ayati 23-27: Mat 16:24-28; Mar 8:34-38","Mar 8:34","Mat 10:33; Mar 8:38","Mar 9:1"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 27, 'Ba si ndruhu-ndruhu niŵa''ögu khömi: So ösa ba zi so ba da''e, si lö mangila fa''amate, irege no la''ila mbanua Lowalangi andrö.', '["Ayati 23-27: Mat 16:24-28; Mar 8:34-38","Mar 8:34","Mat 10:33; Mar 8:38","Mar 9:1"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 28, '

Ba me no i''etu''ö huhuo andrö, ba so mato ŵalu bongi, ba i''ohe ndra Fetero, Yohane Yakobo, möi ia ba hili, mangandrö.', '["Ayati 28-36: Mat 17:1-9; Mar 9:2-9"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 29, '

Ba me mangandrö ia, ba tobali mbawania, ba afusi mbarunia, humaga.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 30, 'Ba hiza niha, darua, si fahuhuo khönia, Moze ba Eliya.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 31, '

Molakhömi, wamaigira, lafatunö lua-lua lalania, nifaluania dania ba Yeruzalema.', '["Faigi 18:31"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 32, '

Ba manuköu ndra Fetero. Ba me tokea ira, ba la''ila lakhöminia, awö niha andrö, si darua, si so ba da''ö khönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 33, 'Ba me laheta ira khönia da''ö, ba imane Fetero khö Yesu: He samahaö, ba da''e zi sökhi nahada, ba damafazökhi nose, tölu, sambua khöu, sambua khö Moze, ba sambua khö Geliya; lö i''ila watahögö hadia wehedenia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 34, '

Ba barö wehedenia andrö, ba so lawuo, ilumö''ö ira. Ba ata''u ira, me möi ira bakha ba lawuo andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 35, '

Ba so li, si oroi lawuo andrö, imane: Onogu da''ö, nituyugu, mifondrondrongo khönia.', '["FetII 1:16,17"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 36, 'Ba me terongo li andrö ba hatö Yesu ni''ilara. Ba lö hede-hedera, lö hadia ia la''ombakha''ö ba niha, gofu ha ökhö, me luo da''ö, hadia ni''ilara.', '["FetII 1:16,17"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 37, '

Ba mahemolu ö, me möi ira mitou moroi ba hili, ba ato zamaondragö ya''ia niha.', '["Ayati 37-42: Mat 17:14-21; Mar 9:14-29"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 38, 'Ba hiza niha, samösa, ba zato andrö, mu''ao ia, imane: He samahaö, u''andrö khöu, faigi nonogu matua andrö, awai nonogu, ba hiza,', '["Ayati 37-42: Mat 17:14-21; Mar 9:14-29"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 39, 'ira''u bekhu ba i''ogomuzaö mu''ao, ba idödöni bekhu, fawukhö gilo, ifakao, lö edöna ia aheta.', '["Ayati 37-42: Mat 17:14-21; Mar 9:14-29"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 40, 'Ba no u''andrö ba nifahaömö, ena''ö lafofanö ia, ba tebai.', '["Ayati 37-42: Mat 17:14-21; Mar 9:14-29"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 41, '

Ba itema linia Yesu, imane: He ya''ami, niha si lö mamati, si no tefuyu tödö! he wisa na wa''aragu khömi ena''ö, ba ha wa''ara utaha ba khömi?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 42, 'Ohe ba da''e nonou andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 43, '

Ba oi tobali dödöra, ba wa''abölö Lowalangi andrö. Ba me oi ahöli-höli dödöra ba nilaunia andrö fefu, ba imane ba nifahaönia:', '["Mat 16:21"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 44, 'Mifondrondrongo niŵa''ögu andre: Tebe''e sa dania ba danga niha Nono Niha.', '["Mat 16:21"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 45, '

Ba lö aboto ba dödöra niŵa''önia andrö, no tobini khöra, fa lö la''ila watahögö. Ba ata''u ira wanofu khönia ba niŵa''önia andrö.', '["Faigi 18:34; Mar 9:32"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 46, '

Ba tesao ba dödöra, ha niha zebuara maö.', '["Ayati 46-48: Mat 18:1-5; Mar 9:33-37","Faigi 22:24"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 47, '

Ba me no i''ila gera-era dödöra andrö Yesu, ba ihalö ndraono, ibe''e ba ngainia, ba imane khöra:', '["Faigi 22:26; Mat 20:26 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 48, 'Na so zama''amöi yomo khönia ono andre, na börö döigu, ba ya''o nifa''amöinia yomo. Ba na so zama''amöi yomo ya''o, ba samatenge ya''o ifa''amöi yomo. Ha niha sa wondrege zide-ide ba khömi fefu, da''ö zebua.', '["Faigi 22:26; Mat 20:26 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 49, '

Ba itema Yohane, imane: He samahaö, no ma''ila zamösa, sanötöi töimö, wamofanö bekhu, ba no matenaŵa ia, me lö i''o''ö ita.', '["Ayati 49-50: Mar 9:38-40"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 50, '

Ba imane khönia Yesu: Böi mitenaŵa, ha niha sa zi lö fa''udu khömi, ba no awömi.', '["Fil 1:18"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 51, '

Ba me lö ara tö irugi baŵa wofanönia ba zorugo, ba idölö ia ba Yeruzalema.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 52, 'Ba ifatenge zinenge, sowaö-waö fönania. Ba mofanö da''ö, ba larugi mbanua Ndrawa Zamaria, ba wamaigi naha wemörö khönia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 53, 'Ba lö lafa''amöi ia yomo, me no ba lala ba Yeruzalema so ia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 54, '

Ba me la''ila da''ö nifahaö andrö, Yakobo ba Yohane, ba lamane: He Tua, hadia, omasi''ö na maŵa''ö galitö moroi yaŵa ba mbanua, ena''ö i''a ira?', '["Sal II 1:10 b.t.","Yoh 3:17; 12:47"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 55, 'Ba ibali''ö ia, itenaŵa ira.', '["Sal II 1:10 b.t.","Yoh 3:17; 12:47"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 56, 'Ba lasaŵa mbanua bö''ö.', '["Sal II 1:10 b.t.","Yoh 3:17; 12:47"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 57, '

Ba ba wofanö andrö, ba so zamösa, sanguma''ö khönia: Da''u''o''ö ndra''ugö, gofu heza möi''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 58, '

Ba imane khönia Yesu: So dögi narö hili ba zigölu, ba ba wofo ba dalu mbanua, ba so gazuni, ba khö Nono Niha, ba lö naha wemörö.', '["Mat 8:19 b.t"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 59, '

Ba iŵa''ö ba danö bö''ö: O''ö ndra''o.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 60, '

Ba imane khönia: Akha lako''o zi mate khöra niha si mate, ba ya''ugö, ba ae ombakha''ö mbanua Lowalangi andrö.', '["Mat 8:22"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 61, '

Ba so danö bö''ö na, imane: Da''u''o''ö ndra''ugö Tua, ba tehe khögu ua, ena''ö u''angonasi zi so baomo khögu.', '["Gal 1:16"]', NULL),
  (3393934, 'NT', 'Luka', 9, 62, '

Ba imane khönia Yesu: Gofu ha niha ia, zanuyu faku, na ifaigi furinia, ba lö göna ba mbanua Lowalangi andrö.', '["Faigi 17:32,33"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 1, 'Aefa da''ö, ba i''oniagö na danö bö''ö So''aya fitu ngafulu, ba ifatenge ira, daru-darua, ba wowaö-waö fönania, ba mbanua sebua ba ba mbanua side-ide fefu, ba zi möi ia dania.', '["MozII 24:1"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 2, '

Ba imane khöra: Ebolo sa mbasitö andrö, ba sohalöŵö, ba lö atoto: andrö mi''andrö khö zokhö basitö andrö, ena''ö ifatenge zohalöŵö ba mbasitönia.', '["Mat 9:37,38","Mat 10:16","Mat 10:9 b.t.; SalII 4:29"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 3, 'Mi''ae''e; hiza, ufatenge ami, hulö nono mbiri-biri, ba hunö nasu gatua.', '["Mat 9:37,38","Mat 10:16","Mat 10:9 b.t.; SalII 4:29"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 4, 'Böi mi''ohe gabe-kabe, ba he bola, ba he badagahe; böi mi''owai niha ba lala.', '["Mat 9:37,38","Mat 10:16","Mat 10:9 b.t.; SalII 4:29"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 5, '

Ba ba zi möi ami yomo, ba da''ö zi föföna limi: "Yafalukha wa''ohahau dödö zi samba omo andre."', '["Mat 10:12 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 6, '

Ba na so ba da''ö nono wa''ohahau dödö, ba ahono khönia wa''ohahau dödö andrö khömi; ba na lö''ö, ba mangawuli ia khömi.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 7, '

Ba ba nomo andrö mi''iagö, mi''a ba mibadu hadia nibe''era khömi, noa sa si nangea itema luo sohalöŵö. Böi mifa''ema nomo.', '["KorI 10:27; Mat 10:10"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 8, '

Ba na möi ami ba mbanua, ba na lafa''amöi ami, ba mi''a hadia nibe''era khömi,', '[]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 9, '

ba mifadöhö wökhö zofökhö khöra, ba mimane khöra: No i''ondrasi ami banua Lowalangi andrö', '["Mat 3:2"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 10, '

Ba na möi ami ba mbanua, ba na lö lafa''amöi ami, ba miheta ami yomo, mi''ae ba newali khöra, ba mimane:', '[]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 11, '

Gawu-gawu andre na i, si falemba khöma, ba gahe, ba mbanuami andre, ba ma''ezosi khömi, ba böi zi lö mi''ila, wa no ahatö mbanua Lowalangi andrö.', '["Mat 10:14 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 12, '

Ba uŵa''ö khömi öna-öna na zi göna Zodoma, na luo da''ö dania, moroi ba zi göna mbanua da''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 13, '

Alai ndra''ugö, Khorasi! Alai ndra''ugö Betisa''ida! Na ba Diro ba ba Zidona mena''ö tefazökhi dandra andrö, nifazökhi ba khömi andrö, ba no föna sa''ae lafalalini mena''ö gera-erara, no dumadao ira bawu mena''ö ba no la''onukha goni-goni.', '["Ayati 13-16: Mat 11:20-24"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 14, 'Ba öna-öna na zi göna Diro ba Sidona, ba wanguhuku dania, moroi ba zi göna ami.', '["Ayati 13-16: Mat 11:20-24"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 15, '

Ba ya''ugö Kafanauma, tenga no mu''alaŵa''ö ndra''ugö irugi ba zorugo? Irugi mbanua tou latimba si tou ndra''ugö dania.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 16, '

Ha niha zamondrongo khömi, ba khögu ifondrondrongo, ba ha niha zangositengagö ya''ami, ba ya''o i''ositengagö, ba ha niha zangositengagö ya''o, ba samatenge ya''o i''ositengagö.', '["Mat 10:40; TesI 2:13; 4:8"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 17, '

Ba mangawuli zi fitu ngafulu no mege, omuso dödöra, lamane: He Tua, bekhu göi, no la''o''ö lima, ba döimö andrö.', '["Faigi 9:1,10"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 18, '

Ba imane khöra: No u''ila Zatana andrö, saekhu tou moroi ba mbanua si yaŵa, hulö gari mbanua.', '["Yoh 12:31; Fam 12:9","Mat 16:18; Sin 91:13"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 19, 'Hiza no utehe khömi mihundragö gulö ba tongo ba milaŵa wa''abölö nemali andrö fefu, ba lö''ö manö te''ala ami.', '["Yoh 12:31; Fam 12:9","Mat 16:18; Sin 91:13"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 20, '

Ba böi da''ö mibe''e fa''omuso dödömi, wa no la''o''ö limi bekhu andrö; da''ö mibe''e fa''omuso dödömi, wa no mutanö döimi ba zura, ba zorugo.', '["Fil 4:3; Fam 20:12; 21:27"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 21, '

Me luo da''ö owua-wua dödönia, soroi ba Geheha ni''amoni''ö, ba imane: Usuno ndra''ugö, Ama, So''aya sorugo awö danö, me no öbini''ö da''ö ba zatua-tua ba ba zonekhe, ba me no ö''oroma''ö ia ba ndraono. Si ndruhu, ya''ugö, Ama, me no si manö wa''omasiu.', '["Mat 11:25-27"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 22, '

Ba ibali''ö ia furi ba nifahaönia, imane: No ibe''e ba dangagu Amagu fefu hadia ia, ba lö saboto ba dödö ha niha Nono andrö, baero Nama andrö, ba lö saboto ba dödö ha niha Nama andrö, baero Nono andrö, awö ba zedöna i''oroma''ö Ono andrö.', '["Yoh 17:10; Heb 2:8"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 23, '

Ba ibali''ö ia furi ba nifahaönia, ba zi ha ya''ira, imane: Ya''ahowu hörö andrö, sangila ni''ilami andrö.', '["Mat 13:16,17"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 24, 'Uŵa''ö sa khömi: Ato zama''ele''ö, awö zalaŵa, somasi mangila ni''ilami, ba lö ni''ilara, ba no omasi ira mamondrongo nirongomi, ba lö nirongora.', '["Mat 13:16,17"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 25, '

Ba hiza, maoso zangila amakhoita, samösa, manandraigö ya''ia, imane: He samahaö, he uwisa, ena''ö usöndra wa''auri si lö aetu andrö?', '["Mat 24:35 b.t.; Mar 12:28 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 26, '

Ba imane khönia: Hadia ba zura goroisa andrö? he wisa wombasou?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 27, '

Ba itema linia, imane: "Omasi''ö Zo''aya, Lowalangiu, moroi si''aikö ba dödöu, nosou ma''asambua zangomasi''ö ya''ia, ba öhorigö wa''abölöu, awö gera-erau wangomasi''ö ya''ia; ba omasi''ö zahatö khöu, si mane fa''omasiu ndra''ugö."', '["MozV 6:5; MozIII 19:18"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 28, '

Ba imane khönia: Si ndruhu niŵa''öu, o''ö da''ö, ba auri ndra''ugö.', '["MozIII 18:5; Rom 10:5"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 29, '

Ba ibu''a ena''ö, imane khö Yesu: Ba ha niha zahatö khögu?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 30, '

Ba imane Yesu: So niha, si möi misi tou, i''otarai Yeruzalema, numalö ba Yerikho, ba falukha ia zorabu, laheta nukhania, laböbözi ia ba lalau mofanö, laröi tou ia, arakha mate.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 31, '

Ba itörö misi tou lala andrö ere, ba i''ila, ba itörö manö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 32, '

Ba si manö göi nono Lewi, samösa, me irugi da''ö, i''ila, ba itörö manö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 33, '

Ba itörö göi da''ö Dawa Zamaria, sikoli, ba me i''ila, ba ahakhö dödönia.', '["Faigi 17:16; Yoh 4:9; 8:48"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 34, 'I''ondrasi, i''olohuni zokhonia, ilau wanikha ba agu, ifazaŵa ba kudo khönia, i''ohe ba nomo ba zi mörö zikoli ba irorogö.', '["Faigi 17:16; Yoh 4:9; 8:48"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 35, '

Ba mahemolu ö, ba iso''ö baero dombua hua suku, ibe''e khö zokhö omo andrö, imane: Rorogö ia, ba na öbe''e na, baero da''e, hadia ia, ba u''ali khöu, na mangawulido.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 36, '

Hadia ba dödöu, ha niha ba zi datölu andrö zahatö khö nibözi zorabu andrö?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 37, '

Ba imane: Si hakhösi tödö ya''ia.', '[]', NULL);


Ba me mofanö ira, ba möi ia ba mbanua side-ide; ba so ndra alawe, Marata döi, ikaoni ia yomo.', '["Yoh 11:1; 12:1-3"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 39, '

Ba so dalifusönia, Maria döi, ba dumadao da''ö föna Zo''aya mamondrongo niŵa''önia.', '["MozV 33:3"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 40, '

Ba Marata andrö, ba no owölö-ölö, ba wangai hadia ia zoguna khönia. Ba möi ia khönia, imane: He Tua, hadia, lö ba dödöu, wa ibe''e manö sangai halöŵö ndra''o ga''agu, ha ya''o? ŵa''ö ae khönia, ena''ö ibabaya göi, itolodo.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 41, '

Ba itema linia So''aya, imane khönia: He Marata! he Marata! wa''oya wangabu dödöu, ba oya ngawalö wa lö ahono''ö;', '["Sin 27:4; Mat 6:33; Yoh 6:47,33"]', NULL),
  (3393935, 'NT', 'Luka', 10, 42, 'ba ha sambalö zoguna. No ituyu khönia zi sökhi andrö Maria, lö laheta khönia da''ö.', '["Sin 27:4; Mat 6:33; Yoh 6:47,33"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 1, 'Ba i''alui naha wangandrö ba mangandrö ia. Ba me no ibato, ba imane khönia nifahaönia, samösa: He Tua, fahaöga ba wangandrö, si mane famahaö Yohane nifahaönia göi, föna.[1]', '["Faigi 5:33"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 2, 'Ba imane khöra: Na mangandrö ami, ba mimane: He Ama! Yate''amoni''ö döiu. Yatobali banuau fefu niha.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 3, 'Si rugi öma, be''e khöma ero ma''ökhö,', '[]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 4, 'Ba efa''ö khöma horöma; ya''aga sa göi, ma''efa''ö zala ba zi so sala khöma, fefu. Ba böi ohe ndra''aga ba wanandraigö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 5, 'Ba imane khöra: Ha niha ba khömi, zi so si fahuwu khönia, na möi khönia, na talu mbongi, na imane khönia: He le, be''e nifalaligu roti ma''ifu, ha tölu uhalö,', '[]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 6, 'noa sa möi khögu zi fahuwu khögu, i''otarai kumoli, ba lö hadia ia khögu, önia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 7, 'Hadia, iŵa''ö dania moroi si bakha: Böi busi dödögu, noa sa kumusi mbawandruhö, ba no mörö sa''ae ba ngaigu ndraonogu; tebai maoso ndra''o, ba wame''e khöu?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 8, 'Uŵa''ö khömi, he lö''ö göi ibe''e khönia, lö maoso ia, me si fahuwu khönia, ba maoso sa ia, me iforege wangandrö, ba ibe''e khönia, ha wa''oya zoguna khönia.[2]', '["Faigi 18:5","Ayati 9–13: Mat 7:7–11"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 9, 'Ba uŵa''ö khömi:[3] Mi''angandrö, ba tebe''e khömi. Mi''angalui, ba misöndra. Mibokö-bökö mbawandruhö, ba tebokai khömi.', '["Faigi 18:5","Ayati 9–13: Mat 7:7–11"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 10, 'Dozi sa sangandrö, ba manema, ba sangalui, ba isöndra, ba khö zamökö-mökö bawandruhö, ba tebokai.', '["Faigi 18:5","Ayati 9–13: Mat 7:7–11"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 11, 'Ba ha niha ba khömi so''ono, same''e khö nononia kara, na i''andrö roti, ba ma same''e salahi gi''a ulö, na i''andrö gia?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 12, 'ba ma same''e khönia tongo, na i''andrö gadulo manu?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 13, 'Ba na ya''ami, si lö sökhi, mi''ila mibe''e game''ela si sökhi ba ndraonomi ba tenga mendrua manö ibe''e Ama moroi ba zorugo Geheha ni''amoni''ö ba zangandrö khönia?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 14, 'Ba ifofanö mbekhu si lö hede.[4] Ba tobali, me no aheta mbekhu andrö, ba humede zi lö hede andrö. Ba ahöli-höli dödö niha sato.', '["Ayati 14–23: Mat 9:32–34; 12:22–30; Mar 3:22–30"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 15, 'Ba so ösa ba khöra zanguma''ö: Moroi ba zalaŵa mbekhu, Belesebu andrö, wa ifofanö mbekhu andrö.', '["Mat 12:38"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 16, 'Ba so zanandraigö ya''ia, la''andrö dandra khönia moroi si yaŵa ba mbanua.[5]', '["Mat 12:38"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 17, 'Ba i''ila gera-erara, ba imane khöra: Dozi öri, na no fabali dödö, ba adudu; ilangö nomo si sambua si sambua.', '["Mar 9:40","Ayati 24–26: Mat 12:43–45","Yoh 5:14; Heb 6:4–6; 10:26 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 18, 'Ba na no fabali göi dödö Zatana, ba he moroi wa''aro mbanuania? me miŵa''ö, moroi khö Mbelesebu, wa ufofanö mbekhu andrö.', '["Mar 9:40","Ayati 24–26: Mat 12:43–45","Yoh 5:14; Heb 6:4–6; 10:26 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 19, 'Ba na moroi khö Mbelesebu, wa ufofanö mbekhu andrö, ba he moroi, wa lafofanö iraonomi? Andrö ya''ira zanguhuku ya''ami dania.', '["Mar 9:40","Ayati 24–26: Mat 12:43–45","Yoh 5:14; Heb 6:4–6; 10:26 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 20, 'Ba na moroi ba duru Lowalangi, wamofanögu bekhu, ba noa sa''ae i''ondrasi ami banua Lowalangi andrö.', '["Mar 9:40","Ayati 24–26: Mat 12:43–45","Yoh 5:14; Heb 6:4–6; 10:26 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 21, 'Na manaro ba golayamania zabölö, si no mangarö, ba ahono zi so khönia.', '["Mar 9:40","Ayati 24–26: Mat 12:43–45","Yoh 5:14; Heb 6:4–6; 10:26 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 22, 'Ba na so zabölö moroi khönia, na ilaŵa ia, ba ihalö wangönania, tötönafönia, sabölö andrö ba ifaosa nirabunia.', '["Mar 9:40","Ayati 24–26: Mat 12:43–45","Yoh 5:14; Heb 6:4–6; 10:26 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 23, 'Ha niha zi lö fa''awö khögu, ba no si fa''udu khögu, ba ha niha zi lö mangozara, awögu, ba no samazaewe.[6]', '["Mar 9:40","Ayati 24–26: Mat 12:43–45","Yoh 5:14; Heb 6:4–6; 10:26 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 24, 'Na iheta ia ba niha bekhu si ra''iö,[7] ba itöröi danö si lö idanö, magalui sahono ia, ba me lö isöndra, ba imane: Da''ufulido ba nomogu andrö, ba zi otarai ndra''o.', '["Mar 9:40","Ayati 24–26: Mat 12:43–45","Yoh 5:14; Heb 6:4–6; 10:26 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 25, 'Ba na irugi, ba i''ila, no mubözini ba no muhaogö.', '["Mar 9:40","Ayati 24–26: Mat 12:43–45","Yoh 5:14; Heb 6:4–6; 10:26 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 26, 'Ba möi ia, ihalö awönia mbekhu bö''ö, si lö sökhi moroi khönia, fitu, ba möi ira bakha, labali''ö omora da''ö no mege, ba tobali tedou walösökhi gamozua niha andrö, moroi ba mböröta. [8]', '["Mar 9:40","Ayati 24–26: Mat 12:43–45","Yoh 5:14; Heb 6:4–6; 10:26 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 27, 'Ba me iŵa''ö da''ö, ba humede ndra alawe, samösa, ba niha sato, imane khönia: Ya''ahowu dalu andrö sanabina ya''ugö föna, awö meme andrö, nibadumö ösi.[9]', '["Faigi 1:28,48","Mat 7:21"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 28, 'Ba imane: Ya''ia, ya''ahowu zamondrongo taroma li Lowalangi ba same''e ba dödö.[10]', '["Faigi 1:28,48","Mat 7:21"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 29, 'Ba me ato zo hurufai ya''ia niha,[11] ba ibörötaigö, imane: Niha si lö sökhi niha andre. La''andrö dandra, ba lö labe''e khöra dandra, baero dandra Yona andrö.', '["Ayati 29-32: Mat 12:38-42","Faigi 8:16","Mat 6:22"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 30, 'Hulö si mane Yona andrö sa, me tobali tandra ia ba mbanua Niniwe andrö, si manö göi dania Nono Niha ba niha andre.', '["Ayati 29-32: Mat 12:38-42","Faigi 8:16","Mat 6:22"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 31, 'Maoso dania razo ira alawe, moroi raya no, na fanguhuku dania, ba zi so niha da''e, ba i''etu''ö hukura, me no i''otarai wondrege danö, ba wamondrondrongo fa''atua-tua Zelomo andrö, ba hiza, no töra moroi khö Zelomo zi so ba da''e.', '["Ayati 29-32: Mat 12:38-42","Faigi 8:16","Mat 6:22"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 32, 'Maoso dania mbanua Niniwe andrö, na fanguhuku dania, udu niha andre, ba la''etu''ö hukura, me no lafalalini gera-erara, ba wangombakha Yona andrö, ba hiza no töra moroi khö Yona zi so ba da''e.', '["Ayati 29-32: Mat 12:38-42","Faigi 8:16","Mat 6:22"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 33, 'Lö itunu wandru niha, ba ibe''e ba zi tobini, ma barö dumba yöu, ibe''e ba naha wandru yaŵa, ena''ö oroma hagania ba zi möi yomo.[12]', '["Ayati 29-32: Mat 12:38-42","Faigi 8:16","Mat 6:22"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 34, 'Fandru mboto höröu. Na atulö höröu, ba mohaga göi mbotou ma''asambua, ba na si lö sökhi, ba sogömi-gömi göi mbotou.[13]', '["Ayati 29-32: Mat 12:38-42","Faigi 8:16","Mat 6:22"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 35, 'Andrö faigi, fa böi ogömi-gömi haga andrö, si so ba dödöu.', '["Ayati 29-32: Mat 12:38-42","Faigi 8:16","Mat 6:22"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 36, 'Ba na mohaga mbotou andrö ma''asambua, na lö hadia ia ba khönia zogömi-gömi, ba mohaga manö fefu, hulö na si göna haga wandru ndra''ugö.', '["Ayati 29-32: Mat 12:38-42","Faigi 8:16","Mat 6:22"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 37, 'Ba me fahuhuo ia, ba i''andrö khönia farizaio, samösa, ena''ö möi ia manga ahulö khönia. Ba möi ia yomo, manga.[14]', '["Luk 7:36","Mat 15:2 b.t.; Mar 7:2 b.t.","Mat 23:25; Tit 1:15","Yes 58:7","Mat 23:23; 12:7","Mat 23:6; Mar 12:38 b.t.","Mat 23:27"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 38, 'Ba ahöli-höli dödö warizaio andrö, me i''ila, lö ihönagö mombanö Yesu, me awena manga.[15]', '["Luk 7:36","Mat 15:2 b.t.; Mar 7:2 b.t.","Mat 23:25; Tit 1:15","Yes 58:7","Mat 23:23; 12:7","Mat 23:6; Mar 12:38 b.t.","Mat 23:27"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 39, 'Ba imane khönia So''aya: Ya''ami, farizaio ma''ökhö, mihaogö gero mako ba ero wiga, ba tanö bakha khömi, ba oi afönu nirabu, awö walösökhi.[16]', '["Luk 7:36","Mat 15:2 b.t.; Mar 7:2 b.t.","Mat 23:25; Tit 1:15","Yes 58:7","Mat 23:23; 12:7","Mat 23:6; Mar 12:38 b.t.","Mat 23:27"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 40, 'He si lö tödö! tenga ha samösa zamazökhi ya''ia, he tanö baero ba he tanö bakha?[17]', '["Luk 7:36","Mat 15:2 b.t.; Mar 7:2 b.t.","Mat 23:25; Tit 1:15","Yes 58:7","Mat 23:23; 12:7","Mat 23:6; Mar 12:38 b.t.","Mat 23:27"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 41, 'Mibe''e manö ame''ela ba zi numana zi so yaŵa, ba hiza, a''oi sa''ae sökhi khömi.', '["Luk 7:36","Mat 15:2 b.t.; Mar 7:2 b.t.","Mat 23:25; Tit 1:15","Yes 58:7","Mat 23:23; 12:7","Mat 23:6; Mar 12:38 b.t.","Mat 23:27"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 42, 'Ba alai ami farizaio andrö, me mibe''e zambua ni''ofulu lönga ba höwa, awö ngawalö gule-gule fefu, ba lö ba dödömi huku ba fa''omasi Lowalangi andrö. Ni''o''ö ena''ö zi sambalö, ba tenga göi ni''ositengagö zi sambalö.[18]', '["Luk 7:36","Mat 15:2 b.t.; Mar 7:2 b.t.","Mat 23:25; Tit 1:15","Yes 58:7","Mat 23:23; 12:7","Mat 23:6; Mar 12:38 b.t.","Mat 23:27"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 43, 'Alai ami, farizaio, me no omasi ami tanö föna so ami ba zekola ba la''owai ami ba kade.[19]', '["Luk 7:36","Mat 15:2 b.t.; Mar 7:2 b.t.","Mat 23:25; Tit 1:15","Yes 58:7","Mat 23:23; 12:7","Mat 23:6; Mar 12:38 b.t.","Mat 23:27"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 44, 'Alai ami! me hulö lewatö si lö oroma ami, latörö niha, ba lö la''ila.[20]', '["Luk 7:36","Mat 15:2 b.t.; Mar 7:2 b.t.","Mat 23:25; Tit 1:15","Yes 58:7","Mat 23:23; 12:7","Mat 23:6; Mar 12:38 b.t.","Mat 23:27"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 45, 'Ba itema linia sangila amakhoita, samösa, imane khönia: He samahaö, ya''aga göi ö''o''aya, wanguma''ö da''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 46, 'Ba imane: Ya''ami göi, sangila amakhöita, alai ami, me mihare''ö ba niha noro, si lö lokha lö la''ohe, ba ya''ami, ba sara turumi lö mibabaya noro andrö.[21]', '["Mat 23:4","Mat 23:29 b.t.","Ayati 49–51: Mat 23:34-36","Mat 23:13","Faigi 20:20; Yoh 8:6"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 47, 'Alai ami, me mifazökhi dandra lewatö zama''ele''ö andrö, ba ira tuami föna zamunu.[22]', '["Mat 23:4","Mat 23:29 b.t.","Ayati 49–51: Mat 23:34-36","Mat 23:13","Faigi 20:20; Yoh 8:6"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 48, 'Ba tobali samaduhu''ö nilau ndra tuami ami, oroma wa no omasi ami nilaura, ya''ira sa zamunu, ba ya''ami zamazökhi tandra lewatö.', '["Mat 23:4","Mat 23:29 b.t.","Ayati 49–51: Mat 23:34-36","Mat 23:13","Faigi 20:20; Yoh 8:6"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 49, 'Andrö göi imane fa''atua-tua Lowalangi andrö:[23] Ufatenge dania khöra zama''ele''ö ba sinenge, ba labunu ösa ba lagohi;', '["Mat 23:4","Mat 23:29 b.t.","Ayati 49–51: Mat 23:34-36","Mat 23:13","Faigi 20:20; Yoh 8:6"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 50, 'ena''ö te''alui ndro zama''ele''ö andrö fefu, niduwagö, i''otarai mböröta danö, irugi niha andre, si sagötö;', '["Mat 23:4","Mat 23:29 b.t.","Ayati 49–51: Mat 23:34-36","Mat 23:13","Faigi 20:20; Yoh 8:6"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 51, 'i''otarai ndro Habeli, irugi ndro Zakharia andrö, nibunu ba gotaluara naha wame''e sumange gosali. Si ndruhu, uŵa''ö khömi, te''alui ia dania ba niha andre.', '["Mat 23:4","Mat 23:29 b.t.","Ayati 49–51: Mat 23:34-36","Mat 23:13","Faigi 20:20; Yoh 8:6"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 52, 'Alai ami, sangila amakhoita, me no mihalö wogoe wangila lala andrö; ya''ami, ba lö si möi bakha, ba sedöna möi bakha, ba no misaisi.[24]', '["Mat 23:4","Mat 23:29 b.t.","Ayati 49–51: Mat 23:34-36","Mat 23:13","Faigi 20:20; Yoh 8:6"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 53, 'Ba me mofanö ia ba da''ö, ba ibörötaigö abua sibai ba zangila amakhoita ba ba warizaio, ba lasekhegö ia, oya ngawalö lazofu-zofu.', '["Mat 23:4","Mat 23:29 b.t.","Ayati 49–51: Mat 23:34-36","Mat 23:13","Faigi 20:20; Yoh 8:6"]', NULL),
  (3393936, 'NT', 'Luka', 11, 54, 'Latarogö ia, ena''ö lasöndra hadia ia zi sala linia. [25]', '["Mat 23:4","Mat 23:29 b.t.","Ayati 49–51: Mat 23:34-36","Mat 23:13","Faigi 20:20; Yoh 8:6"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 1, 'Ba owulo niha sato, ba ngafulu ngahönö, tobali lahundragö nawöra, ba ibörötaigö Yesu, imane ba nifahaöinia ua: Mi''angelamaisi danömö roti ba warizaio andrö, famini tödö andrö.[1]', '["Mat 16:6"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 2, 'Lö''ö sa hadia ia nibalugö,[2] si lö tebokai dania, ba lö si tobini, si lö te''ila dania.', '["Ayati 2-9: Mat 10:26-33"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 3, 'Andrö, ha wa''oya niŵa''ömi ba zogömi-gömi, ba ba haga terongo, ba hadia niŵa''ömi ba dögi dalinga, si bakha, ba ba dete nomo yaŵa teturiagö.', '["Ayati 2-9: Mat 10:26-33"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 4, 'Ba uŵa''ö khömi si fahuwu khögu: böi mi''ata''ufi zamunu boto, ba aefa ö, ba lö la''ila mulau hadia ia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 5, 'Ba u''oroma''ö khömi, ha niha ni''ata''ufimi; mi''ata''ufi zi tola manibo ba narako, na no aefa ibunu. Si ndruhu, uŵa''ö khömi, da''ö mi''ata''ufi.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 6, 'Tenga lima sagada la''amawa ziliŵi nali? ba sambua lö solifu Lowalangi da''ö.', '["Luk 21:18"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 7, 'Ba rozi mbu ba högömi göi fefu, ba no mu''erai; böi ata''u ami, no tohude ami moroi ba ziliŵi nali, he ŵa''ae oya ira,[3]', '["Luk 21:18"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 8, 'Ba uŵa''ö khömi: Ha niha fefu zamaduhu''ö ya''o ba niha, da''ö nifaduhu''ö Nono Niha göi dania föna mala''ika Lowalangi andrö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 9, 'Ba ha niha zangosilö''ögö ya''o ba niha, da''ö ni''osilö''ögö föna mala''ika Lowalangi andrö dania.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 10, 'Ba ha niha fefu zanandraŵaisi Ono Niha, ba ni''efa''ö khönia da''ö; ba ha niha zanandraŵaisi Eheha ni''amoni''ö, ba lö te''efa''ö khönia.[4]', '["Mat 12:31 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 11, 'Ba na la''ohe ami ba walukhata ba ba zalaŵa ba ba zolohe huku, ba böi mi''abusi tödö he miwisa ba hadia wamu''a, ba hadia niŵa''ömi.[5]', '["Luk 21:14 b.t.; Mat 10:19 b.t.; Mar 13:11"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 12, 'Eheha ni''amoni''ö sa dania zamahaö ya''ami, ba da''ö sibai, hadia niŵa''ö.', '["Luk 21:14 b.t.; Mat 10:19 b.t.; Mar 13:11"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 13, 'Ba so zamösa, awö niha sato andrö, imane khönia: He samahaö, ŵa''ö khö ga''agu, ena''ö mafaosa göndröita zatua.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 14, 'Ba imane khönia: He le! ha niha zamataro ya''o sanguhuku, ba ma samaosa ondröita ba khömi?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 15, 'Ba imane khöra: Mifaigi, mi''angelamaisi wa''omasi gana''a fefu, alakha lö fahöna, fa irugi aurifa si so andrö.[6]', '["TimI 6:7-10; Amaed 23:4"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 16, 'Ba iŵa''ö khöra gamaedola, imane: So niha so''ana''a, ba no abölö mbua nowinia.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 17, 'Ba i''era-era tödönia, imane: He uwisa, me lö khögu nahia ba wangirö''ö bua nowigu?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 18, 'Ba imane: Da''ö ulau: Ududugö halasagu, ba segebua moroi ba da''ö ufazökhi, ba da''ö u''owuloi fefu mbua zinanögu ba hadia ia zi so khögu.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 19, 'Ba umane ba dödögu: No fahöna khöu mbalazo, ya''ugö tödögu, ha me uga fakhe lö ahori; honogö''ö, lau manga ba badu-badu hadia ia ba omusoi''ögö!', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 20, 'Ba imane khönia Lowalangi: He sambö era-era! bongi andre lahalö nosou, ba nihönamö andrö, ba ha ökhö möi?[7]', '["Sin 39:7; Yob 27:8"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 21, 'Si manö lala zangozaragö khönia ana''a, si lö ana''a ba khö Lowalangi.[8]', '["TimI 6:17; Sin 73:25 b.t."]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 22, 'Ba imane ba nifahaönia:[9] Andrö uŵa''ö khömi, böi mi''abusi tödö noso, hadia mbalazomi, ba böi mi''abusi tödö mboto, hadia nukhami.', '["Ayati 22-31: Mat 6:25-31"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 23, 'No ebua noso, moroi ba mbalazo, ba no ebua mboto, moroi ba nukha.', '["Ayati 22-31: Mat 6:25-31"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 24, 'Mitöngöni gaga, lö''ö sa manaru ira ba lö mamasi, lö khöra lou ba lö halasa, ba ibalazoi ira Lowalangi; tenga no aröu tohude ami moroi ba wofo?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 25, 'Ba ha niha ba khömi zangila mondrou''ö fa''anau nosonia samba si''u, na i''abusi tödö?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 26, 'Ba na tebai göi ami ba wondrege zide-ide, ba hana wa mi''abusi tödö danö bö''ö?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 27, 'Mitöngöni ladari mböhö andrö, lö''ö sa managu ba lö manoso; uŵa''ö khömi, lö''ö göi manö nukha Zelomo ba lakhöminia andrö fefu, si mane nukha zi sara da''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 28, 'Ba na imanö Lowalangi wamonukha du''u ba danö, si so ma''ökhö, nitibo''ö ba galitö mahemolu, ba tenga mendrua manö imanö khömi, sambö famati?', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 29, 'Ba ya''ami, ba böi mi''alui hadia ni''a, hadia nibadu, ba böi fawuka dödömi.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 30, 'Niha guli danö andre sa zangalui da''ö fefu, ba Amami andrö, ba no i''ila, wa soguna khömi da''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 31, 'Ba mi''alui mbanuania, ba tebe''e nönö-nönö khömi da''ö.', '[]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 32, 'Böi mi''ata''ufi, ya''ami, rorogöfö gubalo, si lö atoto; noa sa fa''omasi Nama, khömi dania mbanua andrö. [10]', '["Faigi 22:29; Yes 41:10,14"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 33, 'Mi''amawa zi so khömi, ba mibe''e ame''ela ba zi numana. Mi''asogö khömi mbola si tebai obou, awö girö-girö si lö ahori-hori, ba zorugo, si tebai irugi sanagö ba si lö ifakiko hama. [11]', '["Faigi 16:9; 18:22; Mat 6:19; Heb 10:34","TimI 6, 19"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 34, 'Ba zi so girö-girömi sa, ba da''ö göi so dödömi dania.[12]', '["Faigi 16:9; 18:22; Mat 6:19; Heb 10:34","TimI 6, 19"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 35, 'Böi aefa-aefa mböbö talu ba löwi-löwimi, ba böi mate-mate wandrumi, [13]', '["Efes 6:14; FetI 1:13; Mat 5:16","Mat 25:1-13"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 36, 'ya hulö niha sombalo-mbaloi sokhö ya''ira ami, na mangawuli ia moroi ba walöŵa, ena''ö i''anema''ö labokai khönia, na so ia, na ibökö mbawandruhö.[14]', '["Efes 6:14; FetI 1:13; Mat 5:16","Mat 25:1-13"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 37, 'Ya''ahowu zawuyu andrö, na lö mörö ira i''ila sokhö ya''ira, na so ia; si ndruhu niŵa''ögu khömi, molembe ia dania, ifedadao ira ba möi ia ngoni-ngonira.[15]', '["Mat 24:25 b. t"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 38, 'Ba na so ia, na no mörö niha ba ma na no aefa talu mbongi, ba na si manö zui, i''ila, ba ya''ahowu ira.[16] [17]', '["Mar 13:35","Ayati 39-46: Mat 24:43-51"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 39, 'Ba böi zi lö aboto ba dödömi da''ö: Na no i''ila ena''ö sokhö omo ha wa''alaŵa mbóngi so zanagö, ba lö ifa''amöi ba nomonia ena''ö.[18]', '["TesI 5:2"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 40, 'Ba ya''ami göi, mifa''anö ami, na lö midöna-döna sa dania so Nono Niha. [19]', '["Faigi 21:34-36"]', NULL),
  (3393937, 'NT', 'Luka', 12, 41, 'Ba imane khönia Fetero: He Tua, hadia, khöma öŵa''ö gamaedola andrö, ba ma ba khöra fefu göi?', '[]', NULL);

























































CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS "idx_bible_book_chapter" ON "bible" ("book", "chapter");
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS "idx_bible_category" ON "bible" ("category");
